INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3690,'https://reliefweb.int/report/yemen/yemen-agrometeorological-update-food-security-and-early-warning-information-system-01-30-september-2026-enar','https://reliefweb.int/report/yemen/yemen-agrometeorological-update-food-security-and-early-warning-information-system-01-30-september-2026-enar','Yemen Agrometeorological Update: Food Security and Early Warning Information System (01 - 30 September 2026) [EN/AR]','yemenagrometeorologicalupdatefoodsecurityandearlywarninginformationsystem01','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-22T10:39:06Z','2026-10-23T03:10:23Z','Country: Yemen Source: Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations Please refer to the attached files. HIGHLIGHTS Precipitation: In September, rainfall was concentrated over the western and southwestern highlands, with localized maxima in Taizz and Ibb. Despite a month-on-month increase relative to the five-year average, totals remained below the long-term average across most of Yemen. Rainfall anomalies: Widespread deficits exceeding 80 percent of the long-term average were observed across the highlands, coastal areas, and eastern regions. Temperature: Temperatures declined slight',3.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3691,'https://reliefweb.int/report/world/redefining-security-development-circuit-breakers-more-secure-future','https://reliefweb.int/report/world/redefining-security-development-circuit-breakers-more-secure-future','World: Redefining Security: Development Circuit Breakers for a More Secure Future','worldredefiningsecuritydevelopmentcircuitbreakersforamoresecurefuture','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-22T02:51:41Z','2026-10-23T03:10:23Z','Country: World Source: UN Development Programme Please refer to the attached file. New UNDP report calls for redefining security in an era of climate shocks, cybercrime, economic insecurity and distrust Development and security investments, pursued together to drive people''s safety and wellbeing, are an effective strategy for prevent New York and Bangkok, 22 October 2026 – Investments in trusted institutions, AI and digital safeguards, public health protections and disaster preparedness should be treated as essential security investments as interconnected shocks place growing pressure on the s',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3692,'https://reliefweb.int/report/world/humanitarian-funding-el-nino-critically-insufficient','https://reliefweb.int/report/world/humanitarian-funding-el-nino-critically-insufficient','World: Humanitarian funding to El Niño critically insufficient','worldhumanitarianfundingtoelninocriticallyinsufficient','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-22T01:33:05Z','2026-10-23T03:10:23Z','Countries: World, Algeria, Burkina Faso, Chad, El Salvador, Fiji, Guatemala, Honduras, Indonesia, Kenya, Mauritania, Morocco, Niger, occupied Palestinian territory, Papua New Guinea, Philippines, Somalia, South Sudan, Sri Lanka, Syrian Arab Republic, Timor-Leste, Tonga, Tunisia, Vanuatu Source: Oxfam Global funding for the preparation and response to El Niño and the harms it will bring to millions of people is critically insufficient, Oxfam warned today. The weather phenomenon is already having a catastrophic impact across much of the world, with wildfires, crop failures and growing severe foo',1.0,'classified',NULL,132);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3693,'https://reliefweb.int/report/world/la-financiacion-humanitaria-para-el-nino-es-gravemente-insuficiente','https://reliefweb.int/report/world/la-financiacion-humanitaria-para-el-nino-es-gravemente-insuficiente','World: La financiación humanitaria para El Niño es gravemente insuficiente','worldlafinanciacionhumanitariaparaelninoesgravementeinsuficiente','reliefweb_ew_es','ReliefWeb - Updates','es','2026-10-22T08:03:04Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','Countries: World, Algeria, Burundi, El Salvador, Ethiopia, Fiji, Guatemala, Honduras, Indonesia, Kenya, Morocco, Papua New Guinea, Somalia, South Sudan, Sri Lanka, Syrian Arab Republic, Tonga, Tunisia, Uganda Source: Oxfam La financiación mundial destinada a la preparación y la respuesta ante El Niño, que afectará amillones de personas es extremadamente insuficiente, advierte Oxfam Intermón. Este fenómeno meteorológico ya está teniendo un impacto catastrófico en gran parte del mundo, con incendios forestales, pérdidas de cosechas y una creciente y grave inseguridad alimentaria e hídrica. Se pr',3.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3694,'https://reliefweb.int/report/chile/chl-emergencia-compleja-10-2026-actualizacion-2-2026-10-22','https://reliefweb.int/report/chile/chl-emergencia-compleja-10-2026-actualizacion-2-2026-10-22','Chile: CHL: Emergencia compleja - 10-2026 - Actualización #2 (2026-10-22)','chilechlemergenciacompleja102026actualizacion220261022','reliefweb_ew_es','ReliefWeb - Updates','es','2026-10-22T03:50:05Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','Country: Chile Sources: Cruz Roja Chilena, International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies Please refer to the attached file. Descripción Región de Ñuble por evento meteorológico 21-10-2026 02:13 La Dirección Regional del SENAPRED mantiene la Alerta Temprana Preventiva Regional por evento meteorológico, que se encuentra vigente desde el 16 de octubre y hasta que las condiciones así lo ameriten. Esta alerta se constituye como un estado de reforzamiento de la vigilancia, mediante el monitoreo preciso y riguroso de las condiciones de riesgo y las respectivas vulnerabilidades asoc',4.0,'classified',NULL,134);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3695,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/we-must-prepare-entire-cities-extreme-heat-our-new-study-reveals-how','https://preventionweb.net/news/we-must-prepare-entire-cities-extreme-heat-our-new-study-reveals-how','We must prepare entire cities for extreme heat. Our new study reveals how','wemustprepareentirecitiesforextremeheatournewstudyrevealshow','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T17:50:03Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','In Australia, days are growing longer and summer is fast approaching. But a very strong El Niño could make this summer a sweltering one. New research examined how the Greater Sydney region is preparing for surging temperatures and more frequent heatwaves.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3696,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/invitation-photograpers-visualizing-indigenous-dri-solutions','https://preventionweb.net/news/invitation-photograpers-visualizing-indigenous-dri-solutions','Invitation to photograpers: Visualizing indigenous DRI solutions','invitationtophotograpersvisualizingindigenousdrisolutions','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T15:14:05Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','CDRI invites photographers to capture indigenous and traditional practices that have made communities resilient to natural hazards and to share the story of their resilience characteristics and impact.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3697,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/review-first-order-draft-working-group-ii-contribution-ipccs-seventh-assessment-report','https://preventionweb.net/news/review-first-order-draft-working-group-ii-contribution-ipccs-seventh-assessment-report','Review the first order draft of the Working Group II contribution to IPCC’s Seventh Assessment Report','reviewthefirstorderdraftoftheworkinggroupiicontributiontoipccsseventhassessmentreport','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T15:08:02Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','Registration is now open for experts to review the First Order Draft of the Working Group II contribution to IPCC’s Seventh Assessment Report on impacts, adaptation and vulnerability.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3698,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/our-atmosphere-and-climate-2026','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/our-atmosphere-and-climate-2026','Our atmosphere and climate 2026','ouratmosphereandclimate2026','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T14:48:49Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','This report presents an evidence-based assessment of New Zealand’s atmosphere and climate, highlighting record-high greenhouse gases and temperatures, increased weather extremes, and the urgent need for adaptation and resilience.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3699,'https://www.preventionweb.net/organization/island-security-policy-institute','https://preventionweb.net/organization/island-security-policy-institute','Island Security Policy Institute','islandsecuritypolicyinstitute','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T14:29:15Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','The Island Security Policy Institute (ISPI) is a nonprofit research organization founded in Honolulu, Hawaiʻi, in 2026. It publishes free research on public safety, emergency preparedness and security policy for island and coastal communities.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3700,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/watch-fire-brings-wildfire-information-analysis-and-risk-insights-together-communities','https://preventionweb.net/news/watch-fire-brings-wildfire-information-analysis-and-risk-insights-together-communities','Watch Fire brings wildfire information, analysis and risk insights together for communities worldwide','watchfirebringswildfireinformationanalysisandriskinsightstogetherforcommunitiesworldwide','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T14:03:40Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','The platform combines NASA fire observations with official reports where available. Users can follow locations through email alerts, explore background articles and contribute photographs or videos for review before publication.',2.0,'classified',NULL,138);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3701,'https://www.preventionweb.net/organization/watch-fire','https://preventionweb.net/organization/watch-fire','Watch Fire','watchfire','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T13:58:23Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','Watch Fire is a live worldwide wildfire map. See where fires are burning right now, whether a fire is still active, what is under threat nearby and what the coming hours may bring. Available in eleven languages and accessible to everyone.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3702,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/report-finds-building-wildfire-resilient-homes-costs-less-residents-expect','https://preventionweb.net/news/report-finds-building-wildfire-resilient-homes-costs-less-residents-expect','Report finds building wildfire-resilient homes costs less than residents expect','reportfindsbuildingwildfireresilienthomescostslessthanresidentsexpect','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T13:43:43Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','Integrating wildfire resilience into new construction is practical and economical, according to the report’s findings.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3703,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/cost-wildfire-resilient-construction-colorado','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/cost-wildfire-resilient-construction-colorado','The cost of wildfire-resilient construction in Colorado','thecostofwildfireresilientconstructionincolorado','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T13:42:51Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','This report assesses wildfire-resilient construction costs in Colorado, finding that adopting CWRC Class 1 or IBHS Essential standards increases costs minimally, while higher-tier pathways add moderate premiums focused on exterior components like decks.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3704,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/when-crises-disappear-view-growing-humanitarian-data-drought','https://preventionweb.net/news/when-crises-disappear-view-growing-humanitarian-data-drought','When crises disappear from view: The growing humanitarian data drought','whencrisesdisappearfromviewthegrowinghumanitariandatadrought','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T13:40:45Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','Compounding risks to global food system—ongoing conflicts, the most severe El Niño in decades, global trade disruptions—humanitarian data are disappearing. Budget cuts, shrinking development assistance, and competing priorities erode key streams of data.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3705,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/long-range-flood-outlook-strategic-preparedness-final-report','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/long-range-flood-outlook-strategic-preparedness-final-report','Long-range flood outlook for strategic preparedness - final report','longrangefloodoutlookforstrategicpreparedness','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T13:40:05Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','This report assesses feasibility of long-range flood outlooks for Australia using co-design with end users and BJP model to quantify and map flood likelihood, finding S2S forecasts enhance preparedness by identifying elevated risk weeks to months ahead.',2.0,'classified',NULL,137);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3706,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/well-being-losses-coastal-hazards','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/well-being-losses-coastal-hazards','Well-being losses from coastal hazards','wellbeinglossesfromcoastalhazards','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T13:38:59Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','This paper develops the Coastal Well-Being Loss Measurement Framework to capture nine domains of well-being losses from climatic hazards in Asia-Pacific coastal regions, highlighting the need for inclusive measurement beyond economic damage.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3707,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/salt-marshes-are-proving-be-powerful-allies-building-climate-resilient-coastline','https://preventionweb.net/news/salt-marshes-are-proving-be-powerful-allies-building-climate-resilient-coastline','Salt marshes are proving to be powerful allies in building a climate-resilient coastline','saltmarshesareprovingtobepowerfulalliesinbuildingaclimateresilientcoastline','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T13:37:18Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','An experiment found that salt marshes withstand extreme waves with minimal erosion, reducing wave energy and supporting coastal protection. Conserving and restoring marshes could strengthen dikes, cut costs and protect biodiversity amid climate change.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3708,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/wall-wind-engineers-blow-homes-apart-learn-how-save-them','https://preventionweb.net/news/wall-wind-engineers-blow-homes-apart-learn-how-save-them','At the Wall of Wind, engineers blow homes apart to learn how to save them','atthewallofwindengineersblowhomesaparttolearnhowtosavethem','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T13:37:08Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','Engineers are testing manufactured homes in extreme winds to identify affordable ways to prevent hurricane and tornado damage. Stronger anchoring systems could improve safety for millions of residents if adopted in national building standards.',2.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3709,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/hawaiis-pdc-and-samoa-strengthen-resilience-through-cooperative-risk-analysis','https://preventionweb.net/news/hawaiis-pdc-and-samoa-strengthen-resilience-through-cooperative-risk-analysis','Hawai‘i’s PDC and Samoa to strengthen resilience through cooperative risk analysis','hawaiispdcandsamoatostrengthenresiliencethroughcooperativeriskanalysis','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T13:36:36Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','As El Niño-driven drought and extreme weather threaten Pacific Island communities, Hawai‘i and Samoa partner on a disaster preparedness assessment to share knowledge and strengthen risk reduction, emergency readiness and resilience across the region.',2.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3710,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/climate-change-increases-gun-violence-incidents-united-states','https://preventionweb.net/news/climate-change-increases-gun-violence-incidents-united-states','Climate change increases gun violence incidents in the United States','climatechangeincreasesgunviolenceincidentsintheunitedstates','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T13:36:06Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','Higher temperatures are linked to more gun violence incidents across 100 U.S. cities. Rising temperatures driven by human-caused climate change can amplify the risk of aggressive and violent behavior and, in turn, increase the number of shootings.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3711,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/measuring-disaster-related-crop-losses-how-far-can-household-surveys-take-us-and-what-new','https://preventionweb.net/news/measuring-disaster-related-crop-losses-how-far-can-household-surveys-take-us-and-what-new','Measuring disaster-related crop losses: How far can household surveys take us, and what new research is needed?','measuringdisasterrelatedcroplosseshowfarcanhouseholdsurveystakeusandwhatnewresearchisneeded','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T13:35:38Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','Disaster-related crop losses are often underreported, leaving smallholder farmers vulnerable. Combining household surveys, satellite data and emerging AI tools can improve loss estimates, identify affected groups and strengthen agricultural resilience.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3712,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/rethinking-how-we-use-forecast-five-changes-strengthen-anticipatory-action-bangladesh','https://preventionweb.net/news/rethinking-how-we-use-forecast-five-changes-strengthen-anticipatory-action-bangladesh','Rethinking how we use forecast: Five changes to strengthen anticipatory action in Bangladesh','rethinkinghowweuseforecastfivechangestostrengthenanticipatoryactioninbangladesh','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T13:35:19Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','Better forecasts alone will not deliver early action. Local organizations need actionable risk information, stronger decision-support systems and strengthened capacity to act before disaster strikes.',3.0,'classified',NULL,136);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3713,'https://www.preventionweb.net/event/resilience-starts-home-connecting-science-technology-and-communities-through-early-warning','https://preventionweb.net/event/resilience-starts-home-connecting-science-technology-and-communities-through-early-warning','Resilience starts at home: Connecting science, technology and communities through early warning systems','resiliencestartsathomeconnectingsciencetechnologyandcommunitiesthroughearlywarningsystems','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T13:34:06Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','This webinar will explore how science, technology and innovation can strengthen people-centred, end-to-end, MHEWS, ensuring scientific advances translate into practical, inclusive and timely action to protect lives, livelihoods and essential services.',3.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3714,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/does-educational-status-influence-perceptions-collective','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/does-educational-status-influence-perceptions-collective','Does educational status influence perceptions of collective efficacy, social identification, and well-being in disasteraffected populations? evidence from District Srinagar, J&K','doeseducationalstatusinfluenceperceptionsofcollectiveefficacysocialidentificationandwellbeingindisasteraffectedpopulationsevidencefromdistrictsrinagarjk','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T13:03:56Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','This study aims to explore whether educational status (literate vs. illiterate) is associated with differences in perceptions of well-being in a disaster-affected population from District Srinagar, J&K, India',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3715,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/effects-extreme-temperature-and-rainfall-vulnerability-and','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/effects-extreme-temperature-and-rainfall-vulnerability-and','Effects of extreme temperature and rainfall on vulnerability and climate change resilience of electricity transmission infrastructure in Kajiado County, Kenya','effectsofextremetemperatureandrainfallonvulnerabilityandclimatechangeresilienceofelectricitytransmissioninfrastructureinkajiadocountykenya','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T12:49:52Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','This publication examines how extreme temperature and rainfall influence the vulnerability and climate change resilience of electricity transmission infrastructure in Kajiado County, Kenya.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3716,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/geneva-students-take-disaster-preparedness-home','https://preventionweb.net/news/geneva-students-take-disaster-preparedness-home','Geneva students take disaster preparedness home','genevastudentstakedisasterpreparednesshome','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T10:31:49Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','A hands-on experience of disaster risk reduction helps equip the next generation for a resilient future.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3717,'https://www.preventionweb.net/drr-community-voices/hospitals-have-disaster-plans-so-why-dont-staff-read-them-0','https://preventionweb.net/drr-community-voices/hospitals-have-disaster-plans-so-why-dont-staff-read-them-0','Hospitals have disaster plans. So why don''t staff read them?','hospitalshavedisasterplanssowhydontstaffreadthem','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-22T08:10:37Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','Author finds Greek hospital staff lack access to and training on disaster plans. The article calls for regular practical drills, dedicated preparedness officers, hospital vulnerability assessments and measurable readiness to strengthen emergency response.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3718,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/inclusive-climate-resilience-practice-how-climate-resilient','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/inclusive-climate-resilience-practice-how-climate-resilient','Inclusive climate resilience in practice: How climate-resilient farming is shaping gender-equitable outcomes in flood-prone India','inclusiveclimateresilienceinpracticehowclimateresilientfarmingisshapinggenderequitableoutcomesinfloodproneindia','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-21T19:52:40Z','2026-10-23T03:10:24Z','This publication reports on an initiative that demonstrates how adaptation can go beyond reducing climate risk to address underlying social inequalities.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
