INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4232,'https://reliefweb.int/report/uganda/east-horn-and-southern-africa-transhumance-tracking-tool-parts-karamoja-cluster-igad-cluster-1-october-2026','https://reliefweb.int/report/uganda/east-horn-and-southern-africa-transhumance-tracking-tool-parts-karamoja-cluster-igad-cluster-1-october-2026','Uganda: East, Horn, and Southern Africa — Transhumance Tracking Tool — Parts of the Karamoja Cluster (IGAD Cluster 1) October 2026','ugandaeasthornandsouthernafricatranshumancetrackingtool','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-23T12:06:43Z','2026-10-24T03:04:56Z','Countries: Uganda, Kenya Source: International Organization for Migration Please refer to the attached Infographic. Cross-border mobility of people and livestock remains a critical adaptive strategy across the East and Horn of Africa, notably in arid and semi-arid lands where pastoral communities’ transboundary movement is common. In the Intergovernmental Authority on Development (IGAD) Protocol on Transhumance it is underscored that pastoralism is essential for safeguarding and increasing production and productivity of livestock and crops in response to climate change, variability and the pre',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4233,'https://reliefweb.int/report/world/eu-civil-protection-mechanism-turns-25','https://reliefweb.int/report/world/eu-civil-protection-mechanism-turns-25','World: EU civil protection mechanism turns 25','worldeucivilprotectionmechanismturns25','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-23T10:03:06Z','2026-10-24T03:04:56Z','Country: World Source: European Commission''s Directorate-General for European Civil Protection and Humanitarian Aid Operations For 25 years, European countries have been joining forces to save lives when disasters strike under the EU civil protection mechanism . This is one of the best examples of European solidarity in action. Ursula von der Leyen , President of the European Commission, said: ''Our EU Civil Protection Mechanism turns 25! 25 years of solidarity in action - fighting floods and wildfires to delivering vital medical supplies. More than 900 times worldwide, Europe has answered the ',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4234,'https://reliefweb.int/report/malawi/wfp-malawi-country-brief-october-2026','https://reliefweb.int/report/malawi/wfp-malawi-country-brief-october-2026','WFP Malawi Country Brief, October 2026','wfpmalawicountrybriefoctober2026','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-23T06:41:09Z','2026-10-24T03:04:56Z','Country: Malawi Source: World Food Programme Please refer to the attached file. In September, WFP assisted 409,294 people in Malawi, distributing 136 mt of food and USD 2.4 million in cash assistance. WFP continued supporting over 64,000 refugees and asylum seekers in Dzaleka Refugee Camp while strengthening protection systems ahead of a transition to targeted assistance. WFP also provided home-grown school meals to 161,233 learners in 173 schools and supported a nationwide review of the School Health and Nutrition Policy. To strengthen resilience and food systems, WFP launched a contract farm',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4235,'https://reliefweb.int/report/rwanda/wfp-rwanda-country-brief-october-2026','https://reliefweb.int/report/rwanda/wfp-rwanda-country-brief-october-2026','WFP Rwanda Country Brief, October 2026','wfprwandacountrybriefoctober2026','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-23T06:39:37Z','2026-10-24T03:04:56Z','Country: Rwanda Source: World Food Programme Please refer to the attached file. In September, WFP assisted 185,528 people across Rwanda, distributing 300 mt of food and USD 521,734 in cash-based assistance. Refugee response remained the core operation, reaching 117,261 refugees, asylum seekers and returnees, though rations remained at 50 percent due to funding constrains. WFP also completed comprehensive socio-economic profiling in all refugee camps to inform future targeting and graduation pathways. At the same time, WFP strengthened national preparedness for floods, drought and Ebola risks, ',3.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4236,'https://www.preventionweb.net/vacancy/developing-handbook-working-groups-strengthening-disaster-resilient-local-governance-kerala','https://preventionweb.net/vacancy/developing-handbook-working-groups-strengthening-disaster-resilient-local-governance-kerala','Developing a Handbook for Working Groups for Strengthening Disaster-Resilient Local Governance in Kerala','developingahandbookforworkinggroupsforstrengtheningdisasterresilientlocalgovernanceinkerala','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T14:39:28Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','The State Steering Committee recommended that a Handbook for Working Groups LSGs should be developed to facilitate effective integration of disaster and climate risks into local development processes.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4237,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/effects-extreme-temperature-exposure-learning','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/effects-extreme-temperature-exposure-learning','Effects of extreme temperature exposure on learning','effectsofextremetemperatureexposureonlearning','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T14:35:40Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','This paper analyzes how sustained exposure to extreme temperatures negatively impacts Cambodian students’ national exam performance, among social science students, females, and rural students, highlighting the need for adaptation in education systems.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4238,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/foundation-stone-indias-first-ever-emergency-animal-evacuation-shelter-wayanad-laid-0','https://preventionweb.net/news/foundation-stone-indias-first-ever-emergency-animal-evacuation-shelter-wayanad-laid-0','Foundation stone of India’s first-ever emergency animal evacuation shelter in Wayanad laid by the Agriculture Minister, Shri Adv. T Siddique','foundationstoneofindiasfirsteveremergencyanimalevacuationshelterinwayanadlaidbytheagricultureministershriadvtsiddique','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:56:37Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','Humane World for Animals India and government partners will build a facility dedicated to disaster preparedness, emergency response and animal protection needs during floods and landslides.',4.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4239,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/daily-weather-extremes-glacier-models-reveal-greater-ice-loss-and-faster-sea-level-rise','https://preventionweb.net/news/daily-weather-extremes-glacier-models-reveal-greater-ice-loss-and-faster-sea-level-rise','Daily weather extremes in glacier models reveal greater ice loss and faster sea-level rise','dailyweatherextremesinglaciermodelsrevealgreatericelossandfastersealevelrise','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:47:30Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','Running a global glacier model at daily rather than monthly resolution across more than 12,500 glaciers reproduces observed mass loss better and projects a 5 to 10 per cent larger glacier contribution to 21st-century sea-level rise.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4240,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/after-fire-three-years-what-maui-wildfire-reveals-about','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/after-fire-three-years-what-maui-wildfire-reveals-about','After the fire: Three years on — what the Maui wildfire reveals about emergency management policy for island communities','afterthefirethreeyearsonwhatthemauiwildfirerevealsaboutemergencymanagementpolicyforislandcommunities','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:41:13Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','This commentary examines emergency management failures exposed by the Lahaina wildfire and recommends assessing vulnerable communities, establishing 30-day emergency supply reserves and integrating the fire into Hawaiʻi’s emergency management plans.',1.0,'classified',NULL,151);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4241,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/maui-wildfire-emergency-management-reform-three-years-after','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/maui-wildfire-emergency-management-reform-three-years-after','Maui wildfire emergency management reform: Three years after Lahaina — An independent assessment of framework reform progress and remaining gaps','mauiwildfireemergencymanagementreformthreeyearsafterlahainaanindependentassessmentofframeworkreformprogressandremaininggaps','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:40:52Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','This research report assesses emergency management reform after the Lahaina wildfire, identifying four framework failures and recommending island-specific reviews, compliance standards and response-time assessments.',1.0,'classified',NULL,151);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4242,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/when-ocean-comes-inland-tsunami-preparedness-policy-pacific','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/when-ocean-comes-inland-tsunami-preparedness-policy-pacific','When the ocean comes inland: Tsunami preparedness policy for Pacific island and Hawaii coastal communities — What the warning systems miss','whentheoceancomesinlandtsunamipreparednesspolicyforpacificislandandhawaiicoastalcommunities','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:40:14Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','This commentary examines how tsunami warnings translate into evacuation in Pacific Island and Hawaiʻi coastal communities, recommending multilingual alerts, evacuation route analysis, and community-based preparedness programmes.',6.0,'classified',NULL,150);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4243,'https://www.preventionweb.net/resource/case-study/sri-lanka-managing-landslide-risk-and-planned-relocation-kegalle-district','https://preventionweb.net/resource/case-study/sri-lanka-managing-landslide-risk-and-planned-relocation-kegalle-district','Sri Lanka: Managing landslide risk and planned relocation in Kegalle District','srilankamanaginglandslideriskandplannedrelocationinkegalledistrict','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:36:40Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','Around 20 per cent of Sri Lanka’s land is susceptible to landslides. This case study looks at how Kegalle District combines risk mapping, mitigation works, resettlement and community awareness after Cyclone Ditwah displaced thousands.',3.0,'classified',NULL,149);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4244,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/shelter-after-disasters-australia','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/shelter-after-disasters-australia','Shelter after disasters in Australia','shelterafterdisastersinaustralia','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:35:47Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','This study examines 2 major events of the summer bushfires during 2019–20 and the severe floods in new south Wales in 2022, and explores the outcomes of investments and efforts into shelter provision after disasters in Australia.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4245,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/hazard-impact-information-has-greatest-effect-how-people-respond-alerts','https://preventionweb.net/news/hazard-impact-information-has-greatest-effect-how-people-respond-alerts','Hazard impact information has the greatest effect on how people respond to alerts','hazardimpactinformationhasthegreatesteffectonhowpeoplerespondtoalerts','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:35:09Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','An experiment comparing a complete warning message with versions each missing one element found hazard impact had the greatest effect on understanding, belief, personalisation and decision-making – more than the hazard name or guidance.',2.0,'classified',NULL,109);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4246,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/bracing-el-nino-impacts-risks-and-response-philippines','https://preventionweb.net/news/bracing-el-nino-impacts-risks-and-response-philippines','Bracing for El Niño: impacts, risks and response in the Philippines','bracingforelninoimpactsrisksandresponseinthephilippines','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:34:55Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','PAGASA has warned of a “very strong” El Niño peaking in December and persisting through the first half of 2027, bringing dry spells and drought to most of the Philippines while the monsoon brings flooding to the west.',4.0,'classified',NULL,148);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4247,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/drought-resilience-why-we-need-it-and-how-build-it','https://preventionweb.net/news/drought-resilience-why-we-need-it-and-how-build-it','Drought resilience: why we need it and how to build it','droughtresiliencewhyweneeditandhowtobuildit','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:34:47Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','For the world’s rivers 2025 was one of the driest years in more than three decades. UNEP sets out what drought is doing to households and ecosystems, and the adaptation measures – from Sri Lankan tank cascades to zai pits in Niger – that reduce the risk.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4248,'https://www.preventionweb.net/resource/case-study/sierra-leone-gender-responsive-and-inclusive-responses-climate-migration','https://preventionweb.net/resource/case-study/sierra-leone-gender-responsive-and-inclusive-responses-climate-migration','Sierra Leone: Gender-responsive and inclusive responses to climate migration in Freetown','sierraleonegenderresponsiveandinclusiveresponsestoclimatemigrationinfreetown','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:32:25Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','In Freetown, over 90 per cent of working hours happen outside climate-controlled conditions and most market traders are migrant women. This case study shows how the city plans around migration and informal settlement growth rather than against them.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4249,'https://www.preventionweb.net/resource/case-study/malawi-localising-climate-mobility-data-early-warning-and-planning-mzuzu','https://preventionweb.net/resource/case-study/malawi-localising-climate-mobility-data-early-warning-and-planning-mzuzu','Malawi: Localising climate mobility data for early warning and planning in Mzuzu','malawilocalisingclimatemobilitydataforearlywarningandplanninginmzuzu','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:31:44Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','Flood-prone wards in Mzuzu were receiving warnings 24 to 48 hours late. This case study describes how 30 community monitors in three wards now collect monthly data on rainfall, flood points, new arrivals and service gaps.',5.0,'classified',NULL,147);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4250,'https://www.preventionweb.net/resource/case-study/india-monitoring-gender-and-social-inclusion-climate-related-urban-migration','https://preventionweb.net/resource/case-study/india-monitoring-gender-and-social-inclusion-climate-related-urban-migration','India: Monitoring gender and social inclusion in climate-related urban migration in Jaipur','indiamonitoringgenderandsocialinclusioninclimaterelatedurbanmigrationinjaipur','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:29:33Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','Almost a third of surveyed households in Rajasthan gave drought as a reason for migrating, and Jaipur’s groundwater table has fallen 25 metres in a decade. This case study describes the community-driven Suraksha Lens risk platform.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4251,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/understanding-interest-based-conflict-disaster-recovery','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/understanding-interest-based-conflict-disaster-recovery','Understanding interest-based conflict in disaster recovery collaborations','understandinginterestbasedconflictindisasterrecoverycollaborations','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:25:07Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','This study examines conflict in disaster recovery collaborations in Australia, identifying psychological, procedural, and substantive interests as key drivers, and suggests reframing conflict as an opportunity to improve decision-making.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4252,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/countries-need-establish-structures-turn-climate-health-goals-impact','https://preventionweb.net/news/countries-need-establish-structures-turn-climate-health-goals-impact','Countries need to establish structures to turn climate–health goals into impact','countriesneedtoestablishstructurestoturnclimatehealthgoalsintoimpact','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:20:31Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','Most national climate adaptation plans talk about health – but there are gaps in structures and investment to achieve this crucial strand of climate policy. Policy needs to be translated into action.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4253,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/protecting-vulnerable-families-grenada-climate-crisis','https://preventionweb.net/news/protecting-vulnerable-families-grenada-climate-crisis','Protecting vulnerable families in Grenada from the climate crisis','protectingvulnerablefamiliesingrenadafromtheclimatecrisis','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:19:44Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','Grenada’s climate finance project provides low-income households and communities with affordable loans and grants to strengthen homes, prevent landslides and manage drought. Revolving fund builds long-term resilience, especially for vulnerable families.',2.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4254,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/pacific-prepared-podcast-everything-gone-impacts-el-nino-are-being-felt-parts-papua-new-guinea','https://preventionweb.net/news/pacific-prepared-podcast-everything-gone-impacts-el-nino-are-being-felt-parts-papua-new-guinea','Pacific Prepared Podcast: ''Everything is gone''; the impacts of El Niño are being felt in parts of Papua New Guinea where people are relying on non-traditional food crops','pacificpreparedpodcasteverythingisgonetheimpactsofelninoarebeingfeltinpartsofpapuanewguineawherepeoplearerelyingonnontraditionalfoodcrops','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T13:13:38Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','The podcast explains how the dry conditions have forced people to rely on non-traditional food crops for food.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4255,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/community-based-flood-management-djibouti-practical-manual','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/community-based-flood-management-djibouti-practical-manual','Community-based flood management in Djibouti: A practical manual for local preparedness and respons','communitybasedfloodmanagementindjiboutiapracticalmanualforlocalpreparednessandrespons','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T12:41:10Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','This manual provides practical guidance for strengthening community-based flood risk management in Djibouti. It aims to help local communities reduce their vulnerability to flooding and strengthen their capacity to prepare, respond and recover from flood.',3.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4256,'https://www.preventionweb.net/vacancy/anticipatory-action-expert-consultant-karamoja-strong-programme','https://preventionweb.net/vacancy/anticipatory-action-expert-consultant-karamoja-strong-programme','Anticipatory Action Expert (Consultant) – Karamoja Strong Programme','anticipatoryactionexpertconsultant','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T12:37:17Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','The consultant will be Samuel Hall''s technical lead on anticipatory action and PSP/ITK in the programme''s final year.',2.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4257,'https://www.preventionweb.net/organization/samuel-hall','https://preventionweb.net/organization/samuel-hall','Samuel Hall','samuelhall','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T12:36:45Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','Samuel Hall is a social enterprise that conducts research, evaluates programmes and designs policies in contexts of migration and displacement, with offices in Nairobi and across East Africa.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4258,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/knowledge-action-geneva-hosts-first-global-un-event-risk-communication','https://preventionweb.net/news/knowledge-action-geneva-hosts-first-global-un-event-risk-communication','From knowledge to action: Geneva hosts first global UN event on risk communication','fromknowledgetoactiongenevahostsfirstglobaluneventonriskcommunication','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T12:20:08Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','On this year’s International Day for Disaster Risk Reduction, UNDRR, UNESCO and IFRC explored how reliable information, resilient media and local knowledge help communities understand risks and prepare for disasters.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4259,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/sweden-disaster-risk-data-system-assessment-and-roadmap','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/sweden-disaster-risk-data-system-assessment-and-roadmap','Sweden disaster risk data system assessment and roadmap','swedendisasterriskdatasystemassessmentandroadmap','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T12:09:48Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','This report assesses Sweden’s disaster risk data system. It draws on desk research, stakeholder consultations with government agencies, research institutions, and private sector actors, as well as a review of existing data flows.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4260,'https://www.preventionweb.net/organization/commonwealth','https://preventionweb.net/organization/commonwealth','The Commonwealth','thecommonwealth','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T11:59:20Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','The Commonwealth is a voluntary association of 56 independent and equal countries. Their member governments have agreed to shared goals like development, democracy and peace.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4261,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/seismic-assessment-unreinforced-masonry-facades-images-using','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/seismic-assessment-unreinforced-masonry-facades-images-using','Seismic assessment of unreinforced masonry façades from images using macroelement-based modeling','seismicassessmentofunreinforcedmasonryfacadesfromimagesusingmacroelementbasedmodeling','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T11:50:51Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','This study presents an image-based framework for rapid seismic assessment of unreinforced masonry façades using computer vision, photogrammetry, and semantic segmentation to automate 3D modeling and vulnerability analysis from multi-view RGB images.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4262,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/coca-cola-foundation-world-vision-and-visionfund-announce-launch-shock-responsive-inclusive','https://preventionweb.net/news/coca-cola-foundation-world-vision-and-visionfund-announce-launch-shock-responsive-inclusive','The Coca-Cola Foundation, World Vision, and VisionFund announce launch of Shock-Responsive Inclusive Market Systems (SIMS) initiative in Malawi and Zambia','thecocacolafoundationworldvisionandvisionfundannouncelaunchofshockresponsiveinclusivemarketsystemssimsinitiativeinmalawiandzambia','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T11:28:46Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','An initiative by World Vision and VisionFund with catalytic support from The Coca-Cola Foundation, SIMS responds to growing climate pressures by helping protect local enterprises, markets and economic opportunity in Malawi and Zambia.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4263,'https://www.preventionweb.net/event/58th-online-course-climate-time-series-analysis','https://preventionweb.net/event/58th-online-course-climate-time-series-analysis','58th Online Course in Climate Time Series Analysis','58thonlinecourseinclimatetimeseriesanalysis','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T10:57:32Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','The course is designed particularly for postdocs and advanced PhD students working with climate extremes, hazards, risk assessment and related environmental time series.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4264,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/fragmentation-coordination-governing-urban-heat-risks','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/fragmentation-coordination-governing-urban-heat-risks','From fragmentation to coordination? Governing urban heat risks in Greater Sydney','fromfragmentationtocoordinationgoverningurbanheatrisksingreatersydney','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T10:52:13Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','This paper examines the formation of the Greater Sydney Heat Taskforce and the co-design of Greater Sydney’s inaugural Heat Smart City Plan as a case through which to interrogate broader challenges in urban climate governance.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4265,'https://www.preventionweb.net/organization/urban-studies-sage','https://preventionweb.net/organization/urban-studies-sage','Urban Studies (Sage)','urbanstudiessage','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T10:51:09Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','Urban Studies is the leading international journal for urban scholarship.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4266,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/app-puts-bushfire-preparedness-action','https://preventionweb.net/news/app-puts-bushfire-preparedness-action','App puts bushfire preparedness into action','appputsbushfirepreparednessintoaction','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T10:37:41Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','Most natural-hazard apps tell people what is happening during an emergency. Fewer than one in five help them prepare beforehand.',2.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4267,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/frances-summer-wildfires-could-cost-insurers-563-mln-euros','https://preventionweb.net/news/frances-summer-wildfires-could-cost-insurers-563-mln-euros','France''s summer wildfires could cost insurers up to 563 mln euros','francessummerwildfirescouldcostinsurersupto563mlneuros','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T10:27:10Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','Wildfires that swept through France this summer resulted in around 22,500 insurance claims, with total losses estimated at up to 563 million euros ($634 million), the federation of insurers said on Friday.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4268,'https://www.preventionweb.net/drr-community-voices/nigerias-progress-inclusive-disaster-risk-reduction-under-sendai-framework','https://preventionweb.net/drr-community-voices/nigerias-progress-inclusive-disaster-risk-reduction-under-sendai-framework','Nigeria’s progress on inclusive disaster risk reduction under the Sendai Framework','nigeriasprogressoninclusivedisasterriskreductionunderthesendaiframework','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-23T10:26:58Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','Nigeria has built a real policy foundation for disaster risk reduction. But, the lived experience of women and children during the 2022 and 2024 floods shows that having policies on paper is not the same as protection reaching the people who need it most.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
