INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6491,'https://reliefweb.int/report/vanuatu/vanuatu-anticipatory-action-framework-tropical-cyclones','https://reliefweb.int/report/vanuatu/vanuatu-anticipatory-action-framework-tropical-cyclones','Vanuatu Anticipatory Action Framework: Tropical Cyclones','vanuatuanticipatoryactionframeworktropicalcyclones','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-28T21:21:56Z','2026-10-29T04:10:15Z','Country: Vanuatu Source: UN Office for the Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs Please refer to the attached file. Executive Summary Context: Vanuatu, a Small Island Developing State, is among the world''s most disaster‑prone countries, ranking 20th most vulnerable on the ND‑Gain Index. The population faces frequent hazards, including tropical cyclones, earthquakes, tsunamis, volcanic eruptions, drought, and sea‑level rise, compounded by limited resources and geographic dispersion. Cyclones are the most predictable of these threats, with two to three striking annually. Recent events demonstrate',3.0,'classified',NULL,217);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6492,'https://reliefweb.int/report/world/global-weather-hazards-summary-october-29-2026-november-4-2026','https://reliefweb.int/report/world/global-weather-hazards-summary-october-29-2026-november-4-2026','World: Global Weather Hazards Summary, October 29, 2026 – November 4, 2026','worldglobalweatherhazardssummaryoctober292026','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-28T20:33:08Z','2026-10-29T04:10:15Z','Country: World Source: Famine Early Warning System Network Please refer to the attached file. Global Overview : El Niño continues to strengthen. High risk of flooding in parts of equatorial Africa, Central America, Hispaniola, and Colombia. Africa Weather Hazards Abnormal heat is forecast in the eastern Sahel; High risks of flooding with ongoing heavy rain in the horn of Africa. 1) Inundation in the Sudd wetlands of South Sudan persists. 2) Large 90-day rainfall deficits led to abnormal dryness across southern Sudan, South Sudan, Uganda and western Kenya. Additionally, deteriorated vegetation ',8.0,'classified',NULL,216);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6493,'https://reliefweb.int/report/world/recognizing-reproductive-violence-within-women-peace-and-security-agenda','https://reliefweb.int/report/world/recognizing-reproductive-violence-within-women-peace-and-security-agenda','World: Recognizing reproductive violence within the Women, Peace and Security agenda','worldrecognizingreproductiveviolencewithinthewomenpeaceandsecurityagenda','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-28T14:03:07Z','2026-10-29T04:10:15Z','Country: World Source: UN Women Please refer to the attached file. The Women, Peace and Security (WPS) agenda has strengthened international efforts to prevent and respond to conflict-related sexual violence (CRSV) . This research paper examines why it must also recognize reproductive violence as a distinct form of gender-based violence and address it across all four WPS pillars: prevention, protection, participation, and relief and recovery. Reproductive violence involves acts or omissions that interfere with reproductive autonomy and rights, or target people because of their actual or percei',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6494,'https://reliefweb.int/report/world/undrr-advances-climate-resilience-early-warning-systems-and-risk-informed-water-management-cairo-water-week-2026','https://reliefweb.int/report/world/undrr-advances-climate-resilience-early-warning-systems-and-risk-informed-water-management-cairo-water-week-2026','World: UNDRR advances climate resilience, early warning systems, and risk-informed water management at Cairo Water Week 2026','worldundrradvancesclimateresilienceearlywarningsystemsandriskinformedwatermanagementatcairowaterweek2026','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-28T11:33:06Z','2026-10-29T04:10:15Z','Country: World Source: UN Office for Disaster Risk Reduction The United Nations Office for Disaster Risk Reduction (UNDRR) contributed its expertise in disaster risk knowledge, early warning systems, and risk-informed governance to Cairo Water Week 2026, emphasizing the importance of connecting climate and water-related information with decisions that strengthen preparedness and community resilience. Across two days, UNDRR engaged with regional and international partners to advance people-centred climate action, sustainable water management, and integrated approaches to disaster risk reduction',4.0,'classified',NULL,209);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6495,'https://reliefweb.int/report/afghanistan/afghanistan-community-perspectives-early-flood-warning-and-preparedness-acaps-thematic-report-28-october-2026','https://reliefweb.int/report/afghanistan/afghanistan-community-perspectives-early-flood-warning-and-preparedness-acaps-thematic-report-28-october-2026','Afghanistan: Community perspectives on early flood warning and preparedness (ACAPS Thematic Report 28 October 2026)','afghanistancommunityperspectivesonearlyfloodwarningandpreparednessacapsthematicreport28october2026','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-28T09:33:07Z','2026-10-29T04:10:15Z','Country: Afghanistan Source: ACAPS Please refer to the attached file. ABOUT THIS REPORT Aim This report examines how people in four flood-prone provinces of Afghanistan access early flood warnings, their capacity to act, and the level of community preparedness. Drawing on lived experiences and communities’ expressed gaps, needs, and capacities, the report aims to provide locally grounded insights to inform the design of inclusive, protection-sensitive flood risk mitigation and early recovery operations ahead of the 2026–2027 winter and spring flood season, which is expected to be particularly ',6.0,'classified',NULL,208);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6496,'https://reliefweb.int/report/south-sudan/who-weekly-situation-update-ongoing-health-emergency-events-south-sudan-week-43-date-19-25-oct-2026','https://reliefweb.int/report/south-sudan/who-weekly-situation-update-ongoing-health-emergency-events-south-sudan-week-43-date-19-25-oct-2026','WHO Weekly Situation Update on Ongoing Health Emergency Events in South Sudan - Week #43, Date: 19 – 25 Oct 2026','whoweeklysituationupdateonongoinghealthemergencyeventsinsouthsudanweek43date19','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-28T06:52:44Z','2026-10-29T04:10:15Z','Countries: South Sudan, Democratic Republic of the Congo, Kenya, Nigeria Source: World Health Organization Please refer to the attached file. PRIORITY ACTIONS ▸ Sustain BVD preparedness across the 15 priority counties as DRC reaches 9,964 cases and 4,851 deaths; maintain PoE screening (54,602 over 25–26 Oct) and screen air arrivals at Juba International Airport as Kenya releases contacts and Nigeria medevacs its imported case. ▸ Operationalize the WHO El Niño health plan (1 Nov–30 Apr): pre-position cholera kits, ORS, RDTs and reagents across five hubs, train 13 RRTs by 31 December, and act on',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6497,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/policies-and-plans/eu-framework-climate-resilience-resilient-europe-changing-climate','https://preventionweb.net/publication/policies-and-plans/eu-framework-climate-resilience-resilient-europe-changing-climate','EU framework for climate resilience: A resilient Europe for a changing climate','euframeworkforclimateresiliencearesilienteuropeforachangingclimate','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-28T15:46:55Z','2026-10-29T04:10:16Z','This communication sets out the EU Framework for Climate Resilience, proposing coordinated climate-risk assessments, strategic plans, investment and tools to help governments, businesses and communities anticipate and manage climate impacts.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6498,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/worst-case-persistent-rainfall-scenario-stress-testing-bangkoks-urban-flood-resilience','https://preventionweb.net/news/worst-case-persistent-rainfall-scenario-stress-testing-bangkoks-urban-flood-resilience','Worst-case persistent rainfall scenario: stress-testing Bangkok’s urban flood resilience','worstcasepersistentrainfallscenariostresstestingbangkoksurbanfloodresilience','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-28T15:43:39Z','2026-10-29T04:10:16Z','Bangkok’s September flooding exposed a gap between forecasts and action: despite advance warnings, preparedness lagged. Lack of unified command to integrate information, coordinate agencies and guide timely decisions appears to have weakened the response.',4.0,'classified',NULL,215);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6499,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/when-climate-bites-back','https://preventionweb.net/news/when-climate-bites-back','When the climate bites back','whentheclimatebitesback','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-28T14:16:02Z','2026-10-29T04:10:16Z','Climate change threatens aviation through extreme heat, turbulence, storms, flooding and shifting wind patterns, affecting aircraft performance, airport infrastructure and flight operations. The sector must adapt to maintain safe, efficient travel.',2.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6500,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/knowing-where-climate-hazards-occur-only-half-story','https://preventionweb.net/news/knowing-where-climate-hazards-occur-only-half-story','Knowing where climate hazards occur is only half the story','knowingwhereclimatehazardsoccurisonlyhalfthestory','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-28T14:15:40Z','2026-10-29T04:10:16Z','Climate hazards affect over half the world’s population, but vulnerability varies widely. In 2024, 1.5 billion people were both exposed to climate-related hazards and highly vulnerable to their impacts, limiting their ability to cope and recover.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6501,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/extreme-heat-worsens-renters-are-gaining-right-cooling','https://preventionweb.net/news/extreme-heat-worsens-renters-are-gaining-right-cooling','As extreme heat worsens, renters are gaining a ‘right to cooling’','asextremeheatworsensrentersaregainingarighttocooling','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-28T14:15:31Z','2026-10-29T04:10:16Z','New laws are treating cooling as a necessity rather than a luxury, though what landlords must provide varies widely.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6502,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/cascading-ice-rock-avalanche-multi-hazard-early-warning','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/cascading-ice-rock-avalanche-multi-hazard-early-warning','Cascading ice–rock avalanche multi-hazard early warning in the Bhote Koshi–Trishuli River Corridor','cascadingicerockavalanchemultihazardearlywarninginthebhotekoshitrishulirivercorridor','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-28T14:11:46Z','2026-10-29T04:10:16Z','This article reconstructs the 26 August 2026 Bhote Koshi-Trishuli cascade in Nepal, analyzes downstream propagation, & evaluates early warning system elements, proposing a two-stage framework for hazard detection & emergency response in mountain corridors',5.0,'classified',NULL,213);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6503,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/nine-examples-tsunami-readiness-turning-warnings-life-saving-action','https://preventionweb.net/news/nine-examples-tsunami-readiness-turning-warnings-life-saving-action','Nine examples of tsunami readiness – turning warnings into life-saving action','nineexamplesoftsunamireadinessturningwarningsintolifesavingaction','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-28T14:09:48Z','2026-10-29T04:10:16Z','A tsunami can reach the coast within minutes of an earthquake or other sudden disturbance, sometimes before any official alert. What people already know, and what they do in those first minutes, often decides who survives.',4.0,'classified',NULL,211);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6504,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/climate-change-growing-health-emergency-lancet-countdown-warns','https://preventionweb.net/news/climate-change-growing-health-emergency-lancet-countdown-warns','Climate change is a growing health emergency, Lancet Countdown warns','climatechangeisagrowinghealthemergencylancetcountdownwarns','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-28T14:07:01Z','2026-10-29T04:10:16Z','Ahead of COP31, the latest Lancet Countdown report finds that the health impacts of climate change are accelerating, with heat-related deaths, drought and other climate-related risks increasing faster than a decade ago.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6505,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/climate-and-health-competency-framework-common-reference','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/climate-and-health-competency-framework-common-reference','Climate and health competency framework: a common reference for strengthening competencies across government','climateandhealthcompetencyframeworkacommonreferenceforstrengtheningcompetenciesacrossgovernment','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-28T14:01:12Z','2026-10-29T04:10:16Z','This Climate and Health Competency Framework defines the essential competencies needed for climate–health action across ministries, sectors, and functions of government.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6506,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/young-people-most-likely-act-weather-warnings-after-record-summer','https://preventionweb.net/news/young-people-most-likely-act-weather-warnings-after-record-summer','Young people most likely to act on weather warnings after record summer','youngpeoplemostlikelytoactonweatherwarningsafterrecordsummer','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-28T13:54:23Z','2026-10-29T04:10:16Z','Young adults are shown to be more likely than any other generation to take action and prepare for upcoming severe weather.',1.0,'classified',NULL,210);
