INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6926,'https://reliefweb.int/report/haiti/haiti-cadre-daction-anticipatoire-tempetesouragans','https://reliefweb.int/report/haiti/haiti-cadre-daction-anticipatoire-tempetesouragans','Haiti: Haïti: Cadre d’Action Anticipatoire Tempêtes/Ouragans','haitihaiticadredactionanticipatoiretempetesouragans','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-29T16:59:36Z','2026-10-30T04:09:02Z','Country: Haiti Source: UN Office for the Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs Please refer to the attached file. Executive Summary Context: Ranked first in the global climate risk index and third in the long-term climate risk index, Haiti is at the forefront of climate vulnerability, according to the United Nations Development Programme (UNDP).¹ Some 96 per cent of Haiti’s population is exposed to a wide range of climate-related hazards,² including increasingly intense and frequent cyclonic systems. The Atlantic hurricane season runs from 1 June to 30 November. To ensure that potential storms ',1.0,'classified',NULL,224);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6927,'https://reliefweb.int/report/world/el-nino-preparedness-response-situation-update-issued-impaact-program-issue-no-1-october-2026','https://reliefweb.int/report/world/el-nino-preparedness-response-situation-update-issued-impaact-program-issue-no-1-october-2026','World: El Niño Preparedness & Response Situation Update - Issued by IMPAACT Program, Issue No. 1 (October 2026)','worldelninopreparednessresponsesituationupdate','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-29T14:06:34Z','2026-10-30T04:09:02Z','Countries: World, Djibouti, Ethiopia, Somalia Sources: Action Against Hunger, Intergovernmental Authority on Development Please refer to the attached file. Key Messages El Niño is firmly established and is expected to strengthen further. The World Meteorological Organization (WMO) forecasts show near 100% likelihood that El Niño will persist through February 2028. El Niño conditions are currently present in the Pacific Ocean, and the latest forecasts indicate a high likelihood that the event could intensify into a very strong El Niño. The recently released GHACOF-74 (74th Greater Horn of Afric',2.0,'classified',NULL,132);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6928,'https://reliefweb.int/report/greece/quarterly-mixed-migration-update-europe-quarter-3-2026','https://reliefweb.int/report/greece/quarterly-mixed-migration-update-europe-quarter-3-2026','Greece: Quarterly Mixed Migration Update: Europe, Quarter 3, 2026','greecequarterlymixedmigrationupdateeuropequarter32026','reliefweb_ew_en','ReliefWeb - Updates','en','2026-10-29T12:58:05Z','2026-10-30T04:09:02Z','Countries: Greece, Italy, Spain, World Source: Mixed Migration Centre Please refer to the attached file. The core countries of focus are Spain, Italy, Greece and countries along the Balkan migration route. Depending on the quarterly trends and migration-related updates, more attention may be given to any of the countries over the rest. Key migration trends and policy updates Arrivals in Europe down more than a quarter: a total of 34,464 arrivals reached Europe in the third quarter of 2026, down 26% from the same period in 2025 (46,558), with the Western Mediterranean being the only major route',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6929,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/antarcticas-doomsday-glacier-could-raise-sea-levels-twice-much-predicted','https://preventionweb.net/news/antarcticas-doomsday-glacier-could-raise-sea-levels-twice-much-predicted','Antarctica’s “Doomsday Glacier” could raise sea levels twice as much as predicted','antarcticasdoomsdayglaciercouldraisesealevelstwiceasmuchaspredicted','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-29T14:51:55Z','2026-10-30T04:09:03Z','A startling new model reveals that Antarctica’s Thwaites Glacier could cause twice as much sea level rise as previously predicted, even without additional global warming.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6930,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/key-atlantic-currents-could-collapse-century-risk-missing-almost-all-national-climate-plans','https://preventionweb.net/news/key-atlantic-currents-could-collapse-century-risk-missing-almost-all-national-climate-plans','Key Atlantic currents could collapse this century, but the risk is missing from almost all national climate plans – new study','keyatlanticcurrentscouldcollapsethiscenturybuttheriskismissingfromalmostallnationalclimateplans','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-29T14:51:48Z','2026-10-30T04:09:03Z','Ocean currents are changing, with global climate implications, yet governments remain unprepared. Of 91 national adaptation plans submitted to the UN, only two mention the key Atlantic current, and neither outlines action for a possible collapse.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6931,'https://www.preventionweb.net/organization/resilience-adaptation-and-inclusion-nepal','https://preventionweb.net/organization/resilience-adaptation-and-inclusion-nepal','Resilience, Adaptation and Inclusion in Nepal','resilienceadaptationandinclusioninnepal','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-29T09:56:26Z','2026-10-30T04:09:03Z','RAIN is an FCDO-funded programme supporting Nepal’s climate adaptation, mitigation, disaster risk management, and shock-responsive social protection. RAIN TA SLU is implemented by a consortium led by Mott MacDonald.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6932,'https://www.preventionweb.net/organization/media-culture-society-sage-journals','https://preventionweb.net/organization/media-culture-society-sage-journals','Media, Culture & Society (Sage journals)','mediaculturesocietysagejournals','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-28T17:30:20Z','2026-10-30T04:09:03Z','The journal is interdisciplinary, regularly engaging with a wider range of issues in cultural and social analysis. Its focus is on substantive topics and on critique and innovation in theory and method.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6933,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/what-social-factors-influence-durability-and-functionality','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/what-social-factors-influence-durability-and-functionality','What social factors influence the durability and functionality of community flood groups?','whatsocialfactorsinfluencethedurabilityandfunctionalityofcommunityfloodgroups','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-28T17:08:46Z','2026-10-30T04:09:03Z','This paper investigates the social and institutional factors affecting the durability and functionality of Community Flood Groups (CFGs) in England and Wales.',1.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6934,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/locally-led-adaptation-african-communities-insights-practice','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/locally-led-adaptation-african-communities-insights-practice','Locally led adaptation in African communities: Insights from practice','locallyledadaptationinafricancommunitiesinsightsfrompractice','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-28T16:46:34Z','2026-10-30T04:09:03Z','This report, Locally led adaptation in African communities: Insights from practice, presents the experiences of practitioners in the CDKN network innovating tailored approaches to LLA across diverse African contexts.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6935,'https://www.undrr.org/publication/documents-and-publications/concept-note-world-tsunami-awareness-day-2026','https://undrr.org/publication/documents-and-publications/concept-note-world-tsunami-awareness-day-2026','Concept note: World Tsunami Awareness Day 2026','conceptnoteworldtsunamiawarenessday2026','undrr','UNDRR news','en','2026-10-29T15:18:20Z','2026-10-30T04:09:03Z','The theme of World Tsunami Awareness Day 2026, on 5 November, is “Be Tsunami Ready: Resilience Starts With You”. It builds on WTAD 2025’s emphasis on investment in preparedness by focusing on individual and community action.',2.0,'classified',NULL,NULL);
