El Servicio Meteorológico Nacional mantiene una alerta amarilla por tormentas para el fin de semana."}, "summary_en": "Civil Defence in Chaco Province recorded 913 evacuees and 281 self-evacuees as the Paraná river flood covered parts of provincial route 63 and hampered access to riverside towns. The National Meteorological Service maintains a yellow alert for storms over the coming weekend.", "title": "The Paraná flood complicates the Chaco: more than 1,100 evacuated and roads cut", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(21,'glacial_lake_outburst|IN|lahaul-spiti district','glacial_lake_outburst','2026-10-16T15:42:48Z','2026-10-16T14:50:43Z','2026-10-15','{"actions": ["Field implementation of GLOF early warning system with monitoring equipment at Geepang Gath Glacier (~4,100 m altitude)", "Installation of advanced GLOF early warning system at Geepang Gath glacial lake at about 4,100 m altitude", "Submission of disaster loss assessment (about Rs 3,525 crore) to the Centre"], "agencies": [{"country": "IN", "name": "Supreme Court-empowered committee", "type": "other"}, {"country": "IN", "name": "Himachal Pradesh Disaster Management Department", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "IN", "name": "Himachal Pradesh State Disaster Management Authority", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other", "other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.95, "countries": [{"code": "IN", "name": "India"}], "event_date": "2026-10-15", "event_location": "Lahaul-Spiti district, Himachal Pradesh, India", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-16T14:50:43Z", "hazard": "glacial_lake_outburst", "hazards": ["glacial_lake_outburst"], "id": 21, "impacts": {"economic_losses": "Rs 3,525 crore"}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-16T14:50:43Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The article reports deployment of the system but no warnings issued or outcomes observed yet.", "pillars": [1, 2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-15T14:30:00Z", "source_name": "aninews.in", "title": "HP: GLOF early warning system deployed at 4,100-metre-high Geepang Gath Glacier", "title_en": "HP: GLOF early warning system deployed at 4,100-metre-high Geepang Gath Glacier", "url": "https://aninews.in/news/national/general-news/hp-glof-early-warning-system-deployed-at-4100-metre-high-geepang-gath-glacier20261015185058/"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-15T15:45:00Z", "source_name": "nepalnational.com", "title": "HP: GLOF early warning system deployed at 4,100-metre-high Geepang Gath Glacier", "title_en": "HP: GLOF early warning system deployed at 4,100-metre-high Geepang Gath Glacier", "url": "http://www.nepalnational.com/news/279376672/hp-glof-early-warning-system-deployed-at-4100-metre-high-geepang-gath-glacier"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T10:15:00Z", "source_name": "nepalnational.com", "title": "Himachal hopes advanced GLOF early warning system will save lives; seeks Centre aid for Rs 3,525 cr disaster losses", "title_en": "Himachal hopes advanced GLOF early warning system will save lives; seeks Centre aid for Rs 3,525 cr disaster losses", "url": "http://www.nepalnational.com/news/279378367/himachal-hopes-advanced-glof-early-warning-system-will-save-lives-seeks-centre-aid-for-rs-3525-cr-disaster-losses"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T10:30:00Z", "source_name": "calcuttanews.net", "title": "Himachal hopes advanced GLOF early warning system will save lives; seeks Centre aid for Rs 3,525 cr disaster losses", "title_en": "Himachal hopes advanced GLOF early warning system will save lives; seeks Centre aid for Rs 3,525 cr disaster losses", "url": "http://www.calcuttanews.net/news/279378367/himachal-hopes-advanced-glof-early-warning-system-will-save-lives-seeks-centre-aid-for-rs-3525-cr-disaster-losses"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T10:45:00Z", "source_name": "srilankasource.com", "title": "Himachal hopes advanced GLOF early warning system will save lives; seeks Centre aid for Rs 3,525 cr disaster losses", "title_en": "Himachal hopes advanced GLOF early warning system will save lives; seeks Centre aid for Rs 3,525 cr disaster losses", "url": "http://www.srilankasource.com/news/279378367/himachal-hopes-advanced-glof-early-warning-system-will-save-lives-seeks-centre-aid-for-rs-3525-cr-disaster-losses"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "Himachal Pradesh has deployed a Glacial Lake Outburst Flood early warning system with monitoring equipment at the Geepang Gath Glacier at about 4,100 metres in Lahaul-Spiti district. Officials describe it as a shift from reactive response to proactive, science-based risk monitoring in the Himalayan region.", "title": "HP: GLOF early warning system deployed at 4,100-metre-high Geepang Gath Glacier", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(22,'','earthquake','2026-10-16T15:42:49Z','2026-10-22T03:10:58Z','2026-10-15','{"actions": ["JMA canceled the erroneous earthquake early warning approximately 12 minutes after issuing it", "JMA issued an earthquake early warning forecasting shaking up to seismic intensity 7 from Hokkaido to the Tokai region at 12:40 pm", "JMA cancelled the warning at 12:48 pm", "Earthquake early warning alert sent to phones across parts of Japan", "Alert withdrawn about eight minutes later", "JMA investigating the cause of erroneous earthquake early warnings", "JMA identified use of data from distant observation stations that should not have been used", "JMA chief stated countermeasures for the error will be considered at a regular press conference"], "agencies": [{"country": "JP", "name": "Japan Meteorological Agency", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "JP", "name": "Japan Meteorological Agency (JMA)", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": null, "name": "European-Mediterranean Seismological Centre", "type": "international"}, {"country": "JP", "name": "NHK", "type": "media"}, {"country": "JP", "name": "JR (Japan Railways)", "type": "other"}, {"country": "JP", "name": "NTT Docomo", "type": "other"}, {"country": "JP", "name": "Ministry of Land, Infrastructure, Transport and Tourism", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "international", "media", "other", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["cell_broadcast", "mobile_app", "other", "tv"], "confidence": 0.95, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}, {"code": "RU", "name": "Russian Federation"}], "event_date": "2026-10-15", "event_location": "Kamchatka Peninsula, Russia", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-16T14:50:43Z", "hazard": "earthquake", "hazards": ["earthquake"], "id": 22, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en", "es", "ja"], "last_updated": "2026-10-22T03:10:58Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "mixed", "outcome_justification": "The warning was issued in error, estimating a magnitude 9.9 earthquake with strong shaking across Japan when the actual event was magnitude 6.9 near Kamchatka; false alerts erode public trust in early warning systems.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z", "source_name": "気象庁 (JMA)", "title": "令和８年10月16日12時40分に発表した緊急地震速報（警報）について（第３報）", "title_en": "Regarding the Earthquake Early Warning (Warning) issued at 12:40 on October 16, 2026 (Third Report)", "url": "https://www.jma.go.jp/jma/press/2610/16d/202610162240.html"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z", "source_name": "気象庁 (JMA)", "title": "令和８年10月16日12時40分に発表した緊急地震速報（警報）について（第２報）", "title_en": "Regarding the Earthquake Early Warning (Warning) issued at 12:40 on October 16, 2026 (Second Report)", "url": "https://www.jma.go.jp/jma/press/2610/16c/202610161730.html"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z", "source_name": "気象庁 (JMA)", "title": "令和８年10月16日12時40分に発表した緊急地震速報（警報）について", "title_en": "Regarding the Earthquake Early Warning (Warning) issued at 12:40 on October 16, Reiwa 8 (2026)", "url": "https://www.jma.go.jp/jma/press/2610/16b/202610161400.html"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-16T04:19:03Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 社会", "title": "東海道新幹線 地震防災システム作動で一時運転見合わせも再開", "title_en": "Tokaido Shinkansen temporarily suspended operations after earthquake early warning system activated, resumed service", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60374"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T05:15:00Z", "source_name": "bnonews.com", "title": "Japan mistakenly issues warning for magnitude 9.9 earthquake", "title_en": "Japan mistakenly issues warning for magnitude 9.9 earthquake", "url": "https://bnonews.com/index.php/2026/10/japan-mistakenly-issues-warning-for-magnitude-9-9-earthquake/"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T07:45:00Z", "source_name": "mirror.co.uk", "title": "Japan issues warning for record - breaking magnitude 9.9 earthquake before apology", "title_en": "Japan issues warning for record-breaking magnitude 9.9 earthquake before apology", "url": "https://www.mirror.co.uk/news/world-news/earthquake-japan-tsunami-99-warning-37778314"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-16T08:45:00Z", "source_name": "jiji.com", "title": "緊急地震速報取り消し 、 札幌で 「 安心した 」「 ひどい 」 の声 ― 北海道 ： 時事ドットコム", "title_en": "Urgent earthquake alert cancelled; Sapporo residents express relief and anger — Hokkaido", "url": "https://www.jiji.com/jc/article?k=2026101600779&g=soc"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-16T08:51:18Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 社会", "title": "緊急地震速報取り消し 驚きや正確な情報求める声 北海道・東北", "title_en": "Earthquake early warning cancelled; residents in Hokkaido and Tohoku call for accurate information", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60369"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T09:00:00Z", "source_name": "express.co.uk", "title": "Japan issues warning for devastating magnitude - 9.9 earthquake shortly before apology | World | News", "title_en": "Japan issues warning for devastating magnitude - 9.9 earthquake shortly before apology", "url": "https://www.express.co.uk/news/world/2257709/japan-warning-earthquake-hokkaido-apology"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-16T09:00:00Z", "source_name": "blogs.itmedia.co.jp", "title": "【 速報 】 マグニチュード9.9 （ M9.9 ） 緊急地震速報 千島列島 気象庁から取消通知 （ 筆者は初めて見た ） 誤報か ？ 強震モニタには反応なし ： 秋山大志のそれとりあえず作ってみようか 。： オルタナティブ ・ ブログ", "title_en": "[Breaking] Magnitude 9.9 earthquake early warning, Kuril Islands; JMA issues cancellation notice (author saw one for the first time) — false alarm? No response from strong-motion monitors", "url": "https://blogs.itmedia.co.jp/agile/2026/10/eew_false_alarm_kuril_m99_20261016.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-16T10:00:00Z", "source_name": "andaluciainformacion.es", "title": "Un seísmo de magnitud 6,9 sacude Kamchatka sin activar la alerta de tsunami", "title_en": "A magnitude 6.9 earthquake shakes Kamchatka without activating the tsunami alert", "url": "https://www.andaluciainformacion.es/articulo/mundo/seismo-magnitud-69-sacude-kamchatka-activar-alerta-tsunami/202610161049533508226.html"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T10:15:00Z", "source_name": "asiaone.com", "title": "When Japan earthquake warning system cries wolf: Magnitude 9.9 alert withdrawn in eight minutes", "title_en": "When Japan earthquake warning system cries wolf: Magnitude 9.9 alert withdrawn in eight minutes", "url": "https://www.asiaone.com/asia/when-japans-earthquake-warning-system-cries-wolf-magnitude-99-alert-withdrawn-eight-minutes"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T10:30:00Z", "source_name": "economictimes.indiatimes.com", "title": "Japan issues false 9.9 magnitude earthquake warning after quake in Russia but scientists say megaquakes may never happen", "title_en": "Japan issues false 9.9 magnitude earthquake warning after quake in Russia but scientists say megaquakes may never happen", "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/international/world-news/japan-issues-false-9-9-magnitude-earthquake-warning-after-quake-in-russia-but-scientists-say-megaquakes-may-never-happen/articleshow/134990514.cms"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T11:00:00Z", "source_name": "asiaone.com", "title": "When Japan earthquake warning system cries wolf: Magnitude 9.9 alert withdrawn in eight minutes", "title_en": "When Japan earthquake warning system cries wolf: Magnitude 9.9 alert withdrawn in eight minutes", "url": "https://www.asiaone.com:443/asia/when-japans-earthquake-warning-system-cries-wolf-magnitude-99-alert-withdrawn-eight-minutes"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-16T11:16:18Z", "source_name": "朝日新聞 (Asahi Shimbun)", "title": "NTTドコモ、緊急地震速報が配信されず システムに不具合", "title_en": "NTT Docomo: earthquake early warning not delivered due to system fault", "url": "http://www.asahi.com/articles/ASVBJ3Q4LVBJULFA025M.html?ref=rss"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-16T12:00:54Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 主要", "title": "NTTドコモ 緊急地震速報が利用者に配信されず", "title_en": "NTT Docomo: Earthquake early warning not delivered to users", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60749"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-16T13:35:19Z", "source_name": "BioBioChile nacional", "title": "Falsa alerta de un terremoto 9,9 grados generó pánico en el norte de Japón: gobierno investiga error", "title_en": "False alert of a 9.9-magnitude earthquake caused panic in northern Japan; government investigates error", "url": "https://www.biobiochile.cl/noticias/internacional/asia/2026/10/16/falsa-alerta-de-un-terremoto-99-grados-genero-panico-en-el-norte-de-japon-gobierno-investiga-error.shtml"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-16T14:06:22Z", "source_name": "毎日新聞 (Mainichi Shimbun)", "title": "緊急地震速報、初の警報取り消し M9.9と過大推定、気象庁が謝罪", "title_en": "Earthquake early warning withdrawn for the first time: M9.9 overestimate, JMA apologises", "url": "https://mainichi.jp/articles/20261016/k00/00m/040/368000c"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-16T14:48:00Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 主要", "title": "緊急地震速報の過大推定 「過去の対策が機能せず」気象庁", "title_en": "Overestimation of earthquake early warning: JMA says past countermeasures did not work", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60368"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-16T20:29:00Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 社会", "title": "緊急地震速報の過大推定 過去の対策が機能せず 気象庁は調査", "title_en": "Overestimation of earthquake early warnings; past countermeasures failed to work, JMA investigating", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261017de60797"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-17T13:35:46Z", "source_name": "朝日新聞 (Asahi Shimbun)", "title": "緊急地震速報配信されなかったNTTドコモの不具合、対応が完了", "title_en": "Fix completed for NTT Docomo system glitch that failed to deliver earthquake early warnings", "url": "http://www.asahi.com/articles/ASVBK4GJ5VBKOXIE029M.html?ref=rss"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-20T01:59:28Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 社会", "title": "井林国交相 緊急地震速報の誤発表「大変重く受け止めている」", "title_en": "Transport Minister Ibayashi says he takes the erroneous earthquake early warning issuance very seriously", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261020de61980"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-21T09:29:35Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 社会", "title": "気象庁長官 緊急地震速報を誤発表「非常に遺憾 対策検討」", "title_en": "JMA chief expresses ''deep regret'' over erroneous earthquake early warning, says countermeasures will be considered", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261021de63069"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Japón vivió una jornada de pánico generalizado, aunque breve, por una falsa alerta de terremoto emitida por la Agencia Meteorológica local, que avisaba sobre un evento que podía llegar a 9,9 grados richter, entre las regiones de Hokkaido y Tokai. Se trató de un error del sistema informático y el gobierno investiga lo ocurrido.", "ja": "気象庁は2026年10月16日、北海道から東海地方にかけて最大震度7の地震が起きるとする緊急地震速報を発表したが、8分後に取り消した。システムエラーによりカムチャツカ半島付近のM6.9の地震をM9.9と過大推定したもので、警報取り消しは初めて。気象庁は謝罪した。"}, "summary_en": "Japan''s Meteorological Agency mistakenly issued an earthquake early warning estimating a magnitude 9.9 event with strong shaking across much of the country, while the actual quake measured magnitude 6.9 near Kamchatka. The erroneous alert was canceled about 12 minutes after issuance. The incident highlights the importance of quality control in early warning detection and dissemination.", "title": "Japan mistakenly issues warning for magnitude 9.9 earthquake", "wmo_regions": ["II", "V", "VI"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(23,'volcanic|JP|tokachidake','volcanic','2026-10-16T15:42:51Z','2026-10-16T15:30:46Z','2026-10-15','{"actions": ["Lowered volcanic alert level from Level 3 to Level 2 (Do not approach the crater)", "Volcanic alert level lowered from Level 3 (restriction on entering mountain) to Level 2 (restriction around crater)", "Evacuation order for Fukiage Onsen lifted"], "agencies": [{"country": "JP", "name": "Japan Meteorological Agency (JMA)", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "JP", "name": "Sapporo District Meteorological Observatory", "type": "NMHS"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}], "event_date": "2026-10-15", "event_location": "Tokachidake, Hokkaido, Japan", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-16T14:50:44Z", "hazard": "volcanic", "hazards": ["volcanic"], "id": 23, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["ja"], "last_updated": "2026-10-16T15:30:46Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item reports only the lowering of the volcanic alert level; no outcomes of the warning are described in the snippet.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z", "source_name": "気象庁 (JMA)", "title": "十勝岳の噴火警戒レベルを２へ引下げ", "title_en": "Tokachidake volcano alert level lowered to Level 2", "url": "https://www.jma.go.jp/jma/press/2610/16a/tokachidake_20261016.html"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-16T11:30:00Z", "source_name": "朝日新聞 (Asahi Shimbun)", "title": "北海道・十勝岳の噴火警戒レベル3→2 吹上温泉の「避難指示」解除", "title_en": "Hokkaido''s Tokachidake volcano alert level lowered from 3 to 2; evacuation order for Fukiage Onsen lifted", "url": "http://www.asahi.com/articles/ASVBJ2DBSVBJIIPE009M.html?ref=rss"}], "summaries_original": {"ja": "気象庁は十勝岳の噴火警戒レベルを3から2へ引き下げると発表した。火口周辺への立入規制の範囲が見直される。"}, "summary_en": "JMA announced it is lowering the volcanic alert level for Tokachidake from Level 3 to Level 2, which restricts access to the crater area. The change reflects JMA''s monitoring and assessment of volcanic activity and is communicated through a JMA press release.", "title": "Tokachidake volcano alert level lowered to Level 2", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(24,'flood|CL|rio de las minas','flood','2026-10-16T15:42:52Z','2026-10-16T14:52:35Z','2026-10-15','{"actions": ["Preventive evacuation considered but reportedly not executed"], "agencies": [{"country": "CL", "name": "Concejo Municipal", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Dirección de Emergencia Municipal", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "CL", "name": "Chile"}], "event_date": "2026-10-15", "event_location": "Río de las Minas, Chile", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-16T14:52:35Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flood"], "id": 24, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-16T14:52:35Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "negative", "outcome_justification": "The snippet indicates a preventive evacuation was decided upon but not carried out ''so as not to alarm the population'', suggesting a warning-based action was not acted on.", "pillars": [4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-15T16:00:00Z", "source_name": "laprensaaustral.cl", "title": "Directora de Emergencia Municipal reveló que habría evacuado a habitantes de forma preventiva durante crecida del río de las Minas", "title_en": "Municipal Emergency Director revealed she would have evacuated residents preventively during the Minas River flood rise", "url": "https://laprensaaustral.cl/2026/10/15/directora-de-emergencia-municipal-revelo-que-habria-evacuado-a-habitantes-de-forma-preventiva-durante-crecida-del-rio-de-las-minas/"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Según una sesión del Concejo, la directora de Emergencia Municipal reveló que habría evacuado preventivamente a habitantes durante la crecida del río de las Minas, pero la decisión no se ejecutó para no alarmar a la población."}, "summary_en": "According to a municipal council session, the municipal emergency director revealed that a preventive evacuation of residents during a flood rise of the Minas River would have been carried out, but the decision was not executed to avoid alarming the population. The case points to a gap between the decision to act on flood risk information and its implementation.", "title": "Municipal Emergency Director revealed she would have evacuated residents preventively during the Minas River flood rise", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(25,'earthquake|US|coastal alaska','tsunami','2026-10-16T15:42:52Z','2026-10-16T15:26:23Z','2026-10-15','{"actions": ["Launched an interactive tsunami inundation map covering 66 coastal communities", "Identified flood risks and preparedness gaps to support local evacuation planning"], "agencies": [{"country": "US", "name": "Alaska scientists (university/research team, unspecified)", "type": "other"}], "agency_types": ["other"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "US", "name": "United States"}], "event_date": "2026-10-15", "event_location": "Coastal Alaska, USA", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-16T15:26:23Z", "hazard": "tsunami", "hazards": ["tsunami"], "id": 25, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-16T15:26:23Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item describes a new tool to support evacuation planning but reports no actual warning event or results.", "pillars": [1, 2, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-15T16:11:16Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Mapping the risk: Is coastal Alaska ready for the next tsunami?", "title_en": "Mapping the risk: Is coastal Alaska ready for the next tsunami?", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/news/mapping-risk-coastal-alaska-ready-next-tsunami"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "Alaska scientists have launched an interactive tsunami map covering 66 coastal communities, showing flood risks and preparedness gaps. The tool is intended to help local leaders strengthen evacuation planning and protect lives. It addresses risk knowledge and preparedness rather than a specific warning event.", "title": "Mapping the risk: Is coastal Alaska ready for the next tsunami?", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(26,'flood|PY|cerrito','flood','2026-10-16T15:42:52Z','2026-10-17T09:47:48Z','2026-10-15','{"actions": ["Preventive evacuation being prepared in Cerrito", "Coordination of humanitarian assistance and logistics by national and departmental authorities", "Evacuation and displacement of more than 2,100 people", "Assistance to around 570 affected families"], "agencies": [{"country": "PY", "name": "Gobernación de Ñeembucú", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PY", "name": "Local authorities of Ayolas", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PY", "name": "Secretaría de Emergencia Nacional (SEN)", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "PY", "name": "Paraguay"}], "event_date": "2026-10-15", "event_location": "Cerrito, Ñeembucú, Paraguay", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-16T14:52:35Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flood"], "id": 26, "impacts": {"evacuated": 2100}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-17T09:47:48Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes preparations for evacuation following a flood alert but does not report results.", "pillars": [4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-15T17:00:00Z", "source_name": "lanacion.com.py", "title": "La Nación / SEN alista evacuación preventiva en Cerrito tras alerta de inundación", "title_en": "SEN prepares preventive evacuation in Cerrito after flood alert", "url": "https://www.lanacion.com.py/pais/2026/10/15/sen-alista-evacuacion-preventiva-en-cerrito-tras-alerta-de-inundacion/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-16T23:00:00Z", "source_name": "hoy.com.py", "title": "Diario HOY | Emergencia en Ayolas: más de 2.100 personas evacuadas tras la crecida del río Paraná", "title_en": "Emergency in Ayolas: more than 2,100 people evacuated after the Paraná River rise", "url": "https://www.hoy.com.py/nacionales/2026/10/16/emergencia-en-ayolas-mas-de-2100-personas-evacuadas-tras-la-crecida-del-rio-parana"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Autoridades nacionales y departamentales coordinan asistencia humanitaria y logística ante la crecida de los ríos. Se alista una evacuación preventiva en Cerrito tras la alerta de inundación."}, "summary_en": "National and departmental authorities in Paraguay are coordinating humanitarian assistance and logistics as river levels rise. A preventive evacuation in Cerrito is being prepared following a flood alert. The snippet does not detail the warning source or dissemination channels.", "title": "SEN prepares preventive evacuation in Cerrito after flood alert", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
