rente-frio-2/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T00:45:00Z", "source_name": "elfinanciero.com.mx", "title": "Lloverá sobre mojado: Sheinbaum alerta por Trudy y frente frío 2; estos son los 9 estados con lluvias – El Financiero", "title_en": "Rain over wet ground: Sheinbaum warns of Trudy and cold front 2; these are the 9 states with rain", "url": "https://www.elfinanciero.com.mx/nacional/2026/10/17/llovera-sobre-mojado-sheinbaum-alerta-por-trudy-y-frente-frio-2-estos-son-los-9-estados-con-lluvias/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T00:45:00Z", "source_name": "infobae.com", "title": "Protección Civil alerta por el fortalecimiento de Trudy a huracán categoría 2 frente a Colima y Michoacán", "title_en": "Civil Protection warns of Trudy strengthening to Category 2 hurricane off Colima and Michoacán", "url": "https://www.infobae.com/mexico/2026/10/17/proteccion-civil-alerta-por-el-fortalecimiento-de-trudy-a-huracan-categoria-2-frente-a-colima-y-michoacan/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T03:07:43Z", "source_name": "tribunadelabahia.com.mx", "title": "Huracán \"Trudy\" activa alerta en la Costa Sur de Jalisco; realizan evacuaciones preventivas", "title_en": "Hurricane \"Trudy\" triggers alert on Jalisco''s South Coast; preventive evacuations carried out", "url": "https://tribunadelabahia.com.mx/huracan-trudy-activa-alerta-costa-sur-jalisco-evacuaciones-preventivas/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T18:15:00Z", "source_name": "aristeguinoticias.com", "title": "Alerta roja por lluvias extraordinarias en cuatro estados; Trudy se mantiene como huracán categoría 2", "title_en": "Red alert for extraordinary rains in four states; Trudy remains a Category 2 hurricane", "url": "https://aristeguinoticias.com/1810/mexico/alerta-roja-por-lluvias-extraordinarias-en-cuatro-estados-trudy-se-mantiene-como-huracan-categoria-2/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T18:30:00Z", "source_name": "imparcialoaxaca.mx", "title": "¡ Trudy ruge frente al Pacífico! Huracán categoría 2 amenaza con lluvias torrenciales, olas de seis metros y vientos de 100 km / h", "title_en": "Trudy roars toward the Pacific! Category 2 hurricane threatens torrential rain, six-metre waves and 100 km/h winds", "url": "https://imparcialoaxaca.mx/nacional/trudy-ruge-frente-al-pacifico-huracan-categoria-2-amenaza-con-lluvias-torrenciales-olas-de-seis-metros-y-vientos-de-100-km-h/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-20T03:45:00Z", "source_name": "prensa.com", "title": "México cierra puertos y suspende clases por frente frío mientras Trudy pierde fuerza", "title_en": "Mexico closes ports and suspends classes due to cold front while Trudy loses strength", "url": "https://www.prensa.com/mundo/mexico-cierra-puertos-y-suspende-clases-por-frente-frio-mientras-trudy-pierde-fuerza/"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El SMN prevé que el huracán Trudy, de categoría 3, se intensifique y se acerque a las costas de Jalisco la madrugada del domingo 18 de octubre. Protección Civil estableció alerta verde para 22 localidades con peligro bajo, como medida preventiva."}, "summary_en": "Mexico''s National Meteorological Service forecasts that Category 3 Hurricane Trudy will intensify and approach the Jalisco coast early on 18 October. Civil Protection has set a preventive green alert for 22 low-danger localities, covering 93 municipalities in total.", "title": "Category 3 Hurricane \"Trudy\" triggers alert in 93 municipalities of Jalisco", "wmo_regions": ["IV", "V"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(28,'flood|ES|catalonia','heavy_rain','2026-10-16T15:43:00Z','2026-10-18T03:07:43Z','2026-10-16','{"actions": ["Activation of ES-Alert in four comarcas of Barcelona", "Civil Protection activated the alert phase of the Catalonia special flood plan (Inuncat)"], "agencies": [{"country": "ES", "name": "Meteocat", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "ES", "name": "Inuncat", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "ES", "name": "Protecció Civil (Generalitat de Catalunya)", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["cell_broadcast"], "confidence": 0.95, "countries": [{"code": "ES", "name": "Spain"}], "event_date": "2026-10-16", "event_location": "Barcelona, Spain", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-16T15:03:52Z", "hazard": "heavy_rain", "hazards": ["heavy_rain"], "id": 28, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-18T03:07:43Z", "lead_time": "from Saturday (forecast issued before the event)", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports the warning activation and forecast of four days of rain and cold, but gives no information on impacts or public response.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-16T00:00:00Z", "source_name": "cronicaglobal.elespanol.com", "title": "Alerta en Cataluña: una dana retrógrada trae nuevas lluvias intensas, tormentas y granizo a todo el territorio", "title_en": "Alert in Catalonia: a retrograde DANA brings new intense rain, storms and hail across the whole territory", "url": "https://cronicaglobal.elespanol.com/vida/20261016/alerta-cataluna-dana-retrograda-lluvias-intensas-tormentas-territorio-trt/1003742803235_0.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T00:00:00Z", "source_name": "que.es", "title": "Alerta por lluvias torrenciales en Barcelona: la ES - Alert suena en el móvil hasta las 2 h", "title_en": "Torrential rain alert in Barcelona: ES-Alert sounds on mobile phones until 2 a.m.", "url": "https://www.que.es/2026/10/18/alerta-lluvias-barcelona-es-alert/"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Protecció Civil activó la ES-Alert en cuatro comarcas de Barcelona por lluvias torrenciales hasta las 2 h, y Meteocat prevé cuatro días de lluvia y frío."}, "summary_en": "Civil Protection activated the ES-Alert mobile warning system in four comarcas of Barcelona due to torrential rain valid until 2 a.m. Meteocat forecasts four days of rain and cold. The item documents warning dissemination via cell broadcast and a multi-day rainfall forecast.", "title": "Torrential rain alert in Barcelona: ES-Alert sounds on mobile phones until 2 a.m.", "wmo_regions": ["VI"]}');
