l río Paraná ya deja más de 1.200 evacuados", "title_en": "Red alert in Ciudad del Este: historic Paraná River flood already leaves more than 1,200 evacuated", "url": "https://www.elesquiu.com/nacionales/2026/10/18/alerta-roja-en-ciudad-del-este-la-historica-crecida-del-rio-parana-ya-deja-mas-de-1200-evacuados-600224.html"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-21T03:14:37Z", "source_name": "paho.org", "title": "Natural Hazards Monitoring - 19 October 2026 - PAHO/WHO", "title_en": "Natural Hazards Monitoring - 19 October 2026 - PAHO/WHO", "url": "https://www.paho.org/en/natural-hazards-monitoring/natural-hazards-monitoring-19-october-2026"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-22T00:30:00Z", "source_name": "abc.com.py", "title": "Alerta meteorológica: fuertes lluvias ya ingresaron al país y llegarán a Asunción el fin de semana - Clima", "title_en": "Weather alert: heavy rains have already entered the country and will reach Asunción at the weekend", "url": "https://www.abc.com.py/clima/2026/10/21/alerta-meteorologica-fuertes-lluvias-ya-ingresaron-al-pais-y-llegaran-a-asuncion-el-fin-de-semana/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-22T14:45:00Z", "source_name": "ultimahora.com", "title": "3.000 familias son damnificadas en Paraguay por inundaciones, según la SEN", "title_en": "3,000 families affected in Paraguay by floods, according to the SEN", "url": "https://www.ultimahora.com/3000-familias-son-damnificadas-en-paraguay-por-inundaciones-segun-la-sen"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-22T16:15:00Z", "source_name": "monumental.com.py", "title": "SEN advierte que la crisis por inundaciones recién comienza", "title_en": "SEN warns the flood crisis has only just begun", "url": "https://www.monumental.com.py/noticias/nacionales/sen-advierte-que-la-crisis-por-inundaciones-recien-comienza"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-24T19:15:00Z", "source_name": "abc.com.py", "title": "Crecida del río Paraná: ¿ Cuál es la zona que más preocupa al ministro de Defensa? - Nacionales", "title_en": "Paraná River flood: which area most concerns the Defence Minister?", "url": "https://www.abc.com.py/nacionales/2026/10/24/crecida-del-rio-parana-cual-es-la-zona-que-mas-preocupa-al-ministro-de-defensa/"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Las históricas inundaciones en la zona baja de Ciudad del Este obligaron a evacuar a cientos de familias, con agua por encima de 15 metros. Las autoridades vigilan los caudales de Itaipú y Yacyretá ante pronósticos de nuevas tormentas por El Niño."}, "summary_en": "Paraguayan authorities maintained a red alert in Ciudad del Este on 18 October 2026 as the Paraná River rose, with more than 1,200 people evacuated. In Argentina, more than 400 people were evacuated or self-evacuated in Corrientes Province. The PAHO/WHO monitoring item reports these flood-related alerts and evacuations.", "title": "Natural Hazards Monitoring - 19 October 2026 - PAHO/WHO", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
