u-np.co.jp/articles/-/913590"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-23T01:52:25Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 主要", "title": "台風 先島諸島 暴風大雨厳重警戒 西日本・東日本も大雨おそれ", "title_en": "Typhoon Warning for Sakishima Islands: Strong Wind and Heavy Rain Alert; Heavy Rain Also Feared in Western and Eastern Japan", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261023de63968"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-23T03:30:00Z", "source_name": "saga-s.co.jp", "title": "【 台風情報 】 台風30号 、 強い勢力で先島諸島へ 沖縄地方で非常に激しい雨や猛烈な風の予報 前線の北上に伴い西日本や東日本の広い範囲で土砂災害等に警戒を 最新の進路予報 気象庁発表 、 現在位置と今後の進路予想 | 行政 ・ 社会 | 佐賀県のニュース", "title_en": "[Typhoon Information] Typhoon No. 30 approaching Sakishima Islands with strong force; very heavy rain and violent winds forecast for Okinawa; landslide warnings across wide areas of western and eastern Japan as front moves north; latest track forecast issued by JMA", "url": "https://www.saga-s.co.jp/articles/-/1815969"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-23T04:00:00Z", "source_name": "jiji.com", "title": "台風３０号 、 先島諸島から東シナ海へ 暴風高波大雨に厳重警戒 ― 気象庁 ： 時事ドットコム", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 30 moves from Sakishima Islands toward East China Sea; JMA urges strict vigilance for gales, high waves and heavy rain", "url": "https://www.jiji.com/jc/article?k=2026102300516&g=soc"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-23T06:00:00Z", "source_name": "japan.focustaiwan.tw", "title": "台風30号 、 今夜から明日午前にかけ台湾に最接近か 1人死亡 、 94人けが", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 30 may approach Taiwan from tonight to early tomorrow morning; 1 dead, 94 injured", "url": "https://japan.focustaiwan.tw/travel/202610230001"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-23T23:45:00Z", "source_name": "okinawatimes.co.jp", "title": "大型で強い台風30号 、 与那国北方で停滞 宮古 ・ 八重山で暴風警報続く 台風31号も発生", "title_en": "Large, strong Typhoon No. 30 stalls north of Yonaguni; storm warnings continue for Miyako and Yaeyama; Typhoon No. 31 also forms", "url": "https://www.okinawatimes.co.jp/articles/-/1951608"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-24T02:00:00Z", "source_name": "nikkei.com", "title": "台風30号が東シナ海を北上 、 週明けに西日本接近 暴風 ・ 高波に警戒", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 30 moves north through East China Sea; approaches western Japan next week, warnings for strong winds and high waves", "url": "https://www.nikkei.com/article/DGXZQOUD240GK0U6A021C2000000/"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-24T02:24:00Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 主要", "title": "【最新情報】台風30号 先島諸島が暴風域に 厳重警戒を", "title_en": "[Latest update] Typhoon No. 30 enters storm area over Sakishima Islands; strong alert urged", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261024de64650"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-24T02:43:56Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 主要", "title": "台風30号 台湾で1人死亡 500人以上けが 警戒続く", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 30 kills 1 in Taiwan, injures over 500; alert continues", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261024de64639"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-24T02:45:00Z", "source_name": "373news.com", "title": "台風３０号 、 東シナ海を北上 週明けに西日本接近", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 30 moves north through East China Sea, approaches western Japan next week", "url": "https://373news.com/news/national/detail/2026102401000300/"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-24T03:00:00Z", "source_name": "jiji.com", "title": "台風３０号 、 先島諸島北方を北上へ 西日本は前線で大雨警戒 ― 気象庁 ： 時事ドットコム", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 30 moves north of the Sakishima Islands; heavy rain warned for western Japan due to front — Japan Meteorological Agency", "url": "https://www.jiji.com/jc/article?k=2026102400245&g=soc"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-24T03:13:33Z", "source_name": "tenki.jp", "title": "台風30号 24日にかけ先島諸島に接近 線状降水帯発生の恐れ その後は本州付近へ(気象予報士 小野 聡子 2026年10月23日) - 日本気象協会 tenki.jp", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 30 approaching the Sakishima Islands by the 24th; risk of linear precipitation band; later moving toward near mainland Japan (forecaster Satoko Ono, 23 Oct 2026) - Japan Weather Association tenki.jp", "url": "https://tenki.jp/forecaster/s_ono/2026/10/23/41070.html"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-24T05:30:00Z", "source_name": "japan.focustaiwan.tw", "title": "台風30号 、 夕方にも陸上警報解除の見通し 1人死亡 、 527人けが ／ 台湾", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 30 expected to be lifted from land warning by evening; 1 dead, 527 injured in Taiwan", "url": "https://japan.focustaiwan.tw/society/202610240001"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-24T06:45:00Z", "source_name": "news.livedoor.com", "title": "強い台風30号は月曜日に九州上陸へ 土曜日と日曜日は九州～関東で警報級の大雨", "title_en": "Strong Typhoon No. 30 expected to make landfall in Kyushu on Monday; heavy rain warnings-level in Kyushu to Kanto on Saturday and Sunday", "url": "https://news.livedoor.com/article/detail/32644671/"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-24T09:00:00Z", "source_name": "minyu-net.com", "title": "台風３０号 、 週明け九州接近か 東シナ海を東進へ: 主要: 福島民友新聞社", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 30 may approach Kyushu early next week, moving east across the East China Sea", "url": "https://www.minyu-net.com/newspack/detail/2026102401000838"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-24T09:45:00Z", "source_name": "jiji.com", "title": "台風３０号 、 ２６日に九州接近か 東 ・ 西日本は前線で大雨警戒 ― 気象庁 ： 時事ドットコム", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 30 may approach Kyushu on the 26th; heavy rain warned for eastern and western Japan due to front — Japan Meteorological Agency", "url": "https://www.jiji.com/jc/article?k=2026102400388&g=soc"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-24T11:45:00Z", "source_name": "oita-press.co.jp", "title": "台風30号 、 大分県内25日夕方から強風域に入る見込み 警報級の大雨が降る可能性 - 大分のニュースなら 大分合同新聞プレミアムオンライン Gate", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 30 expected to enter strong wind area in Oita Prefecture from the evening of the 25th; possible warning-level heavy rain", "url": "https://www.oita-press.co.jp/1010000000/2026/10/24/JDC2026102400265"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-24T22:00:00Z", "source_name": "jiji.com", "title": "台風３０号 、 先島諸島北方を北上へ 西日本は前線で大雨警戒 ― 気象庁 ： 時事ドットコム", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 30 moves north of the Sakishima Islands; heavy rain warned for western Japan due to front — Japan Meteorological Agency", "url": "https://www.jiji.com/jc/article?k=2026102400245&g=wth"}], "summaries_original": {"ja": "大型で強い台風30号は沖縄県の先島諸島に近づいていて、風や雨が強まっています。24日にかけて一部の住宅が倒壊するような猛烈な風が吹くおそれがあるほか、線状降水帯が発生して災害の危険度が急激に高まるおそれがあります。"}, "summary_en": "A large, strong Typhoon No. 30 is approaching the Sakishima Islands of Okinawa, with winds and rain intensifying. Warnings were issued for extreme winds that could cause some houses to collapse on the 24th, and linear rainbands may rapidly raise disaster risk, with heavy rain also feared in western and eastern Japan.", "title": "Typhoon Warning for Sakishima Islands: Strong Wind and Heavy Rain Alert; Heavy Rain Also Feared in Western and Eastern Japan", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(45,'tropical_cyclone|CK|suwarrow','tropical_cyclone','2026-10-17T07:47:31Z','2026-10-17T09:45:38Z','2026-10-16','{"actions": ["Residents urged to prepare for damaging winds and heavy swells"], "agencies": [{"country": "CK", "name": "Cook Islands Meteorological Service", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "US", "name": "U.S. Embassy", "type": "other"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.9, "countries": [{"code": "CK", "name": "Cook Islands"}], "event_date": "2026-10-16", "event_location": "Suwarrow, Cook Islands", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-17T07:39:16Z", "hazard": "tropical_cyclone", "hazards": ["tropical_cyclone"], "id": 45, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-17T09:45:38Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "Snippet reports a cyclone warning and preparedness call but gives no information on how the event unfolded or its results.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T21:30:00Z", "source_name": "cookislandsnews.com", "title": "Cook Islands urged to prepare as tropical cyclone warning issued for Suwarrow", "title_en": "Cook Islands urged to prepare as tropical cyclone warning issued for Suwarrow", "url": "https://www.cookislandsnews.com/internal/national/outer-islands/weather/cook-islands-urged-to-prepare-as-tropical-cyclone-warning-issued-for-suwarrow/"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-17T07:39:10Z", "source_name": "nz.usembassy.gov", "title": "Weather Alert: Cyclone Warning for Cook Islands", "title_en": "Weather Alert: Cyclone Warning for Cook Islands", "url": "https://nz.usembassy.gov/weather-alert-cyclone-warning-for-cook-islands-october-16-17-2026/"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "A tropical depression was forecast to strengthen into a Category 1 cyclone near Suwarrow, prompting severe weather warnings across the Cook Islands. Officials urged residents to prepare for damaging winds and heavy swells. The snippet does not specify the warning channels or the outcome.", "title": "Cook Islands urged to prepare as tropical cyclone warning issued for Suwarrow", "wmo_regions": ["V"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(46,'multi_hazard|JP|fukushima','multi_hazard','2026-10-17T07:47:31Z','2026-10-17T07:42:19Z','2026-10-17','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": "JP", "name": "Japan Meteorological Agency", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "JP", "name": "Fukushima Television", "type": "media"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "media"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}], "event_date": "2026-10-17", "event_location": "Fukushima, Japan", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-17T07:42:19Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 46, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["ja"], "last_updated": "2026-10-17T07:42:19Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes changes to the warning system and municipal difficulties in responding, but reports no specific event outcome.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-17T07:42:14Z", "source_name": "news.yahoo.co.jp", "title": "防災気象情報が新運用から5カ月 河川警報と線状降水帯予測に新制度 自治体は対応に課題（福島テレビ） - Yahoo!ニュース", "title_en": "Five months after new disaster weather information operations began: new river warning and linear rainband forecast system; municipalities face challenges in responding (Fukushima TV)", "url": "https://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/8de08cad664498b8c930f2473de2c282f54a92d8"}], "summaries_original": {"ja": "2026年5月から防災気象情報の運用が変わり、避難の判断に使われる「レベル3」「レベル4」などの新しい呼びかけが始まった。河川の警報対象や線状降水帯の直前予測など仕組みが大きく変わる中、自治体では対応に悩む声も出ている。"}, "summary_en": "Since May 2026, Japan''s disaster weather information has been operated under a new system, introducing evacuation-level calls such as Level 3 and Level 4, river warning targets, and short-term forecasts of linear rainbands. Municipalities report difficulties in deciding how to respond to the changes.", "title": "Five months after new disaster weather information operations began: new river warning and linear rainband forecast system; municipalities face challenges in responding (Fukushima TV)", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(47,'severe_storm|CL|region metropolitana','severe_storm','2026-10-17T07:47:31Z','2026-10-17T07:46:21Z','2026-10-17','{"actions": ["Senapred declared a Preventive Early Alert for the Metropolitan Region", "DMC issued an advisory for probable thunderstorms in seven regions between 19 and 20 October"], "agencies": [{"country": "CL", "name": "Dirección Meteorológica de Chile (DMC)", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Senapred", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["other"], "confidence": 0.95, "countries": [{"code": "CL", "name": "Chile"}], "event_date": "2026-10-17", "event_location": "Región Metropolitana, Chile", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-17T07:46:21Z", "hazard": "severe_storm", "hazards": ["severe_storm"], "id": 47, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-17T07:46:21Z", "lead_time": "about 2 days before the frontal system arrives (Monday 19 to Wednesday 21 October)", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item only reports forecasts and alerts issued; no observed outcomes are given.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-17T07:46:13Z", "source_name": "meganoticias.cl", "title": "Alerta Temprana Preventiva para la Región Metropolitana: Se esperan tormentas eléctricas con granizos - Meganoticias", "title_en": "Preventive Early Alert for the Metropolitan Region: Thunderstorms with Hail Expected", "url": "https://www.meganoticias.cl/nacional/534134-alerta-temprana-preventiva-region-metropolitana-sistema-frontal-lluvia-octubre-16-10-2026.html"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Senapred declaró Alerta Temprana Preventiva para la Región Metropolitana por el pronóstico de un nuevo sistema frontal que ingresaría el lunes y se mantendría activo hasta el miércoles. La DMC emitió un aviso por probables tormentas eléctricas en siete regiones entre el lunes 19 y el martes 20 de octubre."}, "summary_en": "Senapred declared a Preventive Early Alert for the Santiago Metropolitan Region ahead of a new frontal system expected Monday and active until Wednesday, bringing possible thunderstorms with hail. The Dirección Meteorológica de Chile issued an advisory for probable thunderstorms in seven regions between 19 and 20 October.", "title": "Preventive Early Alert for the Metropolitan Region: Thunderstorms with Hail Expected", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(48,'multi_hazard|CL|metropolitan region','multi_hazard','2026-10-17T07:47:31Z','2026-10-23T03:19:31Z','2026-10-17','{"actions": ["Senapred declared Preventive Early Alert for the Metropolitan Region in coordination with the regional presidential delegation", "Suspension of classes", "Preventive evacuations", "Technical roundtable coordination by Senapred and municipalities", "Yellow Alert declared for provinces and communes of Valparaíso", "Maintained red alert in Metropolitan Region and Arauco", "Preventive closure of roads", "Preventive evacuations in the Metropolitan Region, including encampments in Puente Alto"], "agencies": [{"country": "CL", "name": "Dirección Meteorológica de Chile (DMC)", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "BioBioChile", "type": "media"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "TVN meteorologists", "type": "media"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Municipalities of Chile", "type": "other"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Delegación Presidencial Regional Metropolitana", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Delegación Presidencial de la Región Metropolitana", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Government of Chile (education authorities)", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Ministerio de Desarrollo Social y Familia", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Ministerio del Interior (Subsecretaría del Interior)", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Ministerio del Interior de Chile", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Senapred", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "media", "other", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["other", "tv"], "confidence": 0.95, "countries": [{"code": "CL", "name": "Chile"}], "event_date": "2026-10-17", "event_location": "Metropolitan Region, Chile", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-17T07:46:21Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 48, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-23T03:19:31Z", "lead_time": "Warning issued 2-3 days before forecast precipitation (Tuesday 20 to Wednesday 21 October)", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item reports the forecast and preventive alert declaration only; no outcome of the event is given.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-17T07:46:13Z", "source_name": "cnnchile.com", "title": "Pronóstico de lluvias, granizo y tormentas eléctricas en Santiago: Senapred declara Alerta Temprana Preventiva en la Región Metropolitana", "title_en": "Forecast of rain, hail and thunderstorms in Santiago: Senapred declares Preventive Early Alert in the Metropolitan Region", "url": "https://www.cnnchile.com/pais/pronostico-de-lluvias-granizo-y-tormentas-electricas-en-santiago-senapred-declara-alerta-temprana-preventiva-en-la-region-metropolitana/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T00:26:51Z", "source_name": "BioBioChile nacional", "title": "Suspenden clases en 10 comunas de la RM para este martes por alerta roja ante nuevo sistema frontal", "title_en": "Classes suspended in 10 communes of the Metropolitan Region for Tuesday due to red alert ahead of new frontal system", "url": "https://www.biobiochile.cl/noticias/nacional/region-metropolitana/2026/10/18/suspenden-clases-en-10-comunas-de-la-rm-para-este-martes-por-alerta-roja-ante-nuevo-sistema-frontal.shtml"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-20T00:32:29Z", "source_name": "BioBioChile nacional", "title": "Expertos explican \"tridente meteorológico\" que podría desatar \"tormenta perfecta\" en la zona central", "title_en": "Experts explain \"meteorological trident\" that could trigger \"perfect storm\" in central zone", "url": "https://www.biobiochile.cl/noticias/ciencia-y-tecnologia/ciencia/2026/10/19/expertos-explican-tridente-meteorologico-que-podria-desatar-tormenta-perfecta-en-la-zona-central.shtml"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-20T01:00:12Z", "source_name": "BioBioChile nacional", "title": "Gobierno decreta suspensión de clases y evacuaciones preventivas ante ingreso de nuevo sistema frontal", "title_en": "Government decrees class suspensions and preventive evacuations ahead of new frontal system", "url": "https://www.biobiochile.cl/noticias/nacional/chile/2026/10/19/gobierno-decreta-suspension-de-clases-y-evacuaciones-preventivas-ante-ingreso-de-nuevo-sistema-frontal.shtml"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-20T06:15:00Z", "source_name": "vlnradio.cl", "title": "Senapred declara Alerta Amarilla para la Región de Valparaíso por evento meteorológico", "title_en": "Senapred declares Yellow Alert for the Valparaíso Region due to meteorological event", "url": "https://www.vlnradio.cl/noticias/nacional/region-de-valparaiso/2026/10/19/senapred-declara-alerta-amarilla-para-la-region-de-valparaiso-por-evento-meteorologico-2/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-21T00:52:22Z", "source_name": "BioBioChile nacional", "title": "Balance Senapred por frente \"en desarrollo\": Clases confirmadas, RM en Alerta Roja y fichas FIBE", "title_en": "Senapred balance for \"developing\" front: classes confirmed, Metropolitan Region on Red Alert and FIBE records", "url": "https://www.biobiochile.cl/noticias/nacional/chile/2026/10/20/balance-senapred-por-frente-en-desarrollo-clases-confirmadas-rm-en-alerta-roja-y-fichas-fibe.shtml"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-21T14:00:00Z", "source_name": "latercera.com", "title": "Sistema frontal: Senapred mantiene alerta roja en RM y Arauco, hay daños en viviendas y cierre preventivo de rutas", "title_en": "Frontal system: Senapred maintains red alert in Metropolitan Region and Arauco, damage to homes and preventive road closures", "url": "https://www.latercera.com/nacional/noticia/sistema-frontal-senapred-mantiene-alerta-roja-en-rm-y-arauco-hay-danos-en-viviendas-y-cierre-preventivo-de-rutas/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-22T03:19:31Z", "source_name": "canal9.cl", "title": "Senapred reporta frente \"en desarrollo\": mantienen clases, RM en Alerta Roja y fichas FIBE", "title_en": "Senapred reports developing front: classes maintained, Metropolitan Region under Red Alert and FIBE forms", "url": "https://www.canal9.cl/episodios/2026/10/21/balance-senapred-por-frente-en-desarrollo-clases-confirmadas-rm-en-alerta-roja-y-fichas-fibe"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Senapred declaró Alerta Temprana Preventiva para la Región Metropolitana por el pronóstico de lluvias, granizo y tormentas eléctricas previstas entre el martes 20 y el miércoles 21 de octubre, en coordinación con la Delegación Presidencial. La DMC emitió un aviso por precipitaciones normales a moderadas."}, "summary_en": "Chile''s national emergency service Senapred declared a Preventive Early Alert for the Metropolitan Region based on a DMC forecast of normal to moderate rain, hail and thunderstorms expected between 20 and 21 October. The alert was declared in coordination with the regional presidential delegation ahead of the forecast event.", "title": "Forecast of rain, hail and thunderstorms in Santiago: Senapred declares Preventive Early Alert in the Metropolitan Region", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
