reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes the warnings and protective advice issued but does not report their effects on the population.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-17T16:45:00Z", "source_name": "ondacero.es", "title": "Emergencias envía dos mensajes Es - Alert a la población en Valencia y Alicante ante la alerta roja por lluvias", "title_en": "Emergency services send two ES-Alert messages to the population in Valencia and Alicante over the red rain alert", "url": "https://www.ondacero.es/noticias/sociedad/emergencias-envia-dos-mensajes-esalert-poblacion-valencia-alicante-alerta-roja-lluvias_202610176ad37746bafd3d736362dd67.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-17T17:00:00Z", "source_name": "elimparcial.es", "title": "Andalucía, Comunidad Valenciana, Murcia y Barcelona, en alerta roja por las lluvias", "title_en": "Andalusia, Valencian Community, Murcia and Barcelona on red alert due to rain", "url": "https://www.elimparcial.es/noticia/303024/sociedad/andalucia-comunidad-valenciana-murcia-y-barcelona-en-alerta-roja-por-las-lluvias.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-17T20:38:08Z", "source_name": "El País (España)", "title": "Buscan a una persona desaparecida en Cabrera de Mar (Barcelona) por el temporal", "title_en": "Search for missing person in Cabrera de Mar (Barcelona) due to storm", "url": "https://elpais.com/espana/2026-10-17/emergencias-envia-mensajes-de-alerta-por-lluvias-a-la-poblacion-de-valencia-y-alicante.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T03:07:43Z", "source_name": "ultimahora.es", "title": "El ES-Alert vuelve a sonar en la Comunitat ante la alerta roja por lluvias", "title_en": "ES-Alert sounds again in the Valencian Community ahead of red rain alert", "url": "https://www.ultimahora.es/noticias/comunidades/2026/10/17/2730905/alert-vuelve-sonar-comunitat-ante-alerta-roja-por-lluvias-1.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T03:07:43Z", "source_name": "valenciaextra.com", "title": "Valencia activa 180 bomberos ante la alerta roja por lluvias: \"No intentéis cruzar barrancos aunque parezca que se puede pasar", "title_en": "Valencia activates 180 firefighters ahead of AEMET red alert for rain: \"Do not try to cross ravines even if it seems you can get through\"", "url": "https://www.valenciaextra.com/es/comarcas/valencia-activa-180-bomberos-ante-la-alerta-roja-por-lluvias-no-intenteis-cruzar-barrancos-aunque-parezca-que-se-puede-pasar_601238_102.html"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-18T11:30:00Z", "source_name": "surinenglish.com", "title": "Storm Adam triggers red alert for the south of Valencia and the north of Alicante, with rainfall of up to 400mm", "title_en": "Storm Adam triggers red alert for the south of Valencia and the north of Alicante, with rainfall of up to 400mm", "url": "https://www.surinenglish.com/spain/adam-weather-system-20261018000500-nt.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T18:15:00Z", "source_name": "diariodeburgos.es", "title": "Adam mantiene el lunes la alerta roja en Valencia y Alicante | Noticias Diario de Burgos", "title_en": "Adam keeps red alert in Valencia and Alicante on Monday", "url": "https://www.diariodeburgos.es/noticia/z0de3ba76-9dc6-462c-b0a0486c045eb7e3/202610/adam-mantiene-el-lunes-la-alerta-roja-en-valencia-y-alicante"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T18:15:00Z", "source_name": "diariodeavila.es", "title": "Adam mantiene el lunes la alerta roja en Valencia y Alicante", "title_en": "Adam keeps red alert in Valencia and Alicante on Monday", "url": "https://www.diariodeavila.es/noticia/z0de3ba76-9dc6-462c-b0a0486c045eb7e3/202610/adam-mantiene-el-lunes-la-alerta-roja-en-valencia-y-alicante"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T03:23:51Z", "source_name": "eldebate.com", "title": "Alerta roja en Valencia y Alicante: municipios afectados, lluvias previstas y hasta cuándo hay riesgo de «impactos catastróficos»", "title_en": "Red alert in Valencia and Alicante: affected municipalities, expected rainfall and how long the risk of ''catastrophic impacts'' lasts", "url": "https://www.eldebate.com/espana/comunidad-valenciana/20261017/alerta-roja-valencia-alicante-municipios-afectados-lluvias-previstas-hasta-cuando-hay-riesgo-impactos-catastroficos_470762.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-20T03:14:37Z", "source_name": "eldebate.com", "title": "Aemet retira la alerta roja en Valencia y Alicante pero avisa de más lluvias de hasta 150 litros para este lunes", "title_en": "Aemet withdraws red alert in Valencia and Alicante but warns of more rain of up to 150 litres for Monday", "url": "https://www.eldebate.com/espana/comunidad-valenciana/20261019/aemet-retira-alerta-roja-valencia-alicante-avisa-lluvias-hasta-150-litros-este-lunes_471072.html"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Emergencias envió dos mensajes ES-Alert a la población de Valencia y Alicante ante la alerta roja por lluvias, pidiendo evitar desplazamientos, no cruzar zonas inundables, buscar zonas altas y alejarse de la costa."}, "summary_en": "Spain''s emergency services issued two ES-Alert mobile warning messages to residents of Valencia and Alicante in response to a red alert for rain. The messages urged people to avoid travel, stay out of flood-prone areas and river channels, move to higher ground or upper floors, and keep away from the coast. The snippet does not report the outcome of the warnings.", "title": "Emergency services send two ES-Alert messages to the population in Valencia and Alicante over the red rain alert", "wmo_regions": ["VI"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(60,'multi_hazard|PE|lima','multi_hazard','2026-10-18T03:11:26Z','2026-10-21T03:21:51Z','2026-10-17','{"actions": ["Enfen maintains El Niño Costero alert", "Senamhi forecasts above-normal river flows", "Cenepred identifies over one million people in very high flash-flood risk zones", "Experts call for reinforced monitoring and prevention", "Specialists recommend prevention measures for flooding, water scarcity and forest fires", "Calls for greater preparedness by authorities"], "agencies": [{"country": "PE", "name": "Senamhi", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Cenepred", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Enfen", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["other"], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "PE", "name": "Peru"}], "event_date": "2026-10-17", "event_location": "Lima, Peru", "event_name": "El Niño", "first_seen": "2026-10-18T03:08:02Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 60, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-21T03:21:51Z", "lead_time": "from December (approx. 1-2 months ahead)", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item describes forecasts and alerts but reports no realised outcome of the warnings.", "pillars": [1, 2, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-17T21:33:30Z", "source_name": "La República (Perú) sociedad", "title": "Lima frente a El Niño: Rímac, Chillón y Lurín tendrían caudales sobre lo normal desde diciembre", "title_en": "Lima faces El Niño: Rímac, Chillón and Lurín rivers could have above-normal flows from December", "url": "https://larepublica.pe/sociedad/2026/10/17/lima-frente-a-el-nino-rimac-chillon-y-lurin-tendrian-caudales-sobre-lo-normal-desde-diciembre-1137249"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-20T15:16:38Z", "source_name": "La República (Perú) sociedad", "title": "El fenómeno de El Niño amenaza de forma distinta al Perú: qué hacer ante lluvias, sequías e incendios", "title_en": "El Niño threatens Peru in different ways: what to do about rains, droughts and fires", "url": "https://larepublica.pe/sociedad/2026/10/10/el-fenomeno-de-el-nino-amenaza-de-forma-distinta-al-peru-que-hacer-ante-lluvias-sequias-e-incendios-829760"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El Enfen mantiene la alerta por El Niño Costero y el Senamhi prevé caudales superiores a lo habitual en el Rímac, Chillón y Lurín desde diciembre. El Cenepred identifica a más de un millón de personas en zonas de riesgo muy alto por huaico en Lima."}, "summary_en": "Peru''s Enfen maintains an El Niño Costero alert, and Senamhi forecasts above-normal flows in the Rímac, Chillón and Lurín rivers from December. Cenepred identifies over one million people in very high flash-flood risk zones in Lima department, and specialists call for stronger monitoring and prevention.", "title": "Lima faces El Niño: Rímac, Chillón and Lurín rivers could have above-normal flows from December", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
