iginal": {"es": "El huracán Isaías se intensificó este jueves a categoría 2, con vientos máximos de 100 millas por hora (155 kilómetros por hora), mientras se dirige al sur de Estados Unidos."}, "summary_en": "Hurricane Isaías intensified to Category 2 with maximum sustained winds of 100 mph (155 km/h) while moving toward the southern United States. The report is a news update on the storm''s strengthening and track, without details of the forecasts, warnings or dissemination efforts issued.", "title": "Hurricane Isaías strengthens to Category 2 as it heads toward the southern US", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
