 noticias", "title": "INDECI recomienda medidas de preparación ante el incremento de la temperatura diurna en la costa y sierra", "title_en": "INDECI recommends preparedness measures ahead of rising daytime temperatures on the coast and highlands", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/indeci/noticias/1460525-indeci-recomienda-medidas-de-preparacion-ante-el-incremento-de-la-temperatura-diurna-en-la-costa-y-sierra"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "INDECI Perú noticias", "title": "INDECI recomienda medidas de preparación ante el incremento de la temperatura diurna en la costa y sierra norte y centro.", "title_en": "INDECI recommends preparedness measures ahead of rising daytime temperatures on the coast and in the northern and central highlands", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/indeci/noticias/1462253-indeci-recomienda-medidas-de-preparacion-ante-el-incremento-de-la-temperatura-diurna-en-la-costa-y-sierra-norte-y-centro"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "INDECI Perú noticias", "title": "INDECI recomienda medidas de preparación ante el incremento de la temperatura diurna en la costa y sierra", "title_en": "INDECI recommends preparedness measures ahead of rising daytime temperatures on the coast and highlands", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/indeci/noticias/1464759-indeci-recomienda-medidas-de-preparacion-ante-el-incremento-de-la-temperatura-diurna-en-la-costa-y-sierra"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "INDECI Perú noticias", "title": "INDECI recomienda medidas de preparación ante el incremento de la temperatura diurna en la selva", "title_en": "INDECI recommends preparedness measures ahead of rising daytime temperatures in the jungle", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/indeci/noticias/1468230-indeci-recomienda-medidas-de-preparacion-ante-el-incremento-de-la-temperatura-diurna-en-la-selva"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-31T13:17:49Z", "source_name": "La República (Perú) sociedad", "title": "Calor extremo en Perú: ENFEN prevé nuevos récords de temperatura en toda la costa durante los próximos meses", "title_en": "Extreme heat in Peru: ENFEN forecasts new temperature records across the coast in the coming months", "url": "https://larepublica.pe/sociedad/2026/10/31/calor-extremo-en-peru-enfen-preve-nuevos-records-de-temperatura-en-toda-la-costa-durante-los-proximos-meses-2740214"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "INDECI recomienda adoptar medidas de preparación ante el Aviso N.° 431 (nivel rojo) del SENAMHI, que informa sobre el incremento de la temperatura diurna, de moderada a extrema intensidad, en la costa y sierra del país."}, "summary_en": "INDECI recommends preparedness measures following SENAMHI Aviso N.° 431 (red level), which warns of moderate-to-extreme increases in daytime temperature across coastal and highland regions of Peru. The press release is a warning-driven call for preparedness and response actions.", "title": "INDECI recommends preparedness measures ahead of rising daytime temperatures on the coast and highlands", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(63,'multi_hazard|MX|baja california and manzanillo','multi_hazard','2026-10-19T03:25:05Z','2026-10-19T03:15:14Z','2026-10-17','{"actions": ["High-level emergency alerts issued", "Shelters opened", "Some transport services suspended"], "agencies": [{"country": "MX", "name": "Mexican authorities", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "MX", "name": "Mexico"}], "event_date": "2026-10-17", "event_location": "Baja California and Manzanillo, Mexico", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-19T03:15:14Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 63, "impacts": {"deaths": 5}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-19T03:15:14Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "negative", "outcome_justification": "At least five deaths were reported from flooding in Baja California, though the snippet does not state whether warnings were received or acted upon in time.", "pillars": [3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-17T03:15:09Z", "source_name": "whn.global", "title": "Public Health Alerts - WHN", "title_en": "Public Health Alerts - WHN", "url": "https://whn.global/public-health-alerts/"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "Flooding from the remnants of Tropical Storm Rachel killed at least five people in Baja California, according to authorities'' October 13 update. Mexican authorities issued high-level emergency alerts, opened shelters and suspended some transport services as Hurricane Simon flooded Manzanillo. The snippet does not detail the timing or dissemination channels of the warnings.", "title": "Public Health Alerts - WHN", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(64,'other|TN|tunis','other','2026-10-19T03:25:05Z','2026-10-19T03:11:12Z','2026-10-18','{"actions": ["Regional and international partners convened at the Second Arab Regional Forum (12-14 October 2026) to advance early warning systems and disaster preparedness"], "agencies": [{"country": null, "name": "UNDRR", "type": "international"}], "agency_types": ["international"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.75, "countries": [{"code": "TN", "name": "Tunisia"}], "event_date": "2026-10-18", "event_location": "Tunis, Tunisia", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-19T03:11:12Z", "hazard": "other", "hazards": ["other"], "id": 64, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-19T03:11:12Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item describes a policy forum with no reported warning events, forecasts or outcomes.", "pillars": [1, 2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-18T11:49:54Z", "source_name": "UNDRR news", "title": "Tunis hosts Arab Regional Forum on Early Warning Systems & Disaster Preparedness", "title_en": "Tunis hosts Arab Regional Forum on Early Warning Systems & Disaster Preparedness", "url": "https://www.undrr.org/news/tunis-hosts-arab-regional-forum-early-warning-systems-disaster-preparedness"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The Second Arab Regional Forum in Tunis (12-14 October 2026) gathered regional and international partners to advance early warning systems and disaster preparedness. The forum supported the Early Warnings for All initiative across the Arab region. The item reports no specific hazard event or warning outcomes.", "title": "Tunis hosts Arab Regional Forum on Early Warning Systems & Disaster Preparedness", "wmo_regions": ["I"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(65,'severe_storm|JP|western and eastern japan','severe_storm','2026-10-19T03:25:06Z','2026-10-19T03:15:24Z','2026-10-18','{"actions": ["JMA warned of lightning, tornadoes and other gusty winds, and sudden heavy rain"], "agencies": [{"country": "JP", "name": "Japan Meteorological Agency (JMA)", "type": "NMHS"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS"], "channels": ["tv"], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}], "event_date": "2026-10-18", "event_location": "Western and eastern Japan", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-19T03:15:24Z", "hazard": "severe_storm", "hazards": ["severe_storm"], "id": 65, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["ja"], "last_updated": "2026-10-19T03:15:24Z", "lead_time": "through 20 October", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports JMA advisories on very unstable atmospheric conditions but gives no information on impacts or public response.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-18T21:31:00Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 主要", "title": "あすにかけ西日本や東日本中心に大気非常に不安定", "title_en": "Atmosphere very unstable mainly over western and eastern Japan through tomorrow", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261019de61334"}], "summaries_original": {"ja": "前線を伴った低気圧の影響で北海道では雨雲が発達している。西日本や東日本を中心に20日にかけて大気が非常に不安定となる見込みで、気象庁は落雷や竜巻などの突風、急な強い雨に注意を呼びかけている。"}, "summary_en": "A front-associated low-pressure system is producing developing rain clouds over Hokkaido, while western and eastern Japan are expected to experience very unstable atmospheric conditions through 20 October. The Japan Meteorological Agency warned of lightning, tornado-type gusty winds and sudden heavy rain.", "title": "Atmosphere very unstable mainly over western and eastern Japan through tomorrow", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
