g the month''s total to five. In its morning bulletin of 21 October it kept Alert Level 1 in place, showing continued volcano monitoring and bulletin-based communication.", "title": "Taal Volcano logs fifth eruption this October; alert level 1 stays", "wmo_regions": ["II", "V"]}');
