nia and the Balearic Islands due to torrential rain", "url": "https://www.elimparcial.es/noticia/303036/sociedad/un-fallecido-y-alerta-roja-enandalucia-murcia-comunidad-valenciana-cataluna-y-balearespor-las-lluvias-torrenciales.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T18:15:00Z", "source_name": "elimparcial.es", "title": "Andalucía, Murcia, Barcelona y la Comunidad Valenciana, en alerta roja por las lluvias", "title_en": "Andalusia, Murcia, Barcelona and the Valencian Community on red alert due to rain", "url": "https://www.elimparcial.es/noticia/303024/sociedad/andalucia-murcia-barcelona-y-la-comunidad-valenciana-en-alerta-roja-por-las-lluvias.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T18:30:00Z", "source_name": "cope.es", "title": "La dana Adam pone en alerta roja a Valencia, Alicante, Ibiza y Formentera por lluvias torrenciales", "title_en": "The DANA Adam puts Valencia, Alicante, Ibiza and Formentera on red alert for torrential rain", "url": "https://www.cope.es/actualidad/espana/al-minuto/dana-adam-pone-alerta-roja-valencia-alicante-ibiza-formentera-lluvias-torrenciales-20261018_3457770.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T18:45:00Z", "source_name": "lavanguardia.com", "title": "La dana obliga a suspender clases en Mallorca, Eivissa y Formentera y moviliza a la UME", "title_en": "The DANA forces class suspensions in Mallorca, Eivissa and Formentera and mobilises the UME", "url": "https://www.lavanguardia.com/vida/20261018/11662117/dana-obliga-suspender-clases-mallorca-eivissa-formentera-moviliza-ume.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T19:15:00Z", "source_name": "heraldo.es", "title": "La dana Adam deja una mujer muerta, moviliza a la UME y obliga a suspender las clases en Baleares", "title_en": "Dana Adam leaves one woman dead, mobilises the UME and forces class suspensions in the Balearic Islands", "url": "https://www.heraldo.es/noticias/nacional/2026/10/18/dana-adam-mujer-muerta-ume-baleares-alerta-roja-lluvias-dana-adam-mujer-muerta-ume-baleares-alerta-roja-lluvias-2060671.html"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Una masa de aire frío y la formación de dos danas mantendrán la inestabilidad en España, con riesgo de inundaciones. Se han emitido alertas rojas para Valencia, Alicante, Ibiza y Formentera por lluvias torrenciales."}, "summary_en": "A cold air mass and two DANAs (cut-off low systems) are expected to sustain instability in Spain, with flood risk. Red alerts have been issued for Valencia, Alicante, Ibiza and Formentera due to torrential rain.", "title": "The DANA Adam puts Valencia, Alicante, Ibiza and Formentera on red alert for torrential rain", "wmo_regions": ["VI"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(73,'named|adam','severe_storm','2026-10-20T03:20:08Z','2026-10-21T03:21:03Z','2026-10-18','{"actions": ["Evacuation of thousands of people", "Preventive intervention by emergency services in Mallorca", "Suspension of classes in several municipalities on Monday"], "agencies": [{"country": "ES", "name": "AEMET", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "ES", "name": "Emergency services (Mallorca)", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "ES", "name": "Spanish authorities", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "ES", "name": "Spain"}], "event_date": "2026-10-18", "event_location": null, "event_name": "Storm Adam", "first_seen": "2026-10-20T03:08:34Z", "hazard": "heavy_rain", "hazards": ["flash_flood", "heavy_rain", "multi_hazard", "severe_storm"], "id": 73, "impacts": {"deaths": 3}, "languages": ["en", "es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-21T03:21:03Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "mixed", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports active weather alerts warning of significant danger and thousands evacuated, but does not state whether warnings were received or whether they reduced losses; two deaths are reported.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-18T21:00:00Z", "source_name": "sana.sy", "title": "Una fallecida y clases suspendidas en zonas de España por la tormenta Adam", "title_en": "One dead and classes suspended in areas of Spain due to storm Adam", "url": "https://sana.sy/es/world/2338685/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T07:00:00Z", "source_name": "ultimahora.es", "title": "Pocos incidentes durante la noche en Mallorca, Ibiza y Formentera, pese a la alerta roja", "title_en": "Few incidents overnight in Mallorca, Ibiza and Formentera despite red alert", "url": "https://www.ultimahora.es/sucesos/ultimas/2026/10/19/2731653/pocos-incidentes-durante-noche-mallorca-ibiza-formentera-pese-alerta-roja.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T07:30:00Z", "source_name": "europapress.es", "title": "La dana Adam mantiene este lunes la alerta roja por lluvias en Valencia y Alicante antes de desplazarse a Cataluña", "title_en": "Storm Adam keeps red rain alert on Monday in Valencia and Alicante before moving to Catalonia", "url": "https://www.europapress.es/sociedad/noticia-tiempo-hoy-espana-19-octubre-2026-20261019082518.html"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-19T11:15:00Z", "source_name": "aol.co.uk", "title": "Two killed and thousands evacuated after Storm Adam batters Spanish coast with heavy rain", "title_en": "Two killed and thousands evacuated after Storm Adam batters Spanish coast with heavy rain", "url": "https://www.aol.co.uk/articles/two-killed-thousands-evacuated-storm-104921000.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-20T06:15:00Z", "source_name": "noticiasrcn.com", "title": "Al menos tres muertos por inundaciones en varias regiones del sur de España", "title_en": "At least three dead in floods in several regions of southern Spain", "url": "https://www.noticiasrcn.com/internacional/al-menos-tres-muertos-por-inundaciones-en-varias-regiones-del-sur-de-espana-1073293"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-20T15:30:00Z", "source_name": "walesonline.co.uk", "title": "Spanish resorts hit with red alert weather warning as Storm Adam batters coast ahead of half term getaway", "title_en": "Spanish resorts hit with red alert weather warning as Storm Adam batters coast ahead of half term getaway", "url": "https://www.walesonline.co.uk/whats-on/travel/storm-adam-hits-spanish-resorts-34791598"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Entre las 22 horas del domingo y las 6.30 horas del lunes, en Mallorca se contabilizaron dos caídas de árboles y una intervención preventiva, con pocos incidentes en las islas pese a la alerta roja vigente."}, "summary_en": "Storm Adam brought heavy rain to the Spanish coast, prompting weather alerts warning of significant danger in several areas and the evacuation of thousands of people. Two deaths are reported. The snippet does not detail the warning dissemination channels or lead time.", "title": "Two killed and thousands evacuated after Storm Adam batters Spanish coast with heavy rain", "wmo_regions": ["VI"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(74,'flood|CL|coquimbo to biobio regions','flood','2026-10-20T03:20:12Z','2026-10-23T03:19:31Z','2026-10-19','{"actions": ["Declaration of Yellow Alert for six communes", "Evacuation ordered in Talagante following SAE (Sistema de Alerta de Emergencia) alert activation", "Public called to remain calm and to plan evacuation including pets and their needs", "Door-to-door operation urging residents of high-risk Ribera del Río Mapocho sector to leave", "Preventive evacuation of around 100 homes", "Activated SAE emergency alert messaging to request evacuation of a sector affected by Río Mapocho overflow", "Declaration of yellow alert in six communes"], "agencies": [{"country": "CL", "name": "Local authorities", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Senapred", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Senapred (Servicio Nacional de Prevención y Respuesta ante Desastres)", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Senapred (Servicio Nacional de Prevención y Respuesta ante Desastres), Dirección Regional Metropolitana", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other_national_agency"], "channels": ["cell_broadcast", "door_to_door", "other"], "confidence": 0.95, "countries": [{"code": "CL", "name": "Chile"}], "event_date": "2026-10-19", "event_location": "Maipú, Padre Hurtado, Talagante, Peñaflor, El Monte and Melipilla, Chile", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-20T03:14:37Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flood", "heavy_rain"], "id": 74, "impacts": {"evacuated": 100}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-23T03:19:31Z", "lead_time": "ahead of forecast heavy rains expected Tuesday", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item reports the issuance of a Yellow Alert only; no subsequent impacts or effectiveness of the warning are described.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T05:00:00Z", "source_name": "prensa-latina.cu", "title": "Alerta climática en zona central de Chile por sistema frontal", "title_en": "Climate alert in central Chile due to frontal system", "url": "https://www.prensa-latina.cu/2026/10/19/alerta-climatica-en-zona-central-de-chile-por-sistema-frontal/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-20T17:30:00Z", "source_name": "elclarin.cl", "title": "Sistema frontal en Santiago: alertas y riesgo de aluviones", "title_en": "Frontal system in Santiago: alerts and risk of mudflows", "url": "https://www.elclarin.cl/2026/10/20/sistema-frontal-santiago-alerta-aluviones-prevencion/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-20T18:15:00Z", "source_name": "24horas.cl", "title": "Alerta en Talagante: evacuación preventiva en 100 viviendas por riesgo de crecida del río Mapocho", "title_en": "Alert in Talagante: preventive evacuation of 100 homes due to risk of Mapocho River flooding", "url": "https://www.24horas.cl/actualidad/nacional/talagante-evacuacion-preventiva-riesgo-crecida-rio-mapocho"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-21T00:00:00Z", "source_name": "vlnradio.cl", "title": "Senapred ordena evacuar campamento ribera del Río Mapocho en Talagante por desborde", "title_en": "Senapred orders evacuation of riverside encampment on Río Mapocho in Talagante due to overflow", "url": "https://www.vlnradio.cl/noticias/nacional/region-metropolitana/2026/10/20/senapred-ordena-evacuar-campamento-ribera-del-rio-mapocho-en-talagante-por-desborde/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-21T01:45:00Z", "source_name": "chilevision.cl", "title": "Se activó la alerta SAE: Senapred ordena evacuación en Talagante tras crecida del río Mapocho", "title_en": "SAE alert activated: Senapred orders evacuation in Talagante after Mapocho River rise", "url": "https://www.chilevision.cl/noticias/nacional/se-activo-la-aleta-sae-senapred-ordena-evacuacion-en-talagante-tras-crecida-del-rio-mapocho/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-21T04:00:00Z", "source_name": "puranoticia.pnt.cl", "title": "Declaran Alerta Amarilla para seis comunas de la región Metropolitana por crecida del río Mapocho", "title_en": "Yellow Alert declared for six communes in the Metropolitan Region due to Mapocho River flood rise", "url": "https://puranoticia.pnt.cl/nacional/declaran-alerta-amarilla-para-seis-comunas-de-la-region-metropolitana-por"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-21T05:30:00Z", "source_name": "chilevision.cl", "title": "Senapred decreta alerta amarilla en 6 comunas de la Región Metropolitana por crecida del río Mapocho", "title_en": "Senapred declares yellow alert in 6 communes of the Metropolitan Region due to Mapocho River rise", "url": "https://www.chilevision.cl/noticias/nacional/senapred-decreta-alerta-amarilla-en-6-comunas-de-la-region-metropolitana-por-crecida-del-rio-mapocho/"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "La Dirección Regional del Senapred declaró Alerta Amarilla por crecida para las comunas de Maipú, Padre Hurtado, Talagante, Peñaflor, El Monte y Melipilla, por la crecida del río Mapocho."}, "summary_en": "Chile''s regional emergency service Senapred declared a Yellow Alert for flooding due to rising waters of the Mapocho River, covering six communes in the Metropolitan Region. The alert is a formal warning issued by a national disaster agency to local authorities and the public in the affected communes. The snippet does not describe dissemination channels or follow-up outcomes.", "title": "Yellow Alert declared for six communes in the Metropolitan Region due to Mapocho River flood rise", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
