 were effective or on any casualties or losses.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T05:30:00Z", "source_name": "antena3.com", "title": "Última hora del temporal, en directo: Peligro extraordinario en el Mediterráneo por la DANA Adam que mantiene los avisos rojos en el sur de Valencia y norte de Alicante", "title_en": "Latest on the storm, live: Extraordinary danger in the Mediterranean due to DANA Adam, with red warnings maintained in southern Valencia and northern Alicante", "url": "https://www.antena3.com/noticias/sociedad/ultima-hora-temporal-dana-adam-mediterraneo-valencia-alicante-baleares-directo_202610196ad5a46b6e8df44596b60a79.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T07:30:00Z", "source_name": "lavozdegalicia.es", "title": "Personas atrapadas en los tejados y carreteras cortadas por la dana Adam que azota Levante", "title_en": "People trapped on rooftops and roads cut as DANA Adam lashes Levante", "url": "https://www.lavozdegalicia.es/noticia/espana/2026/10/19/personas-atrapadas-tejados-carreteras-cortadas-dana-adam-azota-levante/00031792387284011482862.htm"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T07:30:00Z", "source_name": "elconfidencial.com", "title": "Dana Adam en España: alerta de la Aemet en Comunidad Valenciana, Cataluña, Andalucía y última hora del tiempo, en directo", "title_en": "Dana Adam in Spain: AEMET alert in Valencian Community, Catalonia, Andalusia and latest weather updates, live", "url": "https://www.elconfidencial.com/espana/2026-10-19/dana-borrasca-adam-espana-directo_4447717/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T07:32:27Z", "source_name": "El País (España)", "title": "Coches arrastrados por el agua y crecidas en los ríos: las imágenes de las lluvias en la Comunidad Valenciana", "title_en": "Cars swept away by water and river floods: images of the rains in the Valencian Community", "url": "https://elpais.com/espana/2026-10-19/coches-arrastrados-por-el-agua-y-crecidas-en-los-rios-las-imagenes-de-las-lluvias-en-la-comunidad-valenciana.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T12:15:00Z", "source_name": "elperiodic.com", "title": "DANA Valencia y Alicante | Las im谩genes desde helic贸ptero que deja la DANA Adam: la Safor y la Marina se convierten en un mar", "title_en": "DANA Valencia and Alicante: helicopter images of the DANA Adam show the Safor and Marina regions turned into a sea", "url": "https://www.elperiodic.com/imagenes-desde-helicoptero-deja-dana-adam-safor-marina-convierten_1098269"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T12:31:48Z", "source_name": "El País (España)", "title": "Los vídeos de los rescates en la Comunidad Valenciana durante la dana ‘Adam’", "title_en": "Videos of the rescues in the Valencian Community during the DANA ''Adam''", "url": "https://elpais.com/videos/2026-10-19/los-videos-de-los-rescates-en-la-comunidad-valenciana-durante-la-dana-adam.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T15:45:00Z", "source_name": "diariodenavarra.es", "title": "La dana Adam se ceba en la Comunidad Valenciana con 3 muertos y deja cortes de luz y de carreteras en Baleares", "title_en": "Cut-off low ''Adam'' hits the Valencian Community with 3 deaths and leaves power and road cuts in the Balearic Islands", "url": "https://www.diariodenavarra.es/noticias/actualidad/nacional/2026/10/19/dana-adam-ceba-comunidad-valenciana-3-muertos-deja-cortes-luz-carreteras-baleares-839292-28.html"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-19T16:15:00Z", "source_name": "dailysabah.com", "title": "Heavy rain leaves at least 4 dead in eastern Spain", "title_en": "Heavy rain leaves at least 4 dead in eastern Spain", "url": "https://www.dailysabah.com/world/europe/heavy-rain-leaves-at-least-4-dead-in-eastern-spain"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T16:43:50Z", "source_name": "El País América", "title": "Andalucía y Cataluña, bajo aviso naranja por ‘Adam’ tras pasar lo 