ugh-early-warning-and-anticipatory-action"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "FAO, the Syrian Ministry of Emergency and Disaster Management and consortium partners launched a new ECHO-funded project to strengthen disaster preparedness and response in Syria through early warning and anticipatory action. The project spans risk knowledge, monitoring, warning communication and preparedness. Specific hazards, warning systems and outcomes are not detailed in the available snippet.", "title": "Strengthening Syria''s Disaster Preparedness and Response through Early Warning and Anticipatory Action", "wmo_regions": ["II", "VI"]}');
