disruptive wind and rain for some from late Thursday and into Friday. Read more", "title_en": "Storm Austen named", "url": "https://www.metoffice.gov.uk/about-us/news-and-media/media-centre/weather-and-climate-news/2026/storm-austen-named"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": null, "source_name": "UK Met Office news", "title": "Amber warning issued as Storm Austen approaches The Met Office has issued an Amber wind warning for the whole of Cornwall, the Isles of Scilly and parts of West Devon ahead of the arrival of Storm Austen. Read more", "title_en": "Amber warning issued as Storm Austen approaches", "url": "https://www.metoffice.gov.uk/about-us/news-and-media/media-centre/weather-and-climate-news/2026/amber-warning-issued-as-storm-austen-approaches"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": null, "source_name": "UK Met Office news", "title": "Storm Austen to arrive as just one in eight say they’re fully prepared for winter weather With Storm Austen becoming the first named storm of the 2026/27 storm season, new Met Office research suggests that only one in eight people say they are fully prepared for severe winter weather. Read more", "title_en": "Storm Austen to arrive as just one in eight say they''re fully prepared for winter weather", "url": "https://www.metoffice.gov.uk/about-us/news-and-media/media-centre/weather-and-climate-news/2026/mixed-conditions-ahead-with-wind-rain-and-sunshine-in-the-forecast-/storm-austen-to-arrive-as-just-one-in-eight-say-theyre-fully-prepared-for-winter-weather"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": null, "source_name": "UK Met Office news", "title": "Storm Boelo named as strong winds forecast for northern UK Storm Boelo will impact Northern Ireland, Scotland and parts of northern England over the weekend. Warnings have also been updated for Storm Austen which impacts the south of England and Wales on Thursday night and Friday. Read more", "title_en": "Storm Boelo named as strong winds forecast for northern UK", "url": "https://www.metoffice.gov.uk/about-us/news-and-media/media-centre/weather-and-climate-news/2026/storm-boelo-named-as-strong-winds-forecast-for-northern-uk"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": null, "source_name": "UK Met Office news", "title": "Strong winds and rain continue before calmer weather arrives later this week Strong winds and heavy rain will continue to affect parts of the UK early this week, with strong winds possible in northern and western Scotland on Tuesday, before high pressure brings calmer conditions for many from midweek. Read more", "title_en": "Strong winds and rain continue before calmer weather arrives later this week", "url": "https://www.metoffice.gov.uk/about-us/news-and-media/media-centre/weather-and-climate-news/2026/strong-winds-and-rain-continue-before-calmer-weather-arrives-later-this-week"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-20T09:42:56Z", "source_name": "BBC News Science & Environment", "title": "Storm Austen to bring severe gales to UK as weather warning issued", "title_en": "Storm Austen to bring severe gales to UK as weather warning issued", "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/weather/articles/c9rkyjzgp6kdo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-21T12:00:00Z", "source_name": "bournemouthecho.co.uk", "title": "Weather warning as Storm Austen to bring 50mph winds", "title_en": "Weather warning as Storm Austen to bring 50mph winds", "url": "https://www.bournemouthecho.co.uk/news/26656286.weather-warning-storm-austen-bring-50mph-winds/"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-21T14:30:00Z", "source_name": "readingchronicle.co.uk", "title": "Storm Austen - Reading set for wet weather as warning issued", "title_en": "Storm Austen - Reading set for wet weather as warning issued", "url": "https://www.readingchronicle.co.uk/news/26656655.storm-austen---reading-set-wet-weather-warning-issued/"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-22T04:30:00Z", "source_name": "burnham-on-sea.com", "title": "Weathe