out half a kilometre opened a large sinkhole in the Villa El Mirador sector, which occurred roughly a week earlier. More than 150 families were evacuated as a result. The item focuses on the alert and evacuation response rather than on monitoring or forecasting.", "title": "More than 150 families evacuated due to half-kilometre sinkhole and Red Alert declared for Arauco", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
