l warning issued", "url": "https://www.liverpoolecho.co.uk/news/liverpool-news/merseyrail-lines-disrupted-storm-boleo-34814095"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-25T11:00:00Z", "source_name": "thewestmorlandgazette.co.uk", "title": "Storm Boelo: Cumbria flood warnings lifted but more could follow", "title_en": "Storm Boelo: Cumbria flood warnings lifted but more could follow", "url": "https://www.thewestmorlandgazette.co.uk/news/26667845.storm-boelo-cumbria-flood-warnings-lifted-follow/"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-25T11:15:00Z", "source_name": "belfastlive.co.uk", "title": "Further yellow weather warning issued for parts of Northern Ireland", "title_en": "Further yellow weather warning issued for parts of Northern Ireland", "url": "https://www.belfastlive.co.uk/news/belfast-news/further-yellow-weather-warning-issued-34814276"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The UK Met Office issued an Amber wind warning covering much of Scotland, parts of Northern Ireland and northern England, associated with Storm Boelo as Storm Austen moves through the region. The warning reflects forecasting and public warning of a significant wind hazard. No impacts or responses are reported in the snippet.", "title": "Amber warning issued for Storm Boelo as Storm Austen moves through", "wmo_regions": ["VI"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(142,'','wildfire','2026-10-24T03:17:00Z','2026-10-24T03:14:25Z','2026-10-24','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": "PE", "name": "SENAMHI", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Ministerio del Ambiente (MINAM)", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "PE", "name": "Peru"}], "event_date": "2026-10-24", "event_location": "Peru", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-24T03:14:25Z", "hazard": "wildfire", "hazards": ["wildfire"], "id": 142, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-24T03:14:25Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports SENAMHI''s assessment that rainfall temporarily reduced atmospheric conditions favourable to wildfire spread, but gives no information on warnings received or actions taken.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "SENAMHI Perú noticias", "title": "SENAMHI: Lluvias reducen temporalmente condiciones para la propagación de incendios forestales en la sierra y selva", "title_en": "SENAMHI: Rains temporarily reduce conditions for wildfire spread in the highlands and jungle", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/senamhi/noticias/1461793-senamhi-lluvias-reducen-temporalmente-condiciones-para-la-propagacion-de-incendios-forestales-en-la-sierra-y-selva"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El SENAMHI informa que las lluvias en diversos sectores del país redujeron temporalmente las condiciones atmosféricas favorables para la propagación de incendios forestales en la sierra y selva."}, "summary_en": "SENAMHI, Peru''s national meteorological and hydrological service, reports that rainfall in several areas temporarily reduced the atmospheric conditions favourable to wildfire spread in the highlands and jungle regions. The item is a monitoring and assessment update from the NMHS published on its news portal, but the snippet does not describe specific warnings, forecasts or dissemination.", "title": "SENAMHI: Rains temporarily reduce conditions for wildfire spread in the highlands and jungle", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(143,'severe_storm|PE|selva','severe_storm','2026-10-24T03:17:02Z','2026-10-24T03:14:35Z','2026-10-24','{"actions": ["INDECI recommends preparedness measures in response to SENAMHI yellow-level Meteorological Warning No. 434"], "agencies": [{"country": "PE", "name": "SENAMHI", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "INDECI", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.93, "countries": [{"code": "PE", "name": "Peru"}], "event_date": "2026-10-24", "event_location": "Selva, Peru", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-24T03:14:35Z", "hazard": "severe_storm", "hazards": ["severe_storm"], "id": 143, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-24T03:14:35Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports the issuance of a yellow-level wind warning and recommended preparedness measures, but no outcomes are described.", "pillars": [3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "INDECI Perú noticias", "title": "INDECI recomienda medidas de preparación ante el incremento de la velocidad del viento en la selva", "title_en": "INDECI recommends preparedness measures ahead of increased wind speed in the jungle", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/indeci/noticias/1461965-indeci-recomienda-medidas-de-preparacion-ante-el-incremento-de-la-velocidad-del-viento-en-la-selva"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "INDECI recomienda adoptar medidas de preparación ante el Aviso Meteorológico N.° 434 (nivel amarillo) del SENAMHI, que informa sobre el incremento de la velocidad del viento de ligera a moderada intensidad en la selva."}, "summary_en": "INDECI, Peru''s civil defence institute, recommends preparedness measures following SENAMHI''s yellow-level Meteorological Warning No. 434, which reports an increase in light-to-moderate wind speeds in the jungle region. The item documents the warning''s dissemination through an official press release and the subsequent call for preparedness actions.", "title": "INDECI recommends preparedness measures ahead of increased wind speed in the jungle", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(144,'wildfire|PE|apurimac','wildfire','2026-10-24T03:17:03Z','2026-10-24T03:14:35Z','2026-10-24','{"actions": ["Firefighting and control operations in affected departments coordinated by COEN"], "agencies": [{"country": "PE", "name": "Centro de Operaciones de Emergencia Nacional (COEN)", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "INDECI", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other_national_agency"], "channels": ["other"], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "PE", "name": "Peru"}], "event_date": "2026-10-24", "event_location": "Apurímac, Cusco and Junín, Peru", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-24T03:14:35Z", "hazard": "wildfire", "hazards": ["wildfire"], "id": 144, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-24T03:14:35Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "positive", "outcome_justification": "Official press release reports that the forest fires in the three departments were brought under control.", "pillars": [4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "INDECI Perú noticias", "title": "Controlan incendios forestales en Apurímac, Cusco y Junín", "title_en": "Forest fires controlled in Apurímac, Cusco and Junín", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/indeci/noticias/1461585-controlan-incendios-forestales-en-apurimac-cusco-y-junin"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "INDECI, a través del COEN, informa que los incendios forestales en Apurímac, Cusco y Junín fueron controlados. La nota describe la coordinación de la respuesta de emergencia, aunque no detalla pronósticos ni alertas emitidos previamente."}, "summary_en": "INDECI, through the National Emergency Operations Center (COEN), reports that forest fires recorded in Apurímac, Cusco and Junín have been controlled. The release describes the emergency coordination response to the wildfires, though it does not detail forecasts or warnings issued beforehand. Impacts are not specified in the snippet.", "title": "Forest fires controlled in Apurímac, Cusco and Junín", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(145,'','earthquake','2026-10-24T03:17:06Z','2026-10-24T03:09:24Z','2026-10-23','{"actions": ["Suspended delivery of earthquake early warnings to SoftBank mobile users until the 26th of this month due to a serious PHP vulnerability"], "agencies": [{"country": "JP", "name": "SoftBank", "type": "other"}], "agency_types": ["other"], "channels": ["cell_broadcast"], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}], "event_date": "2026-10-23", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-24T03:09:24Z", "hazard": "earthquake", "hazards": ["earthquake"], "id": 145, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["ja"], "last_updated": "2026-10-24T03:09:24Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "negative", "outcome_justification": "Disruption of earthquake early warning dissemination to SoftBank customers because of a serious security vulnerability; warnings were not delivered during the suspension period.", "pillars": [3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-23T08:41:31Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 社会", "title": "ソフトバンク 緊急地震速報の配信を一時停止 PHP影響で", "title_en": "SoftBank suspends earthquake early warning delivery due to PHP vulnerability", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261023de64237"}], "summaries_original": {"ja": "ソフトバンクは自社の携帯電話利用者への緊急地震速報などの配信を今月26日まで停止すると発表した。PHPの重大な脆弱性が原因とされる。"}, "summary_en": "SoftBank announced it will halt delivery of earthquake early warnings and related alerts to its mobile customers until the 26th of this month after a serious vulnerability was found in the PHP programming language. The suspension interrupts a key warning dissemination channel for Japanese mobile users during the period.", "title": "SoftBank suspends earthquake early warning delivery due to PHP vulnerability", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(146,'','multi_hazard','2026-10-24T03:17:07Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','2026-10-23','{"actions": [], "agencies": [], "agency_types": [], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.7, "countries": [], "event_date": "2026-10-23", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-24T03:04:57Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 146, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-24T03:04:57Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes a scoping review of anticipatory action design, implementation and evaluation; no specific event outcomes are reported.", "pillars": [4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-23T09:19:16Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Anticipatory action: design, implementation and evaluation", "title_en": "Anticipatory action: design, implementation and evaluation", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/anticipatory-action-design-implementation-and-evaluation"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "A scoping review synthesises recurring dilemmas across the design, implementation, evaluation and future direction of anticipatory action (AA), which triggers preparedness and response ahead of forecast hazards. The item is relevant as it addresses how forecast-based early action is designed and evaluated, though it reports no specific event.", "title": "Anticipatory action: design, implementation and evaluation", "wmo_regions": []}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(147,'flood|MW|mzuzu','flood','2026-10-24T03:17:07Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','2026-10-23','{"actions": ["Community monitors collect monthly data on rainfall, flood points, new arrivals and service gaps in three wards of Mzuzu"], "agencies": [{"country": "MW", "name": "Community monitors (30, three wards)", "type": "other"}], "agency_types": ["other"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "MW", "name": "Malawi"}], "event_date": "2026-10-23", "event_location": "Mzuzu, Malawi", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-24T03:04:57Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flood"], "id": 147, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-24T03:04:57Z", "lead_time": "24 to 48 hours late (warnings reached flood-prone wards late)", "outcome": "negative", "outcome_justification": "Flood-prone wards were reportedly receiving warnings 24 to 48 hours late, indicating a shortcoming in warning timeliness.", "pillars": [1, 2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-23T13:31:44Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Malawi: Localising climate mobility data for early warning and planning in Mzuzu", "title_en": "Malawi: Localising climate mobility data for early warning and planning in Mzuzu", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/resource/case-study/malawi-localising-climate-mobility-data-early-warning-and-planning-mzuzu"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "Flood-prone wards in Mzuzu were receiving warnings 24 to 48 hours late. A case study describes how 30 community monitors in three wards now collect monthly data on rainfall, flood points, new arrivals and service gaps to localise early warning and planning.", "title": "Malawi: Localising climate mobility data for early warning and planning in Mzuzu", "wmo_regions": ["I"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(148,'','drought','2026-10-24T03:17:07Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','2026-10-23','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": "PH", "name": "PAGASA", "type": "NMHS"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "PH", "name": "Philippines"}], "event_date": "2026-10-23", "event_location": "Philippines", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-24T03:04:57Z", "hazard": "drought", "hazards": ["drought"], "id": 148, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-24T03:04:57Z", "lead_time": "peak expected December; persisting through first half of 2027", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports PAGASA''s warning of a very strong El Niño and expected impacts but gives no information on outcomes of the warning.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-23T13:34:55Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Bracing for El Niño: impacts, risks and response in the Philippines", "title_en": "Bracing for El Niño: impacts, risks and response in the Philippines", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/news/bracing-el-nino-impacts-risks-and-response-philippines"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "PAGASA has warned of a ''very strong'' El Niño peaking in December 2026 and persisting through the first half of 2027. The forecast anticipates dry spells and drought across most of the Philippines, with monsoon-related flooding in the west. The article focuses on preparing for these impacts and response.", "title": "Bracing for El Niño: impacts, risks and response in the Philippines", "wmo_regions": ["II", "V"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(149,'named|ditwah','landslide','2026-10-24T03:17:08Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','2026-10-23','{"actions": ["risk mapping", "mitigation works", "resettlement of displaced households", "community awareness"], "agencies": [], "agency_types": [], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "LK", "name": "Sri Lanka"}], "event_date": "2026-10-23", "event_location": "Kegalle District, Sri Lanka", "event_name": "Cyclone Ditwah", "first_seen": "2026-10-24T03:04:57Z", "hazard": "landslide", "hazards": ["landslide"], "id": 149, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-24T03:04:57Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes risk management and relocation after the cyclone but does not report warning performance or outcomes of warnings.", "pillars": [1, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-23T13:36:40Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Sri Lanka: Managing landslide risk and planned relocation in Kegalle District", "title_en": "Sri Lanka: Managing landslide risk and planned relocation in Kegalle District", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/resource/case-study/sri-lanka-managing-landslide-risk-and-planned-relocation-kegalle-district"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "A case study on landslide risk management in Kegalle District, Sri Lanka, where about 20 per cent of the land is landslide-susceptible. It covers risk mapping, mitigation, planned resettlement and community awareness after Cyclone Ditwah displaced thousands. The snippet focuses on risk knowledge and preparedness rather than specific warning performance.", "title": "Sri Lanka: Managing landslide risk and planned relocation in Kegalle District", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(150,'earthquake|US|pacific islands and hawaii','tsunami','2026-10-24T03:17:09Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','2026-10-23','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": null, "name": "Pacific Tsunami Warning Center", "type": "other"}, {"country": "US", "name": "National Weather Service", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["mobile_app", "other"], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "US", "name": "United States"}], "event_date": "2026-10-23", "event_location": "Pacific Islands and Hawaii, USA", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-24T03:04:57Z", "hazard": "tsunami", "hazards": ["tsunami"], "id": 150, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-24T03:04:57Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet is a policy commentary on gaps in tsunami warning-to-evacuation translation, with no specific event outcome reported.", "pillars": [3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-23T13:40:14Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "When the ocean comes inland: Tsunami preparedness policy for Pacific island and Hawaii coastal communities — What the warning systems miss", "title_en": "When the ocean comes inland: Tsunami preparedness policy for Pacific island and Hawaii coastal communities — What the warning systems miss", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/when-ocean-comes-inland-tsunami-preparedness-policy-pacific"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "This commentary examines how tsunami warnings translate into evacuation in Pacific Island and Hawaii coastal communities. It recommends multilingual alerts, evacuation route analysis, and community-based preparedness programmes to close gaps in warning effectiveness.", "title": "When the ocean comes inland: Tsunami preparedness policy for Pacific island and Hawaii coastal communities — What the warning systems miss", "wmo_regions": ["IV", "V"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(151,'named|lahaina wildfire','wildfire','2026-10-24T03:17:09Z','2026-10-24T03:04:57Z','2026-10-23','{"actions": ["Recommendation to assess vulnerable communities", "Recommendation to establish 30-day emergency supply reserves", "Recommendation to integrate wildfire into Hawaiʻi emergency management plans"], "agencies": [{"country": "US", "name": "Maui Emergency Management Agency", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "US", "name": "United States"}], "event_date": "2026-10-23", "event_location": "Lahaina, Maui, United States", "event_name": "Lahaina wildfire", "first_seen": "2026-10-24T03:04:57Z", "hazard": "wildfire", "hazards": ["wildfire"], "id": 151, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-24T03:04:57Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "negative", "outcome_justification": "The assessment identifies framework failures and remaining gaps in emergency management reform, implying shortcomings in the response to the wildfire, though specific warning failures are not detailed in the snippet.", "pillars": [1, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-23T13:40:52Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Maui wildfire emergency management reform: Three years after Lahaina — An independent assessment of framework reform progress and remaining gaps", "title_en": "Maui wildfire emergency management reform: Three years after Lahaina — An independent assessment of framework reform progress and remaining gaps", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/maui-wildfire-emergency-management-reform-three-years-after"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-23T13:41:13Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "After the fire: Three years on — what the Maui wildfire reveals about emergency management policy for island communities", "title_en": "After the fire: Three years on — what the Maui wildfire reveals about emergency management policy for island communities", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/after-fire-three-years-what-maui-wildfire-reveals-about"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "An independent research report assesses emergency management reform three years after the Lahaina wildfire on Maui. It identifies four framework failures and recommends island-specific reviews, compliance standards and response-time assessments. The report is relevant to how emergency management and response to wildfire warnings have been reformed.", "title": "Maui wildfire emergency management reform: Three years after Lahaina — An independent assessment of framework reform progress and remaining gaps", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
