 reduction in a district of Lambayeque. The snippet does not describe monitoring, forecasts or warnings issued, so the early warning link is only indirect.", "title": "SENAMHI participates in FAO initiative to strengthen wildfire prevention in Lambayeque", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
