tion in the highlands", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(228,'severe_storm|AR|buenos aires','severe_storm','2026-10-31T04:15:13Z','2026-11-02T04:15:05Z','2026-10-30','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": "AR", "name": "Servicio Meteorológico Nacional", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "AR", "name": "Servicio Meteorológico Nacional (SMN)", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "AR", "name": "Clarín", "type": "media"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "media"], "channels": ["other", "website"], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "AR", "name": "Argentina"}], "event_date": "2026-10-30", "event_location": "Buenos Aires, Argentina", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-31T04:14:01Z", "hazard": "severe_storm", "hazards": ["severe_storm"], "id": 228, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-02T04:15:05Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports a yellow alert issued for storms and possible hail and its extension to several provinces, but gives no information on the warning''s effects or on actions taken.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-30T06:36:49Z", "source_name": "Clarín (Argentina) sociedad", "title": "Tras el diluvio en la Ciudad, se extendió la alerta amarilla por tormentas y posible granizo para el AMBA y las provincias de Buenos Aires, Santa Fe y Entre Ríos", "title_en": "After the downpour in the City, the yellow alert for storms and possible hail was extended to the AMBA and the provinces of Buenos Aires, Santa Fe and Entre Ríos", "url": "https://www.clarin.com/sociedad/alerta-amarilla-tormentas-amba-zonas-provincias-buenos-aires-santa-fe-rios_0_vXhUbMlZQa.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-01T13:01:27Z", "source_name": "Clarín (Argentina) sociedad", "title": "Súper Niño 2026 en Argentina, EN VIVO: llegan las tormentas al AMBA y rige alerta amarilla hasta la noche", "title_en": "Super El Niño 2026 in Argentina, LIVE: storms reach Buenos Aires metropolitan area and yellow alert in force until night", "url": "https://www.clarin.com/sociedad/super-nino-2026-argentina-vivo-llegan-tormentas-amba-rige-alerta-amarilla-noche_0_k3QtG05aRh.html"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Tras una fuerte lluvia en la Ciudad de Buenos Aires y granizo en el sur del conurbano, se extendió la alerta amarilla por tormentas y posible granizo al AMBA y a las provincias de Buenos Aires, Santa Fe y Entre Ríos, con el pronóstico del Servicio Meteorológico para el fin de semana."}, "summary_en": "Following heavy rain in Buenos Aires City and hail in the southern conurbano, a yellow alert for storms and possible hail was extended to the AMBA and the provinces of Buenos Aires, Santa Fe and Entre Ríos. The article describes the expected timing of the most intense conditions and the weather service''s outlook for the weekend.", "title": "After the downpour in the City, the yellow alert for storms and possible hail was extended to the AMBA and the provinces of Buenos Aires, Santa Fe and Entre Ríos", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(229,'flood|BA|bihac','flood','2026-10-31T04:15:14Z','2026-10-31T04:07:58Z','2026-10-30','{"actions": ["Established a pre-financed emergency social protection mechanism in 2025 integrating hazard mapping and welfare data to support vulnerable households during future floods and landslides"], "agencies": [{"country": "BA", "name": "Bihać local government", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.6, "countries": [{"code": "BA", "name": "Bosnia and Herzegovina"}], "event_date": "2026-10-30", "event_location": "Bihać, Bosnia and Herzegovina", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-31T04:07:58Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flood"], "id": 229, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-31T04:07:58Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes a newly established preparedness mechanism but reports no outcomes of its use during a hazard event.", "pillars": [1, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-30T10:51:40Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "When resilience becomes a budget line: how local governments in Bosnia and Herzegovina are pre-financing social protection", "title_en": "When resilience becomes a budget line: how local governments in Bosnia and Herzegovina are pre-financing social protection", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/news/when-resilience-becomes-budget-line-how-local-governments-bosnia-and-herzegovina-are-pre"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "Following the 2022 floods, Bihać in Bosnia and Herzegovina established a pre-financed emergency social protection mechanism in 2025. The mechanism integrates hazard mapping and welfare data to enable rapid support for vulnerable households during future floods and landslides. The item focuses on preparedness and risk knowledge rather than a specific warning event.", "title": "When resilience becomes a budget line: how local governments in Bosnia and Herzegovina are pre-financing social protection", "wmo_regions": ["VI"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(230,'','other','2026-10-31T04:15:14Z','2026-10-31T04:07:58Z','2026-10-30','{"actions": [], "agencies": [], "agency_types": [], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.6, "countries": [], "event_date": "2026-10-30", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-31T04:07:58Z", "hazard": "other", "hazards": ["other"], "id": 230, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-31T04:07:58Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet discusses public trust in AI-generated emergency alert communication in general terms, without describing a specific warning event or its outcome.", "pillars": [3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-30T10:53:41Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Would you trust an emergency alert written by AI?", "title_en": "Would you trust an emergency alert written by AI?", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/news/would-you-trust-emergency-alert-written-ai"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The article examines whether people would trust emergency alerts written by AI and notes that humans struggle with disaster communication. It suggests chatbots could help warning dissemination, provided the public takes them seriously. No specific hazard event or warning outcome is described in the snippet.", "title": "Would you trust an emergency alert written by AI?", "wmo_regions": []}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(231,'flood|CN|beijing','flood','2026-10-31T04:15:16Z','2026-10-31T04:07:58Z','2026-10-30','{"actions": [], "agencies": [], "agency_types": [], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.7, "countries": [{"code": "CN", "name": "China"}], "event_date": "2026-10-30", "event_location": "Beijing, China", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-31T04:07:58Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flood"], "id": 231, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-31T04:07:58Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The study is a stated preference analysis of hypothetical evacuation choices; it reports no actual warning outcomes.", "pillars": [3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-30T10:54:06Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Micro-behavioral responses for enhancing urban flood resilience: Stated preference analysis of residents'' evacuation choices in high-density urban areas", "title_en": "Micro-behavioral responses for enhancing urban flood resilience: Stated preference analysis of residents'' evacuation choices in high-density urban areas", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/micro-behavioral-responses-enhancing-urban-flood-resilience"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "A stated preference study of residents in Beijing flood zones finds that evacuation choices prioritise survival risk over travel time and favour intelligent dynamic signals for guiding evacuation. Preferences vary by age, gender and education. The work informs how flood warnings and evacuation guidance could be designed to improve urban flood resilience.", "title": "Micro-behavioral responses for enhancing urban flood resilience: Stated preference analysis of residents'' evacuation choices in high-density urban areas", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(232,'multi_hazard|KE|mombasa','multi_hazard','2026-10-31T04:15:17Z','2026-10-31T04:07:57Z','2026-10-30','{"actions": ["Adoption of the Mombasa Ministerial Declaration on Anticipatory Action by IGAD Member State ministers responsible for disaster risk management and humanitarian affairs", "Commitment to institutionalise anticipatory action in national policies, strengthen early warning systems, enhance regional coordination and secure sustainable financing"], "agencies": [{"country": null, "name": "Intergovernmental Authority on Development (IGAD)", "type": "international"}], "agency_types": ["international"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "KE", "name": "Kenya"}], "event_date": "2026-10-30", "event_location": "Mombasa, Kenya", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-31T04:07:57Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 232, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-31T04:07:57Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item is a policy declaration with no reported hazard event outcomes; it describes commitments rather than observed results of warnings.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-30T13:35:42Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "World: Mombasa Ministerial Declaration on Anticipatory Action, 2026", "title_en": "World: Mombasa Ministerial Declaration on Anticipatory Action, 2026", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/world/mombasa-ministerial-declaration-anticipatory-action-2026"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "Ministers from IGAD Member States adopted the Mombasa Ministerial Declaration on Anticipatory Action on 30 October 2026 during the Second Eastern Africa Dialogue Platform on Anticipatory Action in Mombasa, Kenya. The declaration commits states to institutionalising anticipatory action, strengthening early warning systems and enhancing regional coordination. It is relevant to early warning services as a policy commitment to improve warning and anticipatory action systems.", "title": "World: Mombasa Ministerial Declaration on Anticipatory Action, 2026", "wmo_regions": ["I"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(233,'volcanic|PH|albay','volcanic','2026-10-31T04:15:18Z','2026-11-06T04:11:25Z','2026-10-31','{"actions": ["Residents within the 6-km permanent danger zone evacuated their homes", "Local authorities moved families to safer grounds and evacuation centers", "Evacuation of residents displaced by Mayon unrest", "Cash-for-work program paying evacuees P5,005 each after 11 days of community work in Camalig"], "agencies": [{"country": "PH", "name": "PHIVOLCS", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PH", "name": "Philippine Institute of Volcanology and Seismology (PHIVOLCS)", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.9, "countries": [{"code": "PH", "name": "Philippines"}], "event_date": "2026-10-31", "event_location": "Albay, Philippines", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-31T04:12:16Z", "hazard": "volcanic", "hazards": ["volcanic"], "id": 233, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-06T04:11:25Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports evacuation following the explosive eruption but does not state whether warnings preceded the blast or whether casualties occurred.", "pillars": [4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-31T05:06:00Z", "source_name": "Philippine Daily Inquirer", "title": "Mayon blast forces evacuation in Albay", "title_en": "Mayon blast forces evacuation in Albay", "url": "https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2333249/mayon-blast-forces-evacuation-in-albay"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-06T05:04:00Z", "source_name": "Philippine Daily Inquirer", "title": "In Albay, Mayon evacuees get aid as volcanic unrest persists", "title_en": "In Albay, Mayon evacuees get aid as volcanic unrest persists", "url": "https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2336837/in-albay-mayon-evacuees-get-aid-as-volcanic-unrest-persists"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "Residents within the 6-kilometre permanent danger zone of Mt. Mayon evacuated on Friday after an explosive eruption that some described as a bomb blast. Local authorities moved families to safer grounds and evacuation centres. The snippet does not indicate whether advance warnings were issued.", "title": "Mayon blast forces evacuation in Albay", "wmo_regions": ["II", "V"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(234,'other|PE|piura','other','2026-11-01T04:19:02Z','2026-11-01T04:18:09Z','2026-11-01','{"actions": ["Participation in the II Regional Forum on El Niño and Piura agriculture on prevention, mitigation and preparedness for climate events"], "agencies": [{"country": "PE", "name": "SENAMHI", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Ministerio del Ambiente (MINAM)", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["other"], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "PE", "name": "Peru"}], "event_date": "2026-11-01", "event_location": "Piura, Peru", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-01T04:18:09Z", "hazard": "other", "hazards": ["other"], "id": 234, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-01T04:18:09Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes a forum presenting climate outlooks and El Niño scenarios but reports no outcomes of warnings.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "SENAMHI Perú noticias", "title": "SENAMHI presenta perspectivas climáticas y escenarios de El Niño para fortalecer la preparación del agro piurano", "title_en": "SENAMHI presents climate outlooks and El Niño scenarios to strengthen Piura agriculture preparedness", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/senamhi/noticias/1466477-senamhi-presenta-perspectivas-climaticas-y-escenarios-de-el-nino-para-fortalecer-la-preparacion-del-agro-piurano"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El SENAMHI participó en el II Foro Regional Fenómeno El Niño y Agro Piurano, presentando perspectivas climáticas y escenarios de El Niño para fortalecer la preparación frente a eventos climáticos."}, "summary_en": "SENAMHI, Peru''s national meteorological and hydrological service, took part in the second regional forum on El Niño and Piura agriculture, presenting climate outlooks and El Niño scenarios. The aim is to strengthen agricultural preparedness for climate events through prevention and mitigation actions. The item concerns forecasting and preparedness rather than a specific warning outcome.", "title": "SENAMHI presents climate outlooks and El Niño scenarios to strengthen Piura agriculture preparedness", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(235,'other|PE|quebrada cansas','other','2026-11-01T04:19:04Z','2026-11-01T04:18:09Z','2026-11-01','{"actions": ["Second technical visit by SENAMHI and Consorcio S&F to exchange information on the operation of a meteorological radar supporting the Quebrada Cansas integral solution project"], "agencies": [{"country": "PE", "name": "SENAMHI", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Consorcio S&F", "type": "other"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Ministerio del Ambiente (MINAM)", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other", "other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.6, "countries": [{"code": "PE", "name": "Peru"}], "event_date": "2026-11-01", "event_location": "Quebrada Cansas, Peru", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-01T04:18:09Z", "hazard": "other", "hazards": ["other"], "id": 235, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-01T04:18:09Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes a technical coordination visit about radar operation; no warning outcome is reported.", "pillars": [2], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "SENAMHI Perú noticias", "title": "SENAMHI y Consorcio S&F realizan visita técnica para intercambiar información sobre el funcionamiento del radar meteorológico", "title_en": "SENAMHI and Consorcio S&F carry out technical visit to exchange information on the operation of the meteorological radar", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/senamhi/noticias/1466473-senamhi-y-consorcio-s-f-realizan-visita-tecnica-para-intercambiar-informacion-sobre-el-funcionamiento-del-radar-meteorologico"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El SENAMHI realizó una segunda visita técnica junto al Consorcio S&F, a cargo del proyecto \"Solución Integral de la Quebrada Cansas\", para intercambiar información sobre el funcionamiento del radar meteorológico."}, "summary_en": "SENAMHI, Peru''s national meteorological and hydrological service, held a second technical visit with Consorcio S&F, the contractor for the Quebrada Cansas integral solution project, to exchange information on how the meteorological radar operates. The item concerns monitoring infrastructure supporting hazard detection, but reports no warning issued or outcome.", "title": "SENAMHI and Consorcio S&F carry out technical visit to exchange information on the operation of the meteorological radar", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(236,'flood|PE|central and southern coast','heavy_rain','2026-11-01T04:19:05Z','2026-11-06T04:13:49Z','2026-11-01','{"actions": ["INDECI recommends preparedness measures in response to SENAMHI meteorological warning No. 450 (orange level)", "INDECI recommended preparedness measures in response to SENAMHI yellow-level meteorological warning No. 454 on continued light to moderate rain and/or drizzle"], "agencies": [{"country": "PE", "name": "SENAMHI", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "INDECI", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["other", "website"], "confidence": 0.93, "countries": [{"code": "PE", "name": "Peru"}], "event_date": "2026-11-01", "event_location": "Central and southern coast, Peru", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-01T04:18:19Z", "hazard": "heavy_rain", "hazards": ["heavy_rain"], "id": 236, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-06T04:13:49Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes the issuance of a warning and recommended preparedness measures but reports no outcome.", "pillars": [3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "INDECI Perú noticias", "title": "INDECI recomienda medidas de preparación ante precipitaciones en la costa centro y sur", "title_en": "INDECI recommends preparedness measures for rainfall on the central and southern coast", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/indeci/noticias/1466672-indeci-recomienda-medidas-de-preparacion-ante-precipitaciones-en-la-costa-centro-y-sur"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "INDECI Perú noticias", "title": "INDECI recomienda medidas de preparación ante continuidad de las precipitaciones en la costa centro y sur", "title_en": "INDECI recommends preparedness measures ahead of continued rainfall on the central and southern coast", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/indeci/noticias/1470089-indeci-recomienda-medidas-de-preparacion-ante-continuidad-de-las-precipitaciones-en-la-costa-centro-y-sur"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "INDECI recomienda medidas de preparación ante el aviso meteorológico N.° 450 (nivel naranja) del SENAMHI, que informa sobre precipitaciones (lluvia y/o lloviznas) de moderada a fuerte intensidad en la costa centro y sur."}, "summary_en": "INDECI, Peru''s national civil defence institute, issued preparedness recommendations following SENAMHI meteorological warning No. 450 at orange level, which forecasts moderate to heavy rain and/or drizzle on the central and southern coast. The warning concerns the communication of an impending precipitation event and the measures recommended in response.", "title": "INDECI recommends preparedness measures for rainfall on the central and southern coast", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(237,'','tsunami','2026-11-01T04:19:06Z','2026-11-01T04:07:17Z','2026-10-30','{"actions": ["Development of tsunami forecasts in seconds using supercomputing and digital twin technology"], "agencies": [{"country": "US", "name": "Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory", "type": "other"}], "agency_types": ["other"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [], "event_date": "2026-10-30", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-01T04:07:17Z", "hazard": "tsunami", "hazards": ["tsunami"], "id": 237, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-01T04:07:17Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item describes research and potential future capability for faster tsunami forecasts; no warning outcomes for an actual event are reported.", "pillars": [2], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-30T15:53:10Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Big Ideas Lab explores how supercomputing could transform tsunami forecasting", "title_en": "Big Ideas Lab explores how supercomputing could transform tsunami forecasting", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/news/big-ideas-lab-explores-how-supercomputing-could-transform-tsunami-forecasting"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "Researchers at Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory are developing supercomputing and digital twin approaches to produce tsunami forecasts within seconds. The work aims to enable more accurate early warnings for coastal communities facing imminent tsunami threats. The item concerns forecasting research rather than a specific event.", "title": "Big Ideas Lab explores how supercomputing could transform tsunami forecasting", "wmo_regions": []}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(238,'','heatwave','2026-11-01T04:19:06Z','2026-11-01T04:07:17Z','2026-10-30','{"actions": ["Affordable heat adaptation measures for tourism", "Worker protection measures", "Climate-resilient tourism planning", "Use of the H.E.A.T. Framework"], "agencies": [], "agency_types": [], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.7, "countries": [], "event_date": "2026-10-30", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-01T04:07:17Z", "hazard": "heatwave", "hazards": ["heatwave"], "id": 238, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-01T04:07:17Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The article is a forward-looking piece on recommended measures; no specific warning outcomes are reported.", "pillars": [3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-30T15:53:56Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "How Asia and the Pacific can take the heat off tourism", "title_en": "How Asia and the Pacific can take the heat off tourism", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/news/how-asia-and-pacific-can-take-heat-tourism"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The article argues that the tourism sector in Asia and the Pacific can lead efforts to address extreme heat through affordable measures, early warning systems, worker protection and climate-resilient planning. It presents the H.E.A.T. Framework as a practical approach. The early warning aspect is mentioned as one of several recommended measures.", "title": "How Asia and the Pacific can take the heat off tourism", "wmo_regions": ["II", "V"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(239,'','heavy_rain','2026-11-01T04:19:06Z','2026-11-01T04:18:09Z','2026-10-31','{"actions": ["Sinaproc extended the prevention notice for rain and storms until 3 November"], "agencies": [{"country": "PA", "name": "Imhpa", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "PA", "name": "Sinaproc", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.9, "countries": [{"code": "PA", "name": "Panama"}], "event_date": "2026-10-31", "event_location": "Panama", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-01T04:18:09Z", "hazard": "heavy_rain", "hazards": ["heavy_rain"], "id": 239, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-01T04:18:09Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item reports a warning issued and extended but does not describe its impacts or how it was received.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-31T04:18:04Z", "source_name": "infobae.com", "title": "Nueva alerta meteorológica en Panamá agrava la preocupación por las zonas devastadas por el terremoto - Infobae", "title_en": "New weather alert in Panama heightens concern for areas devastated by earthquake", "url": "https://www.infobae.com/panama/2026/10/30/nueva-alerta-meteorologica-en-panama-agrava-la-preocupacion-por-las-zonas-devastadas-por-el-terremoto/"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El Sinaproc extendió hasta el 3 de noviembre el aviso de prevención por lluvias y tormentas en gran parte de Panamá, coincidiendo con zonas afectadas por el terremoto del 9 de octubre. El Imhpa advierte sobre posibles inundaciones, crecidas repentinas de ríos, deslizamientos y ráfagas de viento."}, "summary_en": "Panama''s civil protection agency Sinaproc extended until 3 November a prevention notice for rain and storms covering much of the country, including areas hit by the 9 October earthquake. The national meteorological service Imhpa warns of possible flooding, flash floods in rivers, landslides and strong gusts of wind.", "title": "New weather alert in Panama heightens concern for areas devastated by earthquake", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(240,'flood|MX|baja california','heavy_rain','2026-11-01T04:19:06Z','2026-11-02T04:14:53Z','2026-10-31','{"actions": ["Preventive opening of five temporary shelters in Mexicali", "Alert issued by the state governor about very heavy rains from 31 October"], "agencies": [{"country": "MX", "name": "Coordinación Estatal de Protección Civil de Baja California", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "MX", "name": "Gobierno de Baja California", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "MX", "name": "Gobierno de Mexicali", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other_national_agency"], "channels": ["other"], "confidence": 0.9, "countries": [{"code": "MX", "name": "Mexico"}], "event_date": "2026-10-31", "event_location": "Baja California, Mexico", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-01T04:18:09Z", "hazard": "heavy_rain", "hazards": ["heavy_rain"], "id": 240, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-02T04:14:53Z", "lead_time": "until Sunday 1 November 2026", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item reports a warning and forecast of heavy rain, strong winds and cooling but gives no information on outcomes or impacts.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-31T04:18:04Z", "source_name": "linderonorte.com", "title": "Advierte Protección Civil por aumento en el pronóstico de lluvias muy fuertes y alerta por riesgo de inundaciones", "title_en": "State Civil Protection warns of increased forecast for very heavy rains and flood risk", "url": "https://linderonorte.com/2026/10/31/advierte-proteccion-civil-por-aumento-en-el-pronostico-de-lluvias-muy-fuertes-y-alerta-por-riesgo-de-inundaciones/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-02T04:14:45Z", "source_name": "grupoanimal.mx", "title": "Alerta por fuertes lluvias en Baja California; abren albergues en Mexicali y Ensenada", "title_en": "Alert for heavy rains in Baja California; shelters opened in Mexicali and Ensenada", "url": "https://grupoanimal.mx/baja-california/seguridad/alerta-lluvias-fuertes-baja-california-albergues-mexicali-baja-temperatura-zona-serrana"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "La Coordinación Estatal de Protección Civil de Baja California advirtió un aumento del potencial de lluvias fuertes, puntualmente muy fuertes, con vientos intensos y descenso de temperaturas hasta el domingo 1 de noviembre, con acumulados mayores a 50 mm en los siete municipios."}, "summary_en": "The Baja California State Civil Protection Coordination warned that the potential for heavy rains, locally very heavy, strong winds and falling temperatures is increasing until Sunday 1 November 2026. Accumulations above 50 mm are expected across the state''s seven municipalities, raising flood risk.", "title": "State Civil Protection warns of increased forecast for very heavy rains and flood risk", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(241,'','flash_flood','2026-11-01T04:19:09Z','2026-11-01T04:10:57Z','2026-10-31','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": "BB", "name": "CIMH Caribbean Regional Climate Centre", "type": "RSMC"}], "agency_types": ["RSMC"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.6, "countries": [], "event_date": "2026-10-31", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-01T04:10:57Z", "hazard": "flash_flood", "hazards": ["flash_flood"], "id": 241, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-01T04:10:57Z", "lead_time": "three-month seasonal outlook (November 2026 to January 2027)", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "Snippet only announces a seasonal flash flood potential outlook; no warnings'' outcomes are described.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-31T19:38:28Z", "source_name": "CIMH Caribbean Regional Climate Centre", "title": "Flash Flood Potential Outlook November 2026 to January 2027", "title_en": "Flash Flood Potential Outlook November 2026 to January 2027", "url": "https://rcc.cimh.edu.bb/flash-flood-potential-outlook-november-2026-to-january-2027/"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The Caribbean Regional Climate Centre at CIMH published a flash flood potential outlook covering November 2026 to January 2027. It is a seasonal forecast product intended to inform Caribbean early warning and preparedness. The snippet provides no details on specific areas or impacts.", "title": "Flash Flood Potential Outlook November 2026 to January 2027", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(242,'drought|XX|caribbean','drought','2026-11-01T04:19:10Z','2026-11-01T04:10:57Z','2026-11-01','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": "BB", "name": "CIMH Caribbean Regional Climate Centre", "type": "RSMC"}, {"country": null, "name": "CariCOF", "type": "international"}], "agency_types": ["RSMC", "international"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.6, "countries": [], "event_date": "2026-11-01", "event_location": "Caribbean", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-01T04:10:57Z", "hazard": "drought", "hazards": ["drought"], "id": 242, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-01T04:10:57Z", "lead_time": "through end of January 2027", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "Snippet only describes a seasonal drought outlook publication; no outcomes or actions reported.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-01T00:26:16Z", "source_name": "CIMH Caribbean Regional Climate Centre", "title": "CariCOF Drought Outlook by the End of January 2027", "title_en": "CariCOF Drought Outlook by the End of January 2027", "url": "https://rcc.cimh.edu.bb/caricof-drought-outlook-by-the-end-of-january-2027/"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The Caribbean Regional Climate Centre at CIMH published a CariCOF drought outlook covering the period through the end of January 2027. The item is a regional climate forecast product for drought monitoring and advisory, with details available only in the full post.", "title": "CariCOF Drought Outlook by the End of January 2027", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(243,'multi_hazard|CO|golfo de uraba','multi_hazard','2026-11-01T04:19:11Z','2026-11-01T04:18:09Z','2026-11-01','{"actions": ["Ideam issued a preventive hydrological alert for the Gulf of Urabá and other Antioquia basins", "Río León basin declared in red hydrological alert", "Dimar warned of strong swell and high tides on the Caribbean Coast until 1 November"], "agencies": [{"country": "CO", "name": "Ideam", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "CO", "name": "Dimar", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.9, "countries": [{"code": "CO", "name": "Colombia"}], "event_date": "2026-11-01", "event_location": "Golfo de Urabá, Antioquia, Colombia", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-01T04:18:09Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 243, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-01T04:18:09Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports warnings issued but no outcomes, impacts or responses are described.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-01T04:18:04Z", "source_name": "co.headtopics.com", "title": "¡Alerta en el Golfo de Urabá! Ideam advierte inundaciones y fuerte oleaje en la Costa Caribe", "title_en": "Alert in the Gulf of Urabá! Ideam warns of floods and strong swell on the Caribbean Coast", "url": "https://co.headtopics.com/news/alerta-en-el-golfo-de-urab-ideam-advierte-inundaciones-y-89416154"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El Ideam emitió una alerta hidrológica preventiva para el Golfo de Urabá y otras cuencas de Antioquia por probabilidad de inundaciones y desbordamientos, y la cuenca del río León fue declarada en alerta roja hidrológica. La Dimar advierte fuerte oleaje en la Costa Caribe y mareas altas hasta el 1 de noviembre."}, "summary_en": "Colombia''s meteorological service Ideam issued a preventive hydrological alert for the Gulf of Urabá and other Antioquia basins over the probability of flooding and overflows, and declared the León river basin in red hydrological alert. The maritime agency Dimar warned of strong swell and high tides on the Caribbean Coast until 1 November.", "title": "Alert in the Gulf of Urabá! Ideam warns of floods and strong swell on the Caribbean Coast", "wmo_regions": ["III", "IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(244,'flood|PE|tumbes and piura','heavy_rain','2026-11-01T04:19:11Z','2026-11-06T04:13:52Z','2026-11-01','{"actions": ["Issued red alert via aviso N.° 306-2026 for activation of ravines in Piura and Tumbes", "Rescheduling of activities recommended in exposed zones", "Government mobilized resources toward northern Peru", "COEN issued a bulletin establishing a red alert across all of Tumbes territory", "COEN-INDECI maintained red danger level in Piura via bulletin N.° 210-2026", "Senamhi issued warning notice N.° 456 with rainfall expected until 8 November", "Senamhi activated a new red alert for strong to extreme rainfall in Tumbes and Piura", "EMAPE completed cleanup work after the 29/10 flood in Villa María del Triunfo"], "agencies": [{"country": "PE", "name": "Dirección Zonal 1 of Senamhi", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Senamhi", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "La República", "type": "media"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Autoridades locales (Tumbes)", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "COEN", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "COEN (Centro de Operaciones de Emergencia Nacional)", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "COEN-INDECI", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "EMAPE", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Government of Peru", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "INDECI (COEN)", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Midagri (Ministerio de Desarrollo Agrario y Riego)", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Ministerio del Ambiente (MINAM)", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Peruvian Army", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "media", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["other", "website"], "confidence": 0.97, "countries": [{"code": "PE", "name": "Peru"}], "event_date": "2026-11-01", "event_location": "Piura and Tumbes, Peru", "event_name": "Coastal El Niño", "first_seen": "2026-11-01T04:18:09Z", "hazard": "heavy_rain", "hazards": ["flash_flood", "flood", "heavy_rain"], "id": 244, "impacts": {"affected": 104000}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-06T04:13:52Z", "lead_time": "precipitation expected between 4 and 5 November; 24-hour warning", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports a red alert issued for intense rain in eight Piura provinces and three Tumbes provinces, valid until 2 November, but no impacts or outcomes are described.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "SENAMHI Perú noticias", "title": "SENAMHI pronostica lluvias intensas en Tumbes y Piura, y lloviznas en Lima Metropolitana", "title_en": "SENAMHI forecasts intense rain in Tumbes and Piura, and drizzle in Metropolitan Lima", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/senamhi/noticias/1470343-senamhi-pronostica-lluvias-intensas-en-tumbes-y-piura-y-lloviznas-en-lima-metropolitana"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-01T04:18:04Z", "source_name": "elcomercio.pe", "title": "Lluvias en el norte del Perú hoy EN VIVO: Piura, Tumbes y Lambayeque en alerta por precipitaciones", "title_en": "Rain in northern Peru LIVE: Piura, Tumbes and Lambayeque on alert for rainfall", "url": "https://elcomercio.pe/peru/lluvias-en-peru-en-vivo-el-nino-pronostico-de-senamhi-lluvias-temperatura-y-regiones-en-alerta-en-todo-el-pais-lbposting-noticia/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-02T04:14:45Z", "source_name": "infobae.com", "title": "Tumbes y Piura bajo alerta roja por lluvias intensas para esta noche: estas son las provincias que podrían registrar precipitaciones extremas - Infobae", "title_en": "Tumbes and Piura under red alert for intense rain tonight: these are the provinces that could record extreme precipitation", "url": "https://www.infobae.com/peru/2026/11/01/tumbes-y-piura-bajo-alerta-roja-por-lluvias-intensas-para-esta-noche-estas-son-las-provincias-que-podrian-registrar-precipitaciones-extremas/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-02T04:14:45Z", "source_name": "elcomercio.pe", "title": "Tumbes y Piura en alerta roja por lluvias extremas: por qué las precipitaciones podrían superar los 100 mm apuesplan", "title_en": "Tumbes and Piura on red alert due to extreme rainfall: why precipitation could exceed 100 mm", "url": "https://elcomercio.pe/peru/piura/tumbes-y-piura-en-alerta-roja-por-lluvias-extremas-por-que-las-precipitaciones-podrian-superar-los-100-mm-apuesplan-noticia/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-02T04:14:45Z", "source_name": "peru21.pe", "title": "Tumbes y Piura bajo alerta por lluvias extremas: COEN reporta nivel rojo en tres provincias", "title_en": "Tumbes and Piura under extreme rain alert: COEN reports red level in three provinces", "url": "https://peru21.pe/peru/tumbes-y-piura-bajo-alerta-roja-por-lluvias-extremas-coen-senamhi/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-02T04:14:45Z", "source_name": "apnoticias.pe", "title": "Alerta roja en Tumbes: COEN y Midagri prevén lluvias extremas del 1 al 2 de noviembre", "title_en": "Red alert in Tumbes: COEN and Midagri forecast extreme rainfall from 1 to 2 November", "url": "https://apnoticias.pe/alerta-roja-en-tumbes-coen-y-midagri-preven-lluvias-extremas-del-1-al-2-de-noviembre-1522070"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-02T13:30:14Z", "source_name": "La República (Perú) sociedad", "title": "Río Tumbes supera umbral de alerta roja y advierten riesgo de desbordes tras intensas lluvias", "title_en": "Tumbes River exceeds red alert threshold and warnings of overflow risk after intense rains", "url": "https://larepublica.pe/sociedad/2026/11/02/rio-tumbes-alcanza-umbral-rojo-por-intensas-lluvias-en-ecuador-advierten-riesgo-de-desbordes-e-inundaciones-97480"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-02T15:02:27Z", "source_name": "La República (Perú) sociedad", "title": "Lluvias extremas en Tumbes inundan calles y activan quebradas: Senamhi reporta máximo de 104,1 mm en 24 horas", "title_en": "Extreme rains in Tumbes flood streets and activate ravines: Senamhi reports maximum of 104.1 mm in 24 hours", "url": "https://larepublica.pe/sociedad/2026/11/02/lluvias-extremas-en-tumbes-inundan-calles-y-activan-quebradas-senamhi-reporta-maximo-de-1041-mm-en-24-horas-136248"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-02T18:13:05Z", "source_name": "La República (Perú) sociedad", "title": "Emergencia en Tumbes: desborde del río Zarumilla inunda Puerto Perú y obliga a evacuar a familias", "title_en": "Emergency in Tumbes: Zarumilla River overflow floods Puerto Peru and forces families to evacuate", "url": "https://larepublica.pe/sociedad/2026/11/02/emergencia-en-tumbes-desborde-del-rio-zarumilla-inunda-puerto-peru-y-obliga-a-evacuar-a-familias-156510"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-03T03:53:00Z", "source_name": "La República (Perú) sociedad", "title": "Lluvias en Piura, Chiclayo y Tumbes EN VIVO hoy: pronóstico del clima en el norte del Perú", "title_en": "Rains in Piura, Chiclayo and Tumbes LIVE today: weather forecast for northern Peru", "url": "https://larepublica.pe/sociedad/2026/11/02/lluvias-en-piura-chiclayo-y-tumbes-en-vivo-hoy-pronostico-del-clima-en-el-norte-del-peru-118032"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-03T04:19:35Z", "source_name": "infobae.com", "title": "Alerta roja por lluvias y huaicos en Piura y Tumbes - Infobae", "title_en": "Red alert for rains and flash floods (huaicos) in Piura and Tumbes", "url": "https://www.infobae.com/peru/2026/11/03/senamhi-activa-alerta-roja-en-piura-y-tumbes-por-posible-activacion-de-quebradas-que-amenaza-a-mas-de-104-mil-personas/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-03T04:19:35Z", "source_name": "diariouno.pe", "title": "El norte en alerta roja: Lluvias dejan a la región bajo el agua, cerca frontera con Ecuador - Diario UNO", "title_en": "The north on red alert: Rains leave the region underwater, near the border with Ecuador", "url": "https://diariouno.pe/2026/11/02/el-norte-en-alerta-roja-lluvias-dejan-a-la-region-bajo-el-agua-cerca-frontera-con-ecuador/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-03T04:19:35Z", "source_name": "eltiempo.pe", "title": "Piura y Tumbes en alerta roja por lluvias intensas ante el avance de El Niño costero - El Tiempo", "title_en": "Piura and Tumbes on red alert for intense rain as coastal El Niño advances", "url": "https://eltiempo.pe/local/piura-y-tumbes-en-alerta-roja-por-lluvias-intensas-ante-el-avance-de-el-nino-costero/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-03T04:21:17Z", "source_name": "peruinforma.com", "title": "Senamhi declara alerta roja por activación de quebradas en Piura y Tumbes: riesgo alcanza a 104 mil personas -", "title_en": "Senamhi declares red alert for activation of ravines in Piura and Tumbes: risk reaches 104,000 people", "url": "https://www.peruinforma.com/senamhi-declara-alerta-roja-por-activacion-de-quebradas-en-piura-y-tumbes-riesgo-alcanza-a-104-mil-personas/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-03T13:38:09Z", "source_name": "La República (Perú) sociedad", "title": "Intensas lluvias golpean Máncora y dejan calles anegadas: advierten riesgo de activación de quebradas principalmente en Piura", "title_en": "Intense rains hit Máncora and leave flooded streets: warning of risk of activation of ravines mainly in Piura", "url": "https://larepublica.pe/sociedad/2026/11/03/intensas-lluvias-golpean-mancora-y-dejan-calles-anegadas-advierten-riesgo-de-activacion-de-quebradas-principalmente-en-piura-70605"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-04T04:16:50Z", "source_name": "diariocorreo.pe", "title": "Alerta roja por lluvias intensas en Piura", "title_en": "Red alert for intense rain in Piura", "url": "https://diariocorreo.pe/edicion/piura/alerta-roja-por-lluvias-intensas-en-piura-noticia-2/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-04T04:21:17Z", "source_name": "uruguayaldia.com.uy", "title": "Alerta roja por intensas lluvias y deslizamientos en Piura…", "title_en": "Red alert for intense rains and landslides in Piura and Tumbes", "url": "https://uruguayaldia.com.uy/alerta-roja-por-intensas-lluvias-y-deslizamientos-en-piura-y-tumbes/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-05T14:47:37Z", "source_name": "La República (Perú) sociedad", "title": "Tumbes bajo alerta roja por lluvias: Casitas queda aislado, 50 viviendas pierden sus techos y suspenden clases", "title_en": "Tumbes under red alert for rains: Casitas isolated, 50 homes lose roofs and classes suspended", "url": "https://larepublica.pe/sociedad/2026/11/05/tumbes-bajo-alerta-roja-por-lluvias-casitas-queda-aislado-50-viviendas-pierden-sus-techos-y-suspenden-clases-200710"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-05T21:40:38Z", "source_name": "La República (Perú) sociedad", "title": "Lluvias inundan Lima Sur y ponen en alerta al norte: Senamhi no descarta que el ciclón Yaku coincida con El Niño en 2027", "title_en": "Rains flood Lima Sur and put the north on alert: Senamhi does not rule out Cyclone Yaku coinciding with El Niño in 2027", "url": "https://larepublica.pe/sociedad/2026/11/05/villa-el-salvador-vmt-y-sjm-amanecen-bajo-el-agua-tras-intensa-llovizna-en-lima-inundaciones-afectan-viviendas-y-vias-488030"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-06T04:13:31Z", "source_name": "dsn.pe", "title": "Lluvias sorprenden a Piura en plena noche: Senamhi mantiene alerta roja y advierte nuevas precipitaciones", "title_en": "Rain catches Piura at night: Senamhi keeps red alert and warns of new precipitation", "url": "https://dsn.pe/lluvias-sorprenden-a-piura-en-plena-noche-senamhi-mantiene-alerta-roja-y-advierte-nuevas-precipitaciones/"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El Senamhi emitió alerta roja por lluvias intensas en ocho provincias de Piura y tres de Tumbes, vigente hasta el lunes 2 de noviembre. El boletín oficial es el N.° 304-2026-INDECI/COEN."}, "summary_en": "Peru''s National Service of Meteorology and Hydrology (Senamhi) issued a red alert for intense rainfall affecting eight provinces in Piura and three in Tumbes, valid until Monday 2 November. The alert is documented in official bulletin No. 304-2026-INDECI/COEN. The article covers the warning itself; no impacts or outcomes are reported in the snippet.", "title": "Tumbes and Piura under red alert for intense rain tonight: these are the provinces that could record extreme precipitation", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(245,'multi_hazard|GB|south sudan','multi_hazard','2026-11-02T04:16:06Z','2026-11-02T04:10:19Z','2026-10-30','{"actions": ["UK funding of £2.1 million to FAO and WFP to expand anticipatory action interventions in South Sudan", "Preparation of vulnerable communities ahead of forecast climate shocks"], "agencies": [{"country": null, "name": "Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations (FAO)", "type": "international"}, {"country": null, "name": "World Food Programme (WFP)", "type": "international"}, {"country": "GB", "name": "Government of the United Kingdom", "type": "other"}], "agency_types": ["international", "other"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "GB", "name": "United Kingdom"}, {"code": "SS", "name": "South Sudan"}], "event_date": "2026-10-30", "event_location": "South Sudan", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-02T04:10:19Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 245, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-02T04:10:19Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes anticipatory action funding and intent to help hundreds of thousands of people prepare, but does not report observed results.", "pillars": [2, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-30T15:03:08Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "United Kingdom funding helps protect South Sudan from anticipated climate shocks", "title_en": "United Kingdom funding helps protect South Sudan from anticipated climate shocks", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/south-sudan/united-kingdom-funding-helps-protect-south-sudan-anticipated-climate-shocks"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The United Kingdom has provided £2.1 million to FAO and WFP to expand anticipatory action in South Sudan, enabling vulnerable communities to prepare for forecast climate shocks before their most damaging impacts. The programme relies on forecasts to trigger early preparedness actions. Reported outcomes are not yet given in the snippet.", "title": "United Kingdom funding helps protect South Sudan from anticipated climate shocks", "wmo_regions": ["I", "VI"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(246,'other|JP|kamikawa','other','2026-11-02T04:16:06Z','2026-11-02T04:11:14Z','2026-11-01','{"actions": ["Lowering of the Tokachidake volcanic alert level to level 2 (restriction of access around the crater)", "Accommodation facilities in the Fukiage hot spring area of Kamikawa town resumed operations"], "agencies": [{"country": "JP", "name": "NHK", "type": "media"}], "agency_types": ["media"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}], "event_date": "2026-11-01", "event_location": "Kamikawa, Hokkaido, Japan", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-02T04:11:14Z", "hazard": "other", "hazards": ["other"], "id": 246, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["ja"], "last_updated": "2026-11-02T04:11:14Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "positive", "outcome_justification": "Lowering of the alert level allowed local businesses to reopen, indicating the warning system''s level changes were acted upon and reflected in community response.", "pillars": [3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-11-01T09:18:00Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 社会", "title": "十勝岳噴火警戒レベルの引き下げ受け宿泊施設が営業再開", "title_en": "Accommodation facilities resume operations after Tokachidake eruption warning level lowered", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261101de69223"}], "summaries_original": {"ja": "大雪山系の十勝岳の噴火警戒レベルが火口周辺規制を示す「2」に引き下げられたことを受けて、北海道上富良野町の吹上温泉地区で宿泊施設が営業を再開しました。"}, "summary_en": "The Japan Meteorological Agency lowered the Tokachidake volcano alert level to level 2, which restricts access around the crater. Following this change, accommodation facilities in the Fukiage hot spring area of Kamikawa town, Hokkaido, resumed operations. The item illustrates how volcanic alert level changes feed into local response decisions.", "title": "Accommodation facilities resume operations after Tokachidake eruption warning level lowered", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(247,'','tsunami','2026-11-02T04:16:07Z','2026-11-02T04:10:39Z','2026-11-01','{"actions": [], "agencies": [], "agency_types": [], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [], "event_date": "2026-11-01", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-02T04:10:39Z", "hazard": "tsunami", "hazards": ["tsunami"], "id": 247, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-02T04:10:39Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet discusses tsunami warning challenges and innovations in detection, but reports no specific event outcome.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-01T10:21:46Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Seven innovations that buy time before a tsunami reaches the shore", "title_en": "Seven innovations that buy time before a tsunami reaches the shore", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/news/seven-innovations-buy-time-tsunami-reaches-shore"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-01T10:21:46Z", "source_name": "UNDRR news", "title": "Seven innovations that buy time before a tsunami reaches the shore", "title_en": "Seven innovations that buy time before a tsunami reaches the shore", "url": "https://www.undrr.org/news/seven-innovations-buy-time-tsunami-reaches-shore"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The article discusses innovations that extend warning lead time before tsunamis reach shore, noting that near-shore sources can produce waves within minutes. It highlights that volcano- or landslide-triggered tsunamis may be detected late by systems designed around earthquakes, underscoring detection and monitoring gaps.", "title": "Seven innovations that buy time before a tsunami reaches the shore", "wmo_regions": []}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(248,'heatwave|CL|chile (national)','heatwave','2026-11-02T04:16:09Z','2026-11-05T04:11:21Z','2026-11-02','{"actions": ["Declaration of a national Preventive Early Alert for heat from Arica y Parinacota to Magallanes and Chilean Antarctica", "Preventive early warning issued for expected heat events under the National Emergency Plan for extreme heat"], "agencies": [{"country": "CL", "name": "Cruz Roja Chilena", "type": "NGO"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Dirección Meteorológica de Chile (DMC)", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": null, "name": "International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies", "type": "international"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "BioBioChile", "type": "media"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Corporación Nacional Forestal (CONAF)", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Senapred (Servicio Nacional de Prevención y Respuesta ante Desastres)", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "CL", "name": "Servicio Nacional de Prevención y Respuesta Ante Desastres (SENAPRED)", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NGO", "NMHS", "international", "media", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["other"], "confidence": 0.9, "countries": [{"code": "CL", "name": "Chile"}], "event_date": "2026-11-02", "event_location": "Chile (national)", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-02T04:15:06Z", "hazard": "heatwave", "hazards": ["heatwave"], "id": 248, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:11:21Z", "lead_time": "Covers the summer period through March 2027", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports the declaration of the alert only; no outcomes are described.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-02T00:29:37Z", "source_name": "BioBioChile nacional", "title": "Senapred declara Alerta Temprana Preventiva por calor en todo Chile hasta marzo de 2027", "title_en": "Senapred declares Preventive Early Alert for heat across all of Chile until March 2027", "url": "https://www.biobiochile.cl/noticias/nacional/chile/2026/11/01/senapred-declara-alerta-temprana-preventiva-por-calor-en-todo-chile-hasta-marzo-de-2027.shtml"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-05T00:32:40Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "Chile: CHL: Ola de calor - 11-2026 - Alerta Temprana Preventiva Ola de Calor (2026-11-05)", "title_en": "Chile: CHL: Heat Wave - 11-2026 - Preventive Early Warning Heat Wave (2026-11-05)", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/chile/chl-ola-de-calor-11-2026-alerta-temprana-preventiva-ola-de-calor-2026-11-05"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Senapred declaró Alerta Temprana Preventiva Nacional por calor, ante los eventos de altas temperaturas previstos para el periodo estival y los riesgos que podrían representar para la población. La medida abarca desde Arica y Parinacota hasta Magallanes y la Antártica Chilena."}, "summary_en": "Senapred declared a national Preventive Early Alert for heat covering all of Chile, from Arica y Parinacota to Magallanes and Chilean Antarctica, in anticipation of high temperature events during the summer season and their potential risks to the population. The alert remains in effect until March 2027.", "title": "Senapred declares Preventive Early Alert for heat across all of Chile until March 2027", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(249,'','drought','2026-11-02T04:16:09Z','2026-11-02T04:10:19Z','2026-11-02','{"actions": ["Activation of Drought Early Action Protocol (EAP) following readiness activities in 16 of 19 high-priority drought-prone districts", "Strengthening of institutional and community preparedness and operational readiness"], "agencies": [{"country": "ZM", "name": "Zambia Red Cross Society", "type": "NGO"}, {"country": null, "name": "International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies", "type": "international"}], "agency_types": ["NGO", "international"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "ZM", "name": "Zambia"}], "event_date": "2026-11-02", "event_location": "Zambia", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-02T04:10:19Z", "hazard": "drought", "hazards": ["drought"], "id": 249, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-02T04:10:19Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes EAP activation and readiness work but does not report results of the early action or its effects.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-02T00:51:54Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "Zambia | Drought: Early Action Protocol Activation (EAP No: EAP2023CR02, Operation No.: MDRZM025), 14 October 2026", "title_en": "Zambia | Drought: Early Action Protocol Activation (EAP No: EAP2023CR02, Operation No.: MDRZM025), 14 October 2026", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/zambia/zambia-drought-early-action-protocol-activation-eap-no-eap2023cr02-operation-no-mdrzm025-14-october-2026"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The Zambia Red Cross Society activated its Drought Early Action Protocol after implementing readiness activities across 16 of 19 identified high-priority drought-prone districts. The activation aims to strengthen institutional and community preparedness and operational readiness ahead of drought. Specific early warning dissemination and outcomes are not described in the snippet.", "title": "Zambia | Drought: Early Action Protocol Activation (EAP No: EAP2023CR02, Operation No.: MDRZM025), 14 October 2026", "wmo_regions": ["I"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(250,'flood|US|maricopa county','flash_flood','2026-11-02T04:16:10Z','2026-11-05T04:16:59Z','2026-11-02','{"actions": ["Mandatory evacuations", "Rescue operations", "Mandatory evacuation orders issued for affected areas", "Flood alerts issued for much of Arizona and other states", "Mandatory evacuation ordered for residents near Oak Creek in Sedona", "Full evacuation ordered for Gisela in Gila County", "Mandatory evacuation orders issued for low-lying areas near several rivers", "mandatory evacuations"], "agencies": [{"country": "US", "name": "National Weather Service", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "US", "name": "National Weather Service (NWS)", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "US", "name": "Gila County", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "US", "name": "NOAA National Weather Service", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "US", "name": "NWS Phoenix", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["other"], "confidence": 0.9, "countries": [{"code": "US", "name": "United States"}], "event_date": "2026-11-02", "event_location": "Arizona, Colorado and New Mexico, USA", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-02T04:11:03Z", "hazard": "flash_flood", "hazards": ["flash_flood", "flood"], "id": 250, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en", "es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:16:59Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports warnings, evacuations and rescue operations but does not state whether warnings led to lives saved or shortcomings.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-02T04:10:58Z", "source_name": "defconlevel.com", "title": "Flood Warning issued November 1 at 10:53AM MST until November 2 at 8:00AM MST by NWS Phoenix AZ", "title_en": "Flood Warning issued November 1 at 10:53AM MST until November 2 at 8:00AM MST by NWS Phoenix AZ", "url": "https://www.defconlevel.com/alert/2026-11-01-nws-noaa-weather-flood-warning-issued-november-1-at-10-53am-mst-until-november-2-at-8-00am-mst-by-nws-phoenix-az"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-02T04:14:45Z", "source_name": "univision.com", "title": "Las inundaciones repentinas provocan evacuaciones en el suroeste y una grave advertencia para una localidad termal de Colorado.", "title_en": "Flash floods trigger evacuations in the southwest and a serious warning for a Colorado hot-springs town", "url": "https://univision.com/noticias/fenomenos-naturales/las-inundaciones-repentinas-provocan-evacuaciones-en-el-suroeste-y-una-grave-advertencia-para-una-localidad-termal-de-colorado"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-03T04:16:50Z", "source_name": "infobae.com", "title": "Las lluvias torrenciales provocan evacuaciones e inundaciones repentinas en Arizona, Colorado y Nuevo México - Infobae", "title_en": "Torrential rains trigger evacuations and flash floods in Arizona, Colorado and New Mexico - Infobae", "url": "https://infobae.com/estados-unidos/2026/11/02/las-lluvias-torrenciales-provocan-evacuaciones-e-inundaciones-repentinas-en-arizona-colorado-y-nuevo-mexico"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-03T11:15:00Z", "source_name": "eldia.com", "title": "Efecto cambio climático: fuertes lluvias y ríos desbordados en Estados Unidos", "title_en": "Climate change effect: heavy rains and overflowing rivers in the United States", "url": "http://www.eldia.com/informacion-general/efecto-cambio-climatico-fuertes-lluvias-y-rios-desbordados-en-estados-unidos-informacion-general_1793677820"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-04T04:15:04Z", "source_name": "disasterphilanthropy.org", "title": "What we’re watching: Weekly disaster update, November 2, 2026 - Center for Disaster Philanthropy", "title_en": "What we''re watching: Weekly disaster update, November 2, 2026", "url": "https://disasterphilanthropy.org/blog/what-were-watching-weekly-disaster-update-november-2-2026/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-04T04:21:17Z", "source_name": "infobae.com", "title": "Una casa fue arrastrada por las inundaciones en Colorado y chocó contra un puente: el video del momento - Infobae", "title_en": "A house was swept away by floods in Colorado and crashed into a bridge: the video of the moment", "url": "https://www.infobae.com/estados-unidos/2026/11/03/una-casa-fue-arrastrada-por-las-inundaciones-en-colorado-y-choco-contra-un-puente-el-video-del-momento/"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Las intensas lluvias que afectan al suroeste de Estados Unidos provocaron inundaciones repentinas, evacuaciones obligatorias y operativos de rescate en Arizona, Colorado y Nuevo México. El Servicio Meteorológico Nacional (NWS) advirtió que las precipitaciones podrían acumular hasta 100 milímetros."}, "summary_en": "Intense rains in the southwestern United States caused flash floods, mandatory evacuations and rescue operations in Arizona, Colorado and New Mexico. The US National Weather Service warned that rainfall could accumulate up to 100 millimetres.", "title": "Climate change effect: heavy rains and overflowing rivers in the United States", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
