Service Phoenix issued a severe flood warning for Gila and Pinal counties in Arizona on 1 November 2026, valid until 3:00 PM MST, as excessive rainfall caused streams to rise from runoff. Doppler radar indicated 0.5 to 1 inch of rain had fallen. The item is an automated alert listing and does not report impacts or public response.", "title": "Flood Warning issued November 1 at 12:24PM MST until November 1 at 3:00PM MST by NWS Phoenix AZ", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
