ng-to-action chain, linking the NMHS warning to civil protection preparedness. The snippet is truncated, so the full period and affected areas are not confirmed.", "title": "INDECI recommends preparedness measures for rainfall in the northern coast and highlands", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
