e wet season. The item is relevant as a forecasting product, though it does not describe warnings or their dissemination.", "title": "Afghanistan Seasonal Monitor: Above-average precipitation and above-normal temperatures are expected early in the 2026-27 wet season", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(260,'named|murasu','tropical_cyclone','2026-11-03T04:21:56Z','2026-11-05T04:12:03Z','2026-11-03','{"actions": ["IMD issued a red cyclone warning for Andhra Pradesh and adjoining northern Tamil Nadu coasts", "District officials instructed to identify and shift people from low-lying coastal and flood-prone areas to safer locations where necessary", "School closures in Andhra Pradesh and Chennai"], "agencies": [{"country": "IN", "name": "India Meteorological Department (IMD)", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "IN", "name": "District administrations, Andhra Pradesh and Tamil Nadu", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["other"], "confidence": 0.95, "countries": [{"code": "IN", "name": "India"}], "event_date": "2026-11-03", "event_location": "Ongole, Andhra Pradesh, India", "event_name": "Cyclone Murasu", "first_seen": "2026-11-03T04:15:29Z", "hazard": "tropical_cyclone", "hazards": ["tropical_cyclone"], "id": 260, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:12:03Z", "lead_time": "landfall forecast near Ongole on November 2-3, as stated in the snippet", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes warnings and evacuation instructions but does not report whether they were received, acted upon, or what the outcome was.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-03T02:15:00Z", "source_name": "educationtimes.com", "title": "Schools closed today in Andhra Pradesh and Chennai due to Cyclone Murasu: Check latest school holiday updates and affected areas", "title_en": "Schools closed today in Andhra Pradesh and Chennai due to Cyclone Murasu: Check latest school holiday updates and affected areas", "url": "https://www.educationtimes.com/news/schools-closed-today-in-andhra-pradesh-and-chennai-due-to-cyclone-murasu-check-latest-school-holiday-updates-and-affected-areas/articleshow/135478609.cms"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-03T04:15:24Z", "source_name": "vajiramandravi.com", "title": "Cyclone Murasu 2026, Tracker, Affected Areas, Warnings, Latest Updates", "title_en": "Cyclone Murasu 2026, Tracker, Affected Areas, Warnings, Latest Updates", "url": "https://vajiramandravi.com/current-affairs/cyclone-murasu-2026"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "IMD issued a red cyclone warning for Andhra Pradesh and adjoining northern Tamil Nadu coasts as Cyclone Murasu intensified, with landfall forecast near Ongole on November 2-3. District authorities were instructed to identify and shift people from low-lying and flood-prone coastal areas to safer locations where necessary. The snippet does not report dissemination details or the outcome of these measures.", "title": "Cyclone Murasu 2026, Tracker, Affected Areas, Warnings, Latest Updates", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(261,'flood|US|central brevard county','flash_flood','2026-11-03T04:21:57Z','2026-11-03T04:15:29Z','2026-11-03','{"actions": ["Advised people not to drive on flooded roads"], "agencies": [{"country": "US", "name": "National Weather Service Melbourne (NWS Melbourne)", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "US", "name": "NWS Melbourne", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["other"], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "US", "name": "United States"}], "event_date": "2026-11-03", "event_location": "Central Brevard County, Florida, USA", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-03T04:15:29Z", "hazard": "flash_flood", "hazards": ["flash_flood", "flood"], "id": 261, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-03T04:15:29Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item reports a flood warning issued and rainfall totals but gives no information on outcomes, impacts, or how the warning was acted upon.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-03T04:15:24Z", "source_name": "defconlevel.com", "title": "Flood Warning issued November 2 at 3:52PM EST until November 2 at 6:00PM EST by NWS Melbourne FL", "title_en": "Flood Warning issued November 2 at 3:52PM EST until November 2 at 6:00PM EST by NWS Melbourne FL", "url": "https://www.defconlevel.com/alert/2026-11-02-nws-noaa-weather-flood-warning-issued-november-2-at-3-52pm-est-until-november-2-at-6-00pm-est-by-nws-melbourne-fl"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-03T04:15:24Z", "source_name": "defconlevel.com", "title": "Flood Warning issued November 2 at 3:29PM EST until November 2 at 5:30PM EST by NWS Melbourne FL", "title_en": "Flood Warning issued November 2 at 3:29PM EST until November 2 at 5:30PM EST by NWS Melbourne FL", "url": "https://www.defconlevel.com/alert/2026-11-02-nws-noaa-weather-flood-warning-issued-november-2-at-3-29pm-est-until-november-2-at-5-30pm-est-by-nws-melbourne-fl"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-03T04:15:24Z", "source_name": "defconlevel.com", "title": "Flash Flood Warning issued November 2 at 4:02PM EST until November 2 at 6:00PM EST by NWS Melbourne FL", "title_en": "Flash Flood Warning issued November 2 at 4:02PM EST until November 2 at 6:00PM EST by NWS Melbourne FL", "url": "https://www.defconlevel.com/alert/2026-11-02-nws-noaa-weather-flash-flood-warning-issued-november-2-at-4-02pm-est-until-november-2-at-6-00pm-est-by-nws-melbourne-fl"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The US National Weather Service office in Melbourne, Florida issued a Severe (4/5) flood warning for central Brevard County, covering a period from 3:52PM to 6:00PM EST on 2 November. The warning noted that flooding from excessive rainfall was continuing, with 6 to 10 inches of rain already having fallen. The item provides no information on public response or outcomes.", "title": "Flood Warning issued November 2 at 3:52PM EST until November 2 at 6:00PM EST by NWS Melbourne FL", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(262,'flood|EC|esmeraldas','heavy_rain','2026-11-03T04:22:02Z','2026-11-03T04:19:43Z','2026-11-03','{"actions": ["National red alert maintained", "Temporary shelters enabled in Esmeraldas, Guayas, Manabí and Los Ríos"], "agencies": [{"country": "EC", "name": "Government of Ecuador", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "EC", "name": "Ecuador"}], "event_date": "2026-11-03", "event_location": "Esmeraldas, Guayas, Manabí and Los Ríos provinces, Ecuador", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-03T04:19:43Z", "hazard": "heavy_rain", "hazards": ["heavy_rain"], "id": 262, "impacts": {"deaths": 1, "economic_losses": "cuantiosos daños materiales (unquantified)"}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-03T04:19:43Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports one death and material damage but does not state whether the warnings led to timely evacuations or saved lives.", "pillars": [3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-03T04:19:35Z", "source_name": "avn.info.ve", "title": "Alerta roja en varias provincias de Ecuador ante inundaciones por fenómeno El Niño - Agencia Venezolana de Noticias", "title_en": "Red alert in several Ecuadorian provinces due to El Niño-related flooding", "url": "https://avn.info.ve/alerta-roja-en-varias-provincias-de-ecuador-ante-inundaciones-por-fenomeno-el-nino"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Las autoridades de Ecuador mantienen la Alerta Roja nacional por intensas precipitaciones vinculadas al fenómeno El Niño, que han causado un fallecido y cuantiosos daños. El Ejecutivo habilitó refugios temporales en cuatro provincias."}, "summary_en": "Ecuador''s authorities maintain a national red alert over intense rainfall linked to El Niño, which has caused one death and substantial material damage. The government enabled temporary shelters in four coastal provinces in response. The snippet does not detail the forecasts or dissemination channels used.", "title": "Red alert in several Ecuadorian provinces due to El Niño-related flooding", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(263,'named|agneta','flash_flood','2026-11-03T04:22:02Z','2026-11-03T04:19:43Z','2026-11-03','{"actions": ["Authorities issued new severe weather warnings for Rhodes, Samos, Kalymnos and the Volos region", "Residents of Rhodes received a 112 emergency alert at 3:30 on 2 November"], "agencies": [{"country": "GR", "name": "Greek civil protection (112 emergency alert)", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other_national_agency"], "channels": ["cell_broadcast"], "confidence": 0.9, "countries": [{"code": "GR", "name": "Greece"}], "event_date": "2026-11-03", "event_location": "Rhodes, Greece", "event_name": "Storm Agneta", "first_seen": "2026-11-03T04:19:43Z", "hazard": "flash_flood", "hazards": ["flash_flood"], "id": 263, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-03T04:19:43Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports warnings and an emergency alert but does not state whether they were effective or what the flooding impacts were beyond damaged cars.", "pillars": [3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-03T04:19:35Z", "source_name": "es.rua.gr", "title": "Inundaciones en Rodas: decenas de coches dañados, la tormenta Agneta continúa - Noticias de Atenas", "title_en": "Floods in Rhodes: dozens of cars damaged, storm Agneta continues", "url": "https://es.rua.gr/2026/11/03/inundaciones-en-rodas-decenas-de-coches-danados-la-tormenta-agneta-continua/"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Tras los aguaceros del 2 de noviembre, las autoridades emitieron nuevos avisos de tiempo severo en Rodas, Samos, Kalymnos y la región de Volos. Los habitantes de Rodas recibieron una alerta de emergencia 112 a las 3.30 horas del 2 de noviembre."}, "summary_en": "Following heavy rain on 2 November, Greek authorities issued new severe weather warnings for Rhodes, Samos, Kalymnos and the Volos region. Residents of Rhodes received a 112 emergency alert at 3:30 am on 2 November, while flooding damaged dozens of cars as storm Agneta continued.", "title": "Floods in Rhodes: dozens of cars damaged, storm Agneta continues", "wmo_regions": ["VI"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(264,'','other','2026-11-04T04:23:13Z','2026-11-04T04:21:25Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": ["Launched a dedicated section on its website for weather forecasts for the papal visit activities"], "agencies": [{"country": "PE", "name": "SENAMHI", "type": "NMHS"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.6, "countries": [{"code": "PE", "name": "Peru"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": "Peru", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-04T04:21:25Z", "hazard": "other", "hazards": ["other"], "id": 264, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-04T04:21:25Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes a forecast information tool for event planning; no hazard warning outcome is reported.", "pillars": [3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "SENAMHI Perú noticias", "title": "Visita del papa León XIV: SENAMHI presenta herramienta digital para consultar el pronóstico del tiempo", "title_en": "Visit of Pope Leo XIV: SENAMHI presents digital tool to check weather forecast", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/senamhi/noticias/1468570-visita-del-papa-leon-xiv-senamhi-presenta-herramienta-digital-para-consultar-el-pronostico-del-tiempo"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El SENAMHI puso a disposición de la ciudadanía una sección especial en su web para consultar el pronóstico del tiempo durante la visita apostólica del papa León XIV al Perú."}, "summary_en": "Peru''s national meteorological and hydrological service, SENAMHI, launched a special digital section on its website so citizens can consult weather forecasts for activities during Pope Leo XIV''s apostolic visit to Peru. The item concerns forecast dissemination for a mass event rather than a hazard warning.", "title": "Visit of Pope Leo XIV: SENAMHI presents digital tool to check weather forecast", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(265,'other|PE|arequipa','other','2026-11-04T04:23:15Z','2026-11-04T04:21:25Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": ["Installation of automatic meteorological station Punta Ático", "Installation of automatic meteorological station Caravelí"], "agencies": [{"country": "PE", "name": "SENAMHI", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Ministerio del Ambiente (MINAM)", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "PE", "name": "Peru"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": "Arequipa, Peru", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-04T04:21:25Z", "hazard": "other", "hazards": ["other"], "id": 265, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-04T04:21:25Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item reports new monitoring infrastructure being installed but no hazard event outcomes are described.", "pillars": [2], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "SENAMHI Perú noticias", "title": "SENAMHI fortalece el monitoreo meteorológico en Arequipa con la instalación de nuevas estaciones automáticas en Ático y Caravelí", "title_en": "SENAMHI strengthens meteorological monitoring in Arequipa with the installation of new automatic stations in Ático and Caravelí", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/senamhi/noticias/1468316-senamhi-fortalece-el-monitoreo-meteorologico-en-arequipa-con-la-instalacion-de-nuevas-estaciones-automaticas-en-atico-y-caraveli"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El SENAMHI culminó la instalación de la estación meteorológica automática Punta Ático y realizó la instalación de la EMA Caravelí en Arequipa, fortaleciendo el monitoreo meteorológico en la región."}, "summary_en": "SENAMHI completed installation of the Punta Ático automatic meteorological station and installed the Caravelí station in Arequipa, Peru, strengthening local meteorological monitoring capacity. The item concerns detection and monitoring infrastructure rather than a specific hazard event.", "title": "SENAMHI strengthens meteorological monitoring in Arequipa with the installation of new automatic stations in Ático and Caravelí", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(266,'flood|PE|tumbes','heavy_rain','2026-11-04T04:23:15Z','2026-11-08T04:15:57Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": ["Issued red alert meteorological warning N.° 451 for heavy to extreme precipitation in 13 departments of the northern coast", "Senamhi issued short-term warning notice N.º 309-2026 with extreme danger level", "Senamhi recommends protecting property and staying informed about rainfall and flooding", "Indeci recommended keeping evacuation routes clear", "Ongoing emergency response actions for affected and displaced population by competent institutions", "Army and other institutions providing response assistance in Tumbes districts affected by heavy rains"], "agencies": [{"country": "PE", "name": "Cruz Roja Peruana", "type": "NGO"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Senamhi", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": null, "name": "International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies", "type": "international"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Infobae", "type": "media"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "La República", "type": "media"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "elpopular.pe", "type": "media"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "COEN", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Centro de Operaciones de Emergencia Nacional (COEN)", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Ejército del Perú", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "Indeci", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NGO", "NMHS", "international", "media", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["other", "website"], "confidence": 0.95, "countries": [{"code": "PE", "name": "Peru"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": "Tumbes, Peru", "event_name": "Fenómeno El Niño", "first_seen": "2026-11-04T04:10:53Z", "hazard": "heavy_rain", "hazards": ["flood", "heavy_rain"], "id": 266, "impacts": {"affected": 808}, "languages": ["en", "es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-08T04:15:57Z", "lead_time": "valid for 24 hours from issuance", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports the red alert issuance but gives no information on impacts or the effectiveness of the warning.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "INDECI Perú noticias", "title": "Instituciones competentes continúan atendiendo a población afectada y damnificada ante lluvias intensas en Tumbes", "title_en": "Competent institutions continue assisting population affected and displaced by heavy rains in Tumbes", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/indeci/noticias/1468233-instituciones-competentes-continuan-atendiendo-a-poblacion-afectada-y-damnificada-ante-lluvias-intensas-en-tumbes"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "INDECI Perú noticias", "title": "Ejército y otras instituciones continúan atendiendo en distritos de Tumbes por lluvias intensas", "title_en": "Army and other institutions continue assisting in Tumbes districts due to heavy rains", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/indeci/noticias/1471048-ejercito-y-otras-instituciones-continuan-atendiendo-en-distritos-de-tumbes-por-lluvias-intensas"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-04T00:32:10Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "Peru: PER: Pluvial/Flash Flood - 11-2026 - Flood Fenómeno El Niño #2 (2026-11-03)", "title_en": "Peru: PER: Pluvial/Flash Flood - 11-2026 - Flood Fenómeno El Niño #2 (2026-11-03)", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/peru/pluvialflash-flood-11-2026-flood-fenomeno-el-nino-2-2026-11-03"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-04T04:16:50Z", "source_name": "infobae.com", "title": "Alerta roja del Senamhi por precipitaciones en la costa norte desde este miércoles 4 hasta el viernes 6 de noviembre - Infobae", "title_en": "Senamhi red alert for rainfall on Peru''s north coast from Wednesday 4 to Friday 6 November", "url": "https://infobae.com/peru/2026/11/03/alerta-roja-del-senamhi-por-precipitaciones-en-la-costa-norte-desde-este-miercoles-4-hasta-el-viernes-6-de-noviembre"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-04T23:15:26Z", "source_name": "La República (Perú) sociedad", "title": "Tormentas eléctricas y 60 mm de agua: la severa advertencia del Senamhi que pone en riesgo a Piura, Tumbes y Cajamarca", "title_en": "Thunderstorms and 60 mm of water: the severe Senamhi warning that puts Piura, Tumbes and Cajamarca at risk", "url": "https://larepublica.pe/sociedad/2026/11/04/tormentas-electricas-y-60-mm-de-agua-la-severa-advertencia-del-senamhi-que-pone-en-riesgo-a-piura-tumbes-y-cajamarca-310096"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-06T03:58:23Z", "source_name": "La República (Perú) sociedad", "title": "Lluvias en Perú HOY EN VIVO: últimas noticias del Fenómeno El Niño, distritos afectados en Lima y Callao, posibles desbordes, regiones en alerta roja y pronóstico del Senamhi", "title_en": "Rains in Peru LIVE: latest on El Niño phenomenon, affected districts in Lima and Callao, possible overflows, regions on red alert and SENAMHI forecast", "url": "https://larepublica.pe/sociedad/2026/11/05/lluvias-en-peru-hoy-en-vivo-ultimas-noticias-del-fenomeno-el-nino-distritos-afectados-en-lima-y-callao-posibles-desbordes-regiones-en-alerta-roja-y-pronostico-del-senamhi-490880"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-06T04:13:31Z", "source_name": "elcomercio.pe", "title": "Lluvias extremas y decenas de litros de agua por metro cuadrado: Piura y Tumbes en emergencia y Lima superó una marca histórica apuesplan", "title_en": "Extreme rains with tens of liters of water per square meter: Piura and Tumbes in emergency and Lima exceeded a historic mark", "url": "https://elcomercio.pe/lima/sucesos/piura-y-tumbes-bajo-alerta-roja-que-tan-intensas-seran-las-lluvias-y-que-se-espera-para-lima-apuesplan-noticia/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-06T04:13:31Z", "source_name": "elpopular.pe", "title": "¡ATENCIÓN! Fuertes LLUVIAS ponen en alerta a la costa norte: Senamhi advierte posibles INUNDACIONES", "title_en": "ATTENTION! Heavy rains put northern coast on alert: Senamhi warns of possible floods", "url": "https://elpopular.pe/actualidad/2026/11/05/atencion-fuertes-lluvias-ponen-en-alerta-a-la-costa-norte-senamhi-advierte-posibles-inundaciones-124430"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-07T04:15:31Z", "source_name": "larepublica.pe", "title": "Lluvias intensas dejan 324 damnificados y 808 afectados en Tumbes: Senamhi prevé precipitaciones hasta el domingo", "title_en": "Intense rains leave 324 displaced and 808 affected in Tumbes; Senamhi forecasts precipitation until Sunday", "url": "https://larepublica.pe/sociedad/2026/11/06/lluvias-intensas-dejan-324-damnificados-y-808-afectados-en-tumbes-senamhi-preve-precipitaciones-hasta-el-domingo-314778"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Senamhi emitió alerta roja por precipitaciones de fuerte a extrema intensidad en la costa norte, principalmente en Tumbes, mediante el aviso meteorológico N.° 451, vigente hasta el 6 de noviembre en 13 departamentos."}, "summary_en": "Senamhi issued a red alert for heavy to extreme rainfall on Peru''s northern coast, mainly in Tumbes, through meteorological warning No. 451, valid until 6 November across 13 departments. The article also reports Piura and Tumbes in emergency and Lima exceeding a historic rainfall mark.", "title": "Extreme rains with tens of liters of water per square meter: Piura and Tumbes in emergency and Lima exceeded a historic mark", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(267,'earthquake|JP|kushimoto','tsunami','2026-11-04T04:23:17Z','2026-11-04T04:15:18Z','2026-11-03','{"actions": ["Disaster preparedness drill simulating a Nankai Trough megaquake and tsunami"], "agencies": [{"country": "JP", "name": "Kushimoto Town", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.7, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}], "event_date": "2026-11-03", "event_location": "Kushimoto, Wakayama, Japan", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-04T04:15:18Z", "hazard": "tsunami", "hazards": ["tsunami"], "id": 267, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["ja"], "last_updated": "2026-11-04T04:15:18Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "Item describes a preparedness drill only; no real warning outcome is reported.", "pillars": [4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-11-03T06:07:00Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 社会", "title": "「世界津波の日」前に南海トラフ巨大地震想定し訓練 和歌山", "title_en": "Disaster drill in Wakayama assuming Nankai Trough megaquake ahead of World Tsunami Awareness Day", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261103de69940"}], "summaries_original": {"ja": "国連が定めた「世界津波の日」の11月5日を前に、3日、和歌山県串本町で、南海トラフ巨大地震が発生したという想定の防災訓練が行われました。"}, "summary_en": "Kushimoto Town in Wakayama Prefecture held a disaster drill on 3 November assuming a Nankai Trough megaquake, ahead of World Tsunami Awareness Day on 5 November. The exercise is a preparedness activity focused on tsunami response. The snippet does not describe warning dissemination or monitoring details.", "title": "Disaster drill in Wakayama assuming Nankai Trough megaquake ahead of World Tsunami Awareness Day", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(268,'flood|AR|cordoba','heavy_rain','2026-11-04T04:23:19Z','2026-11-04T04:21:38Z','2026-11-03','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": "AR", "name": "Servicio Meteorológico Nacional", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "AR", "name": "Clarín", "type": "media"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "media"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "AR", "name": "Argentina"}], "event_date": "2026-11-03", "event_location": "Córdoba, San Luis, La Pampa, Santa Fe, Argentina", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-04T04:21:38Z", "hazard": "heavy_rain", "hazards": ["heavy_rain"], "id": 268, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-04T04:21:38Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports SMN anticipated strong to very strong storms and orange alerts but gives no outcome information.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-03T11:39:35Z", "source_name": "Clarín (Argentina) sociedad", "title": "Súper Niño 2026 en Argentina, EN VIVO: cuándo llegan al AMBA tormentas y las provincias con alerta naranja este martes", "title_en": "Super El Niño 2026 in Argentina, LIVE: when storms reach Buenos Aires metro area and the provinces under orange alert this Tuesday", "url": "https://www.clarin.com/sociedad/super-nino-2026-argentina-vivo-llegaran-tormentas-amba-provincias-alerta-naranja-martes_0_7hyDyhkPn3.html"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El Servicio Meteorológico Nacional anticipó que el fenómeno tendrá en el centro-este argentino una intensidad \"fuerte o muy fuerte\". Se esperan tormentas fuertes en Córdoba, San Luis, La Pampa y Santa Fe."}, "summary_en": "Argentina''s National Meteorological Service (SMN) anticipated that the El Niño phenomenon would bring strong to very strong storms to the centre-east of the country, with strong storms expected in Córdoba, San Luis, La Pampa and Santa Fe. A live news feed reports on the timing of storms reaching the Buenos Aires metropolitan area and provinces under orange alert.", "title": "Super El Niño 2026 in Argentina, LIVE: when storms reach Buenos Aires metro area and the provinces under orange alert this Tuesday", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(269,'flood|BF|white volta basin','flood','2026-11-04T04:23:19Z','2026-11-04T04:10:54Z','2026-11-03','{"actions": [], "agencies": [], "agency_types": [], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "BF", "name": "Burkina Faso"}, {"code": "GH", "name": "Ghana"}], "event_date": "2026-11-03", "event_location": "White Volta Basin, Ghana", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-04T04:10:54Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flood"], "id": 269, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-04T04:10:54Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item discusses shortcomings of flood warnings and proposes satellite-informed, locally calibrated forecasting, but reports no specific warning outcome.", "pillars": [2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-03T13:25:41Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "The dam upstream: Why flood warnings fail the White Volta Basin and what we can do about it", "title_en": "The dam upstream: Why flood warnings fail the White Volta Basin and what we can do about it", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/news/dam-upstream-why-flood-warnings-fail-white-volta-basin-and-what-we-can-do-about-it"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The article examines why flood warnings fail in Ghana''s White Volta Basin, particularly given upstream dam releases and transboundary flood risks. It proposes satellite-informed, locally calibrated flood forecasting to strengthen early warnings, preparedness and evacuation. The focus is on improving forecasting and warning capacity rather than a specific event.", "title": "The dam upstream: Why flood warnings fail the White Volta Basin and what we can do about it", "wmo_regions": ["I"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(270,'other|JP|mt. meakan','other','2026-11-04T04:23:22Z','2026-11-04T04:15:18Z','2026-11-03','{"actions": ["JMA lowered the volcanic alert level (eruption warning level) for Mt. Meakan to Level 1"], "agencies": [{"country": "JP", "name": "Japan Meteorological Agency (JMA)", "type": "NMHS"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.95, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}], "event_date": "2026-11-03", "event_location": "Mt. Meakan, Hokkaido, Japan", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-04T04:15:18Z", "hazard": "other", "hazards": ["other"], "id": 270, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["ja"], "last_updated": "2026-11-04T04:15:18Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item is an official JMA press release on a volcanic alert level change; it does not report any impacts or outcomes of the warning.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-11-03T15:00:00Z", "source_name": "気象庁 (JMA)", "title": "雌阿寒岳の噴火警戒レベルを１へ引下げ", "title_en": "Alert level for Mt. Meakan lowered to 1", "url": "https://www.jma.go.jp/jma/press/2611/04a/meakandake_20261104.html"}], "summaries_original": {"ja": "気象庁は、雌阿寒岳の噴火警戒レベルを1へ引き下げたと発表した。公式サイトで公表された噴火警戒レベルの変更に関する報道発表である。"}, "summary_en": "The Japan Meteorological Agency announced that the volcanic alert level for Mt. Meakan in Hokkaido has been lowered to Level 1, indicating reduced volcanic activity. The press release is an official alert-level update published on the JMA website. No impacts or public response details are given in the snippet.", "title": "Alert level for Mt. Meakan lowered to 1", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(271,'named|no 31','heavy_rain','2026-11-04T04:23:22Z','2026-11-04T04:15:18Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": ["JMA called for caution against landslides and flooding of low-lying areas"], "agencies": [{"country": "JP", "name": "Japan Meteorological Agency (JMA)", "type": "NMHS"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS"], "channels": ["other"], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": "Kanto region and Izu Islands, Japan", "event_name": "Typhoon No. 31", "first_seen": "2026-11-04T04:15:18Z", "hazard": "heavy_rain", "hazards": ["heavy_rain"], "id": 271, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["ja"], "last_updated": "2026-11-04T04:15:18Z", "lead_time": "from late on 4 November to around midday on 5 November", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item reports forecast heavy rain and JMA''s advisory, but no outcomes of the warnings are given.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-11-04T02:57:48Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 主要", "title": "台風31号 暖湿気流入で関東や伊豆諸島 今夜遅くから大雨おそれ", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 31: warm moist air inflow raises risk of heavy rain in Kanto and Izu Islands from tonight", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261104de70112"}], "summaries_original": {"ja": "台風周辺の暖かく湿った空気の流入により、関東と伊豆諸島では4日遅くから5日昼ごろにかけて激しい雨が降り、大雨となるおそれがある。気象庁は土砂災害や低地の浸水に十分注意するよう呼びかけている。"}, "summary_en": "JMA forecast that warm, moist air around Typhoon No. 31 would bring heavy rain to the Kanto region and Izu Islands from late on 4 November to around midday on 5 November. The agency urged residents to take sufficient precautions against landslides and flooding in low-lying areas.", "title": "Typhoon No. 31: warm moist air inflow raises risk of heavy rain in Kanto and Izu Islands from tonight", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(272,'flood|US|northern broward county','flash_flood','2026-11-04T04:23:25Z','2026-11-04T04:15:09Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": "US", "name": "National Weather Service Miami (NWS Miami)", "type": "NMHS"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS"], "channels": ["other"], "confidence": 0.9, "countries": [{"code": "US", "name": "United States"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": "Northern Broward County, FL, USA", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-04T04:15:09Z", "hazard": "flash_flood", "hazards": ["flash_flood"], "id": 272, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-04T04:15:09Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item reports a flash flood warning issued for ongoing or expected flooding, but no actions taken or outcomes are described.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-04T04:15:04Z", "source_name": "defconlevel.com", "title": "Flash Flood Warning issued November 3 at 8:57PM EST until November 3 at 11:00PM EST by NWS Miami FL", "title_en": "Flash Flood Warning issued November 3 at 8:57PM EST until November 3 at 11:00PM EST by NWS Miami FL", "url": "https://www.defconlevel.com/alert/2026-11-04-nws-noaa-weather-flash-flood-warning-issued-november-3-at-8-57pm-est-until-november-3-at-11-00pm-est-by-nws-miami-fl"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The National Weather Service in Miami issued a Flash Flood Warning for Northern Broward County on November 3, valid until 11:00PM EST, stating that flash flooding was ongoing or expected after 2 to 3 inches of rain had already fallen. The item is an automated alert listing with no information on public response or outcomes.", "title": "Flash Flood Warning issued November 3 at 8:57PM EST until November 3 at 11:00PM EST by NWS Miami FL", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(273,'flood|US|sumner','flood','2026-11-04T04:23:26Z','2026-11-05T04:12:08Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": "US", "name": "National Weather Service Kansas City/Pleasant Hill", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "US", "name": "ABC17News", "type": "media"}, {"country": "US", "name": "KQ2", "type": "media"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "media"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "US", "name": "United States"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": "Sumner, Chariton County, Missouri, USA", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-04T04:15:09Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flood"], "id": 273, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:12:08Z", "lead_time": "until early Friday (crest forecast)", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item reports a flood warning and forecast of moderate flooding but gives no information on impacts or actions taken.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-04T04:15:04Z", "source_name": "abc17news.com", "title": "Flood Warning issued November 3 at 6:57PM CST until November 8 at 6:00AM CST by NWS Kansas City/Pleasant Hill MO - ABC17NEWS", "title_en": "Flood Warning issued November 3 at 6:57PM CST until November 8 at 6:00AM CST by NWS Kansas City/Pleasant Hill MO", "url": "https://abc17news.com/alerts/2026/11/03/flood-warning-issued-november-3-at-657pm-cst-until-november-8-at-600am-cst-by-nws-kansas-city-pleasant-hill-mo/"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-05T04:12:03Z", "source_name": "kq2.com", "title": "Flood Warning issued November 4 at 8:43AM CST until November 7 at 2:00AM CST by NWS Kansas City/Pleasant Hill MO - KQ2", "title_en": "Flood Warning issued November 4 at 8:43AM CST until November 7 at 2:00AM CST by NWS Kansas City/Pleasant Hill MO", "url": "https://www.kq2.com/weather/weather-alerts/2026/11/04/flood-warning-issued-november-4-at-843am-cst-until-november-7-at-200am-cst-by-nws-kansas-city-pleasant-hill-mo/"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The National Weather Service in Kansas City/Pleasant Hill issued a Flood Warning for the Grand River near Sumner, forecasting moderate flooding with a crest of 31.2 feet early Friday. The warning runs from November 3 to November 8, 2026, and was reported by a regional broadcaster. No impacts or response actions are reported in the snippet.", "title": "Flood Warning issued November 3 at 6:57PM CST until November 8 at 6:00AM CST by NWS Kansas City/Pleasant Hill MO", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(274,'flood|PH|apayao-abulug river basin','flood','2026-11-05T04:19:03Z','2026-11-05T04:12:10Z','2026-11-05','{"actions": ["Operationalization of a flood forecasting system for the Apayao-Abulug River Basin"], "agencies": [{"country": "PH", "name": "DOST-PAGASA", "type": "NMHS"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.9, "countries": [{"code": "PH", "name": "Philippines"}], "event_date": "2026-11-05", "event_location": "Apayao-Abulug River Basin, Philippines", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:12:10Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flood"], "id": 274, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:12:10Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes the launch of a flood forecasting system only; no outcomes of warnings are reported.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": null, "source_name": "PAGASA press releases", "title": "DOST-PAGASA OPERATIONALIZES APAYAO-ABULUG RIVER BASIN FLOOD FORECASTIN", "title_en": "DOST-PAGASA operationalizes Apayao-Abulug River Basin flood forecasting", "url": "https://pagasa.dost.gov.ph/press-release/234"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "DOST-PAGASA has operationalized a flood forecasting system for the Apayao-Abulug River Basin in the Philippines, strengthening hydrological monitoring and forecasting capacity for the area. The press release indicates a new or improved early warning capability, though the snippet provides no details on dissemination or outcomes.", "title": "DOST-PAGASA operationalizes Apayao-Abulug River Basin flood forecasting", "wmo_regions": ["II", "V"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(275,'','other','2026-11-05T04:19:04Z','2026-11-05T04:16:59Z','2026-11-05','{"actions": ["Launched a special section on its website providing weather forecasts for activities linked to Pope Leo XIV''s apostolic visit to Peru"], "agencies": [{"country": "PE", "name": "SENAMHI", "type": "NMHS"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.6, "countries": [{"code": "PE", "name": "Peru"}], "event_date": "2026-11-05", "event_location": "Peru", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:16:59Z", "hazard": "other", "hazards": ["other"], "id": 275, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:16:59Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes forecast provision for public planning but reports no outcome of hazardous weather warnings.", "pillars": [3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "SENAMHI Perú noticias", "title": "Visita del papa León XIV: SENAMHI habilita plataforma digital para consultar el pronóstico del tiempo", "title_en": "Pope Leo XIV''s visit: SENAMHI launches digital platform to check weather forecasts", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/senamhi/noticias/1468570-visita-del-papa-leon-xiv-senamhi-habilita-plataforma-digital-para-consultar-el-pronostico-del-tiempo"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "SENAMHI habilitó una sección especial en su web para que la ciudadanía consulte el pronóstico del tiempo durante las actividades de la visita apostólica del papa León XIV al Perú."}, "summary_en": "SENAMHI, Peru''s national meteorological and hydrological service, has launched a dedicated digital section on its website so citizens can consult weather forecasts for events linked to Pope Leo XIV''s apostolic visit. The item concerns public access to forecast information rather than a hazardous event or warning, so its relevance to early warning is marginal.", "title": "Pope Leo XIV''s visit: SENAMHI launches digital platform to check weather forecasts", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(276,'','earthquake','2026-11-05T04:19:04Z','2026-11-05T04:17:13Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": ["Nationwide tsunami alert drill conducted to evaluate response to a possible tsunami on the Peruvian coast", "Participation in earthquake-followed-by-tsunami drill (simulacro), in line with Resolution 001-2025-PCM/SGRD, marking World Tsunami Awareness Day"], "agencies": [{"country": "PE", "name": "INDECI", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "INDECI (Instituto Nacional de Defensa Civil)", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "PE", "name": "SISMATE", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other_national_agency"], "channels": ["cell_broadcast"], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "PE", "name": "Peru"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": "Callao, Peru", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:17:10Z", "hazard": "tsunami", "hazards": ["earthquake", "tsunami"], "id": 276, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:17:13Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item describes a planned drill exercise; no real event outcome is reported.", "pillars": [3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": null, "source_name": "INDECI Perú noticias", "title": "INDECI participó en Simulacro por Sismo seguido de Tsunami", "title_en": "INDECI participated in Earthquake-followed-by-Tsunami Drill", "url": "https://www.gob.pe/institucion/indeci/noticias/1469866-indeci-participo-en-simulacro-por-sismo-seguido-de-tsunami"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-04T15:28:29Z", "source_name": "La República (Perú) sociedad", "title": "Alerta de tsunami del Sismate sonó hoy en Perú: ¿por qué se activó y qué debes saber del simulacro de Indeci?", "title_en": "Tsunami alert from SISMATE sounded today in Peru: why it was activated and what you should know about the INDECI drill", "url": "https://larepublica.pe/sociedad/2026/11/04/alerta-de-tsunami-del-sismate-sono-hoy-en-peru-por-que-se-activo-y-que-debes-saber-del-simulacro-de-indeci-150040"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Un simulacro de INDECI contempló un terremoto de magnitud 8.8 Mw con epicentro a 60 km del Callao para evaluar la respuesta ante un posible tsunami en la costa peruana."}, "summary_en": "A SISMATE tsunami alert was sounded in Peru as part of an INDECI national drill simulating an 8.8 Mw earthquake about 60 km from Callao. The exercise aimed to evaluate the response to a possible tsunami on the Peruvian coast. The item concerns a simulation rather than a real hazard event.", "title": "Tsunami alert from SISMATE sounded today in Peru: why it was activated and what you should know about the INDECI drill", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(277,'','multi_hazard','2026-11-05T04:19:05Z','2026-11-05T04:11:21Z','2026-11-03','{"actions": ["Sharing of warnings through trusted community networks and local information intermediaries", "Preparedness and response support for floods and bushfires"], "agencies": [], "agency_types": [], "channels": ["community_networks"], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "AU", "name": "Australia"}], "event_date": "2026-11-03", "event_location": "Australia", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:11:21Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 277, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:11:21Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes how community networks strengthen warning sharing and resilience but reports no specific outcome of a particular warning.", "pillars": [3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-03T16:40:51Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Many local communities know how to communicate during disasters. Let’s learn from them", "title_en": "Many local communities know how to communicate during disasters. Let’s learn from them", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/news/many-local-communities-know-how-communicate-during-disasters-lets-learn-them"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The article highlights how trusted community networks and local information intermediaries in Australia improve the sharing of warnings for floods and bushfires. It argues that these local channels support preparedness, response and community resilience in disaster risk reduction. No specific warning event or outcome is quantified in the snippet.", "title": "Many local communities know how to communicate during disasters. Let’s learn from them", "wmo_regions": ["V"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(278,'','multi_hazard','2026-11-05T04:19:06Z','2026-11-05T04:11:21Z','2026-11-03','{"actions": [], "agencies": [], "agency_types": [], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.7, "countries": [], "event_date": "2026-11-03", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:11:21Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 278, "impacts": {"people_reached": 1509}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:11:21Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The study examines behavioral intentions in response to municipal messages across scenarios; no realised warning outcomes are reported in the snippet.", "pillars": [3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-03T16:53:06Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Municipal risk communication and public trust: Reducing counterproductive behaviors across emergency scenarios", "title_en": "Municipal risk communication and public trust: Reducing counterproductive behaviors across emergency scenarios", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/municipal-risk-communication-and-public-trust-reducing"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "A study of 1509 adults examined how municipal informational messages shaped behavioral intentions across five emergency scenarios: wildfires, flooding, hazardous materials, extreme weather, and civil unrest. It focuses on the communication dimension of emergency management, specifically how risk messages can reduce counterproductive public behaviors and maintain trust.", "title": "Municipal risk communication and public trust: Reducing counterproductive behaviors across emergency scenarios", "wmo_regions": []}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(279,'','multi_hazard','2026-11-05T04:19:08Z','2026-11-05T04:11:19Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": null, "name": "International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies (IFRC)", "type": "international"}], "agency_types": ["international"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.6, "countries": [], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:11:19Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 279, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:11:19Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet is a policy call for investment in early warning and climate adaptation at COP31; no specific warning event or outcome is described.", "pillars": [3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-04T09:33:06Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "COP31: IFRC calls for urgent investment to protect world''s most vulnerable", "title_en": "COP31: IFRC calls for urgent investment to protect world''s most vulnerable", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/world/cop31-ifrc-calls-urgent-investment-protect-worlds-most-vulnerable"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The IFRC calls on leaders at COP31 to scale up investment to protect vulnerable communities from extreme heat, floods, droughts and storms. It highlights an expected stronger El Niño as a driver of risk. The item is a policy statement relevant mainly to early warning investment rather than to a specific warning event.", "title": "COP31: IFRC calls for urgent investment to protect world''s most vulnerable", "wmo_regions": []}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(280,'','other','2026-11-05T04:19:10Z','2026-11-05T04:12:14Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": null, "name": "ASEAN Specialised Meteorological Centre", "type": "RSMC"}], "agency_types": ["RSMC"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.6, "countries": [], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:12:14Z", "hazard": "other", "hazards": ["other"], "id": 280, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:12:14Z", "lead_time": "two-week outlook (9-22 November 2026), issued 4 November 2026", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item is a subseasonal forecast outlook; no warning impacts or outcomes are reported in the snippet.", "pillars": [2], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-04T09:46:47Z", "source_name": "ASEAN Specialised Meteorological Centre", "title": "Subseasonal Weather Outlook (9 – 22 November 2026)", "title_en": "Subseasonal Weather Outlook (9 – 22 November 2026)", "url": "https://asmc.asean.org/subseasonal-weather-outlook-9-22-november-2026/"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The ASEAN Specialised Meteorological Centre issued a two-week subseasonal weather outlook covering 9-22 November 2026, with rainfall and temperature outlooks. Drier than usual conditions are predicted over much of the central and southern Maritime Continent and parts of the region. The item concerns forecast provision rather than a specific hazard event.", "title": "Subseasonal Weather Outlook (9 – 22 November 2026)", "wmo_regions": ["II", "V"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(281,'severe_storm|AR|misiones','severe_storm','2026-11-05T04:19:11Z','2026-11-05T04:17:12Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": "AR", "name": "Servicio Meteorológico Nacional", "type": "NMHS"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "AR", "name": "Argentina"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": "Misiones, Formosa and Salta, Argentina", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:17:12Z", "hazard": "severe_storm", "hazards": ["severe_storm"], "id": 281, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:17:12Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports an active orange alert in Misiones with rain damage to homes, but does not state whether the warnings led to specific protective actions or how well they performed.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-11-04T11:40:52Z", "source_name": "Clarín (Argentina) sociedad", "title": "Súper Niño 2026 en Argentina, EN VIVO: dónde habrá tormentas fuertes y qué provincias están en alerta este 4 de noviembre", "title_en": "El Niño 2026 in Argentina, LIVE: where strong storms will occur and which provinces are on alert this November 4", "url": "https://www.clarin.com/sociedad/super-nino-2026-argentina-vivo-tormentas-fuertes-provincias-alerta-4-noviembre_0_EDJcRzvs0L.html"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El Servicio Meteorológico Nacional mantiene una alerta naranja para Misiones, donde las lluvias ya causaron daños en viviendas, y rige una alerta amarilla por tormentas para Formosa y el centro-este de Salta."}, "summary_en": "Argentina''s National Meteorological Service (SMN) maintains an orange alert for Misiones, where rains have already caused damage to homes, and a yellow storm alert for Formosa and central-eastern Salta. The live coverage tracks where strong storms are expected and which provinces are under warning.", "title": "El Niño 2026 in Argentina, LIVE: where strong storms will occur and which provinces are on alert this November 4", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(282,'other|CA|montreal','other','2026-11-05T04:19:11Z','2026-11-05T04:11:21Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": "CA", "name": "McGill University", "type": "other"}], "agency_types": ["other"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "CA", "name": "Canada"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": "Montreal, Canada", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:11:21Z", "hazard": "other", "hazards": ["other"], "id": 282, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:11:21Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "negative", "outcome_justification": "The study reports that air quality advisories had only a modest impact on residents'' movements, indicating limited behavioural compliance with the warnings.", "pillars": [3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-04T11:43:50Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Study finds air quality warnings had only a modest impact on Montrealers’ movements", "title_en": "Study finds air quality warnings had only a modest impact on Montrealers'' movements", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/news/study-finds-air-quality-warnings-had-only-modest-impact-montrealers-movements"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "A McGill University study examined how air quality warnings affected the movements of Montreal residents and found only a modest effect on behaviour. The researcher suggests authorities pair advisories with practical incentives to improve compliance. The item concerns the effectiveness of warning communication and uptake rather than a specific hazard event.", "title": "Study finds air quality warnings had only a modest impact on Montrealers'' movements", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(283,'','multi_hazard','2026-11-05T04:19:12Z','2026-11-05T04:11:19Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": ["Commemorative activities on International Day for Disaster Risk Reduction under theme ''Resilience Starts at Home''", "Regional dialogue and community-led preparedness initiatives"], "agencies": [{"country": null, "name": "UN Office for Disaster Risk Reduction", "type": "international"}], "agency_types": ["international"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.6, "countries": [{"code": "OM", "name": "Oman"}, {"code": "QA", "name": "Qatar"}, {"code": "SY", "name": "Syria"}, {"code": "TN", "name": "Tunisia"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:11:19Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 283, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:11:19Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item describes awareness and preparedness activities promoting inclusive early warning systems but reports no specific warning events or outcomes.", "pillars": [3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-04T12:33:08Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "Tunisia: Arab States Mark IDDRR 2026 Through Regional Cooperation and Community-Led Preparedness", "title_en": "Tunisia: Arab States Mark IDDRR 2026 Through Regional Cooperation and Community-Led Preparedness", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/tunisia/arab-states-mark-iddrr-2026-through-regional-cooperation-and-community-led-preparedness"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "Governments, local authorities, civil society and communities in Tunisia, Syria, Qatar and Oman marked the International Day for Disaster Risk Reduction on 13 October 2026 under the theme ''Resilience Starts at Home''. Activities highlighted inclusive early warning systems and community-led preparedness. The item reports no specific warning events or outcomes.", "title": "Tunisia: Arab States Mark IDDRR 2026 Through Regional Cooperation and Community-Led Preparedness", "wmo_regions": ["I", "II", "VI"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(284,'','tsunami','2026-11-05T04:19:13Z','2026-11-05T04:11:21Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": null, "name": "UNDRR", "type": "international"}, {"country": "JP", "name": "Permanent Mission of Japan in Geneva", "type": "other"}], "agency_types": ["international", "other"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.6, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:11:21Z", "hazard": "tsunami", "hazards": ["tsunami"], "id": 284, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:11:21Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes an awareness event showcasing tsunami innovations but reports no specific warning, event outcome or dissemination.", "pillars": [1, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-04T15:57:52Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "UNDRR and Japan showcase tsunami innovation at Geneva policy dialogue", "title_en": "UNDRR and Japan showcase tsunami innovation at Geneva policy dialogue", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/news/undrr-and-japan-showcase-tsunami-innovation-geneva-policy-dialogue"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-04T15:57:52Z", "source_name": "UNDRR news", "title": "UNDRR and Japan showcase tsunami innovation at Geneva policy dialogue", "title_en": "UNDRR and Japan showcase tsunami innovation at Geneva policy dialogue", "url": "https://www.undrr.org/news/undrr-and-japan-showcase-tsunami-innovation-geneva-policy-dialogue"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "UNDRR and the Permanent Mission of Japan in Geneva held an innovation showcase and policy dialogue to mark World Tsunami Awareness Day on 5 November. The event focused on tsunami innovation, which may relate to early warning and risk knowledge, though the snippet gives no specifics on warning systems.", "title": "UNDRR and Japan showcase tsunami innovation at Geneva policy dialogue", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(285,'flood|CN|dajiangou','flash_flood','2026-11-05T04:19:14Z','2026-11-05T04:11:21Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": [], "agencies": [], "agency_types": [], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.6, "countries": [{"code": "CN", "name": "China"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": "Dajiangou, China", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:11:21Z", "hazard": "flash_flood", "hazards": ["flash_flood"], "id": 285, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:11:21Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item is a conceptual commentary with simulations; no actual warning outcome is reported.", "pillars": [2], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-04T17:58:26Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Toward health-aware urban flood resilience: A conceptual framework linking drainage conditions to flood forecasting and control", "title_en": "Toward health-aware urban flood resilience: A conceptual framework linking drainage conditions to flood forecasting and control", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/toward-health-aware-urban-flood-resilience-conceptual"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "This commentary proposes a conceptual framework that integrates drainage condition, such as blockage and sediment, into urban flood forecasting and management. Dajiangou simulations indicate that blocked and sediment-laden drainage can increase peak surface-water depths, which would affect forecast accuracy. The item addresses the detection and forecasting pillar of early warning rather than an observed warning event.", "title": "Toward health-aware urban flood resilience: A conceptual framework linking drainage conditions to flood forecasting and control", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(286,'named|melissa','tropical_cyclone','2026-11-05T04:19:14Z','2026-11-05T04:11:21Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": ["Storm standards assessed", "Reactive relief assessed", "Insurance payouts"], "agencies": [], "agency_types": [], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "JM", "name": "Jamaica"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": "Jamaica", "event_name": "Hurricane Melissa", "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:11:21Z", "hazard": "tropical_cyclone", "hazards": ["tropical_cyclone"], "id": 286, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:11:21Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "negative", "outcome_justification": "The report finds storm standards, power failures and reactive relief weakened preparedness, indicating shortcomings in preparedness and response despite insurance payouts.", "pillars": [4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-04T18:00:05Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Higher ground: Lessons from Hurricane Melissa for resilience, relief, and recovery", "title_en": "Higher ground: Lessons from Hurricane Melissa for resilience, relief, and recovery", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/higher-ground-lessons-hurricane-melissa-resilience-relief"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "A PreventionWeb report assesses Jamaica''s resilience to Hurricane Melissa and finds that storm standards, power failures and reactive relief weakened preparedness, despite insurance payouts. It highlights the need for stronger infrastructure, service continuity and finance reform to improve preparedness and response to future storms.", "title": "Higher ground: Lessons from Hurricane Melissa for resilience, relief, and recovery", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(287,'other|US|california','other','2026-11-05T04:19:15Z','2026-11-05T04:12:08Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": "US", "name": "NOAA", "type": "other_national_agency"}, {"country": "US", "name": "US National Weather Service", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["other_national_agency"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.3, "countries": [{"code": "US", "name": "United States"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": "California, United States", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:12:08Z", "hazard": "other", "hazards": ["other"], "id": 287, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:12:08Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "Snippet contains only navigation text and an image credit; no details on warnings, forecasts, or outcomes are given.", "pillars": [], "review": true, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-04T19:43:03Z", "source_name": "NOAA / US National Weather Service news", "title": "California coastal water levels break records", "title_en": "California coastal water levels break records", "url": "https://www.noaa.gov/stories/california-coastal-water-levels-break-records"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "A NOAA / National Weather Service story titled ''California coastal water levels break records'' is indexed, but the snippet provides no content beyond page navigation. Whether it covers early warnings or forecasts of coastal flooding cannot be determined from the available text.", "title": "California coastal water levels break records", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(288,'landslide|JP|mikurajima','landslide','2026-11-05T04:19:15Z','2026-11-05T04:12:17Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": ["JMA issued a Level 4 landslide danger warning (土砂災害危険警報) for Mikurajima village", "JMA indicated that municipalities would issue evacuation information"], "agencies": [{"country": "JP", "name": "Japan Meteorological Agency (JMA)", "type": "NMHS"}, {"country": "JP", "name": "Mikurajima village government", "type": "other_national_agency"}], "agency_types": ["NMHS", "other_national_agency"], "channels": ["other"], "confidence": 0.9, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": "Mikurajima, Tokyo, Japan", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:12:17Z", "hazard": "landslide", "hazards": ["landslide"], "id": 288, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["ja"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:12:17Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports the warning issuance and that evacuation information would follow from local governments, but gives no information on actual evacuations or results.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-11-04T19:44:00Z", "source_name": "NHK ニュース 社会", "title": "東京 御蔵島村に「レベル4土砂災害危険警報」", "title_en": "Tokyo: \"Level 4 landslide danger warning\" issued for Mikurajima village", "url": "https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261105de70712"}], "summaries_original": {"ja": "気象庁は5日午前4時33分、東京・伊豆諸島の御蔵島村にレベル4土砂災害危険警報を発表しました。土砂災害の危険性が非常に高くなっているため、厳重な警戒が必要です。気象庁は、自治体からの避難の情報を基に…"}, "summary_en": "The Japan Meteorological Agency issued a Level 4 landslide danger warning for Mikurajima village in the Izu Islands, Tokyo, at 4:33 a.m. on the 5th, indicating very high landslide risk requiring strict vigilance. JMA stated that municipalities would issue evacuation information based on the warning. The snippet does not report dissemination details or outcomes.", "title": "Tokyo: \"Level 4 landslide danger warning\" issued for Mikurajima village", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(289,'','multi_hazard','2026-11-05T04:19:16Z','2026-11-05T04:11:19Z','2026-11-04','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": null, "name": "Famine Early Warning System Network (FEWS NET)", "type": "other"}], "agency_types": ["other"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "ET", "name": "Ethiopia"}, {"code": "KE", "name": "Kenya"}, {"code": "SO", "name": "Somalia"}, {"code": "SS", "name": "South Sudan"}, {"code": "ZA", "name": "South Africa"}], "event_date": "2026-11-04", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:11:19Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 289, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:11:19Z", "lead_time": "one-week outlook for 2026-11-05 to 2026-11-11", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes forecast hazard outlooks (rainfall deficits, flooding risks, heat) but reports no warning dissemination outcomes or actions taken.", "pillars": [2], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-04T20:33:05Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "World: Global Weather Hazards Summary, November 05, 2026 – November 11, 2026", "title_en": "World: Global Weather Hazards Summary, November 05, 2026 – November 11, 2026", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/world/global-weather-hazards-summary-november-05-2026-november-11-2026"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "FEWS NET''s weekly global weather hazards summary provides forecast outlooks for the week of 5-11 November 2026 as El Niño strengthens, highlighting rainfall deficits in parts of Africa, Central Asia, Central America, Hispaniola and northern South America. It flags high flooding risk over eastern South Africa and inundation in South Sudan''s Sudd wetlands, along with hot conditions across the Sahel and southern Africa. The item is a forecast advisory rather than a report of warning dissemination or outcomes.", "title": "World: Global Weather Hazards Summary, November 05, 2026 – November 11, 2026", "wmo_regions": ["I", "II", "IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(290,'','multi_hazard','2026-11-05T04:19:19Z','2026-11-05T04:11:19Z','2026-11-05','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": null, "name": "Famine Early Warning System Network (FEWS NET)", "type": "international"}], "agency_types": ["international"], "channels": ["website"], "confidence": 0.6, "countries": [{"code": "LK", "name": "Sri Lanka"}], "event_date": "2026-11-05", "event_location": "Sri Lanka", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-11-05T04:11:19Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 290, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-11-05T04:11:19Z", "lead_time": "October 2026 to May 2027 outlook period", "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item is a food security outlook forecasting stress conditions; it does not report on outcomes of warnings or actions taken.", "pillars": [2], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-11-05T02:55:17Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "Sri Lanka Food Security Outlook, October 2026 - May 2027: Widespread Stressed (IPC Phase 2) through January ahead of maha harvest", "title_en": "Sri Lanka Food Security Outlook, October 2026 - May 2027: Widespread Stressed (IPC Phase 2) through January ahead of maha harvest", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/sri-lanka/sri-lanka-food-security-outlook-october-2026-may-2027-widespread-stressed-ipc-phase-2-through-january-ahead-maha-harvest"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "FEWS NET''s food security outlook for Sri Lanka projects widespread Stressed (IPC Phase 2) conditions from October 2026 through January 2027, during the lean season. The outlook notes that second inter-monsoon and northeast monsoon rains are likely to bring flooding, high winds, landslides and rough seas, periodically disrupting agriculture and fishing. The item is relevant mainly as a forecast of compounding hazard-driven food insecurity.", "title": "Sri Lanka Food Security Outlook, October 2026 - May 2027: Widespread Stressed (IPC Phase 2) through January ahead of maha harvest", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
